# game/ep6.rpy:19
translate chinese ep6_ad6e165b:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:20
translate chinese ep6_239652f8:

    # e "It's not that early."
    e "也没有很早了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:21
translate chinese ep6_a705ca5f:

    # mc "Well... yeah... but I never saw you smile at least once before. So what's with today?"
    mc "好吧……确实……但是我以前从来没见你笑过。今天有什么特别的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:22
translate chinese ep6_998c00a5:

    # e "...It's my birthday."
    e "……今天是我的生日。"

# game/ep6.rpy:23
translate chinese ep6_0292c56e:

    # mc "For real~?!"
    mc "真的吗~？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:24
translate chinese ep6_5f6a0eb7:

    # e "Please don't shout."
    e "别喊那么大声。"

# game/ep6.rpy:25
translate chinese ep6_7d67eb0f:

    # mc "Wait, are you being serious?"
    mc "等等，你认真的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:26
translate chinese ep6_006d279b:

    # e "I'm not joking in the very least."
    e "至少我没在开玩笑。"

# game/ep6.rpy:27
translate chinese ep6_39b46ce9:

    # mc "Huh... But you never celebrated your birthday in high school."
    mc "嗯……但是你高中的时候从来不过生日啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:28
translate chinese ep6_6bb48998:

    # mc "Like... everyone would celebrate theirs. I thought yours was outside of the school year."
    mc "明明其他人都会庆祝自己的生日的。所以我还以为你的生日是在寒暑假的时候。"

# game/ep6.rpy:31
translate chinese ep6_cb4e5ae9:

    # e "No, I never celebrated my birthday after..."
    e "不，我在那之后就不再过生日了。自从……"

# game/ep6.rpy:32
translate chinese ep6_ad6e165b_1:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:33
translate chinese ep6_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:34
translate chinese ep6_6a6c2241:

    # e "...Nevermind."
    e "……没什么。"

# game/ep6.rpy:39
translate chinese ep6_a787f5c9:

    # mc "Well, don't be sad now! It's your birthday, isn't it?"
    mc "哎呀，别这么伤心嘛！今天不是你的生日吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:40
translate chinese ep6_8612b981:

    # mc "Just keep on smiling! Haha!"
    mc "所以要多笑一笑！哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:41
translate chinese ep6_ca97e8dd:

    # e "Mhf..."
    e "啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:44
translate chinese ep6_eb55f14e:

    # e "O-okay..."
    e "嗯……好的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:45
translate chinese ep6_494508c5:

    # mc "Good!"
    mc "很好！"

# game/ep6.rpy:46
translate chinese ep6_cb1c8712:

    # mc "I'm going to work, then. It's almost time for today's opening."
    mc "我要去上班了。马上就到开店的时间了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:48
translate chinese ep6_a1ae1b95:

    # mc "Well... if you say so..."
    mc "好吧……你不愿意说就算了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:49
translate chinese ep6_cb1c8712_1:

    # mc "I'm going to work, then. It's almost time for today's opening."
    mc "我要去上班了。马上就到开店的时间了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:59
translate chinese ep6_a49536a0:

    # e "Where do you work?"
    e "你在哪工作？"

# game/ep6.rpy:60
translate chinese ep6_f533f851:

    # mc "Where else? At the town's best burger shack, of course! Woody Burger! Hahaha!"
    mc "还能是哪？当然是市里最好的汉堡店啊！胡迪汉堡！哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:61
translate chinese ep6_223481aa:

    # e "{i}...He's still the same airhead even after so long, huh?"
    e "{i}……过了这么久，他还是和以前一样笨笨的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:62
translate chinese ep6_471e0762:

    # e "{i}...I guess that's why I liked him in the first place, he never gets boring."
    e "{i}……可能就是这样我才会喜欢他吧，他永远不会让我觉得无聊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:63
translate chinese ep6_a3a30d2e:

    # e "I'll come with you."
    e "我和你一起吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:64
translate chinese ep6_84224f6e:

    # mc "Uhh... Isn't your station far from here?"
    mc "呃……警察局不是离这很远吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:65
translate chinese ep6_ba96c670:

    # e "I never told you where I work, why would you think that it is?"
    e "我可没告诉过你我在哪工作，你为什么会觉得远？"

# game/ep6.rpy:66
translate chinese ep6_7031b987:

    # mc "Well... There are two stations here so..."
    mc "好吧……市里确实有两个警察局……"

# game/ep6.rpy:67
translate chinese ep6_b24bb4f0:

    # e "Mine is not that far from where you work, don't worry. I always just walk back and forth."
    e "我在的那个离你工作的地方不远，不用担心。我平常也都是走过去的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:68
translate chinese ep6_46581f5a:

    # mc "Hmm... If that's the case..."
    mc "嗯……如果这样的话……"

# game/ep6.rpy:69
translate chinese ep6_c0ad99a8:

    # mc "Alright then, let's go!"
    mc "好吧，我们出发吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:78
translate chinese ep6_54b0ffb4:

    # e "I should be asking you. Why are you so happy today?"
    e "我也想问你。你怎么今天这么开心？"

# game/ep6.rpy:79
translate chinese ep6_3393fbe8:

    # e "I know that you still don't trust me and Aine, so you don't come and talk to me very often."
    e "我知道你现在还是不信任我和艾妮，所以基本都不会跟我说话。"

# game/ep6.rpy:80
translate chinese ep6_b9153c17:

    # e "Unless... I'm the one who starts a conversation first."
    e "除非……是我先去找你的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:83
translate chinese ep6_3b8e7d99:

    # mc "It's not that I'm happy or anything. I mean, it's Sunday. I just want to start the new week with a bang, you know?"
    mc "我也没有很开心还是什么的。只是，今天是周日。我想以愉快的心情开始新的一周。"

# game/ep6.rpy:85
translate chinese ep6_22340383:

    # mc "Well... It would be such a waste to start the new week negatively."
    mc "毕竟……要是一周伊始却有个坏心情，那就太浪费了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:87
translate chinese ep6_9945a23e:

    # mc "In fact, I'm always like this. You'll just have to get used to it. Haha."
    mc "我一直都是这样的。你慢慢习惯就好。哈哈。"

# game/ep6.rpy:90
translate chinese ep6_fb2600a6:

    # mc "And to tell you the truth..."
    mc "而且实话跟你讲……"

# game/ep6.rpy:91
translate chinese ep6_02e8c155:

    # mc "Yes, I still don't trust you and Aine. But what's the point of distancing myself from you two?"
    mc "是的，我还是不能相信你和艾妮。但是即便如此，我刻意跟你俩保持距离也没有意义。"

# game/ep6.rpy:92
translate chinese ep6_7f45bed1:

    # mc "Yeah, you gave me a hard time, mopped the floor with me, and all sorts of things that I don't even want to recall."
    mc "你们确实欺负过我，把我当狗使唤过，还有各种我连回忆都不想回忆的事情。"

# game/ep6.rpy:93
translate chinese ep6_b98a4af2:

    # mc "But I'm not an asshole, at the very least. I did let you come into my house, didn't I?"
    mc "但我至少不是什么坏人。我甚至还让你们住进我家了，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:94
translate chinese ep6_f081fde8:

    # mc "Now that I know part of the truth, it at least gives me comfort that I somehow did not do the wrong thing."
    mc "现在我已经知道了一部分真相，所以我至少知道，我没有做错什么。"

# game/ep6.rpy:95
translate chinese ep6_e36a1bf2:

    # mc "Grudge? Revenge? Pff!"
    mc "怨恨？复仇？切！"

# game/ep6.rpy:96
translate chinese ep6_cb1e7060:

    # mc "Fuck that shit! What do I get from doing or having those? It would absolutely not bring me any benefit!"
    mc "那些东西有什么屁用！整天恨人能让我得到什么？对我没有任何好处！"

# game/ep6.rpy:97
translate chinese ep6_44235c3d:

    # mc "I just want to be happy and set my life straight, you know?"
    mc "我只想每天过得开心，让生活走上正轨，好吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:98
translate chinese ep6_2fd42f4b:

    # mc "However, one wrong move, and I will confidently throw you out of the window. Ahaha!"
    mc "但是呢，你们要是敢动一点歪脑筋，我就立马把你们扫地出门。啊哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:99
translate chinese ep6_2f082c72:

    # e "I know that, don't worry."
    e "我知道，不用担心。"

# game/ep6.rpy:102
translate chinese ep6_00b4f603:

    # mc "Do you at least feel a bit of remorse for what you did to me back then?"
    mc "你现在对你以前做的事有感觉后悔吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:103
translate chinese ep6_4de3e266:

    # e "Yes, I do..."
    e "是的，我很后悔……"

# game/ep6.rpy:104
translate chinese ep6_f0edc242:

    # mc "Then, that's enough reason for me to talk to you. Although, you still have to do something else if you really want me to totally forgive you."
    mc "那，我就已经有足够的理由跟你说话了。不过，你要是想让我完全原谅你，依然还是要做更多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:105
translate chinese ep6_52fea606:

    # mc "No matter what reason you had for your actions, it's still you who did it. Your actions, your responsibility."
    mc "不管背后有什么原因，你终究是做过坏事。你的行动，你要自己负责。"

# game/ep6.rpy:106
translate chinese ep6_b0e747a5:

    # mc "And I'm gonna leave that up to you, because I honestly don't know what it should be. HAHAHA!"
    mc "但具体要怎么赎罪，我就交给你自己去想了。因为我其实也不知道该怎么让你赎罪。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:107
translate chinese ep6_1ba39504:

    # e "You're crazy..."
    e "你真是疯了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:110
translate chinese ep6_1ab471a8:

    # mc "Well, yeah! Call me cra-"
    mc "哈哈，确实！我是有点——"

# game/ep6.rpy:119
translate chinese ep6_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:120
translate chinese ep6_ea3b47e0:

    # mc "...Huh?"
    mc "……等等？"

# game/ep6.rpy:121
translate chinese ep6_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "怎么了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:122
translate chinese ep6_d8ed2fa0:

    # mc "...Nothing, I just... felt something weird."
    mc "……没事，我只是……突然感觉有点奇怪。"

# game/ep6.rpy:123
translate chinese ep6_a9aba9d4:

    # e "{i}Did he remember something? I better change the topic. Besides, I'm really curious about something...{/i}"
    e "{i}他是想起来什么了吗？我最好赶快换个话题。而且，我确实也对有些事很好奇……{/i}"

# game/ep6.rpy:124
translate chinese ep6_f43be1a2:

    # e "I'm actually curious about you back then... Why didn't you fight back? Was it really just because of your feelings for Aine?"
    e "我其实很想知道……为什么当时你不反抗呢？真的只是因为你喜欢艾妮吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:125
translate chinese ep6_0260e103:

    # mc "...Now that you mention it again... yeah, that was one of the reasons."
    mc "……现在再想想……是啊，那确实是原因之一。"

# game/ep6.rpy:126
translate chinese ep6_8bf72f18:

    # mc "That's probably one of the worst decisions I made in the past."
    mc "那可能是我过去做过的最错误的决定之一。"

# game/ep6.rpy:127
translate chinese ep6_f6e6a2f6:

    # mc "Ugh! I was such a derp, that's for sure!"
    mc "唉！我当时实在太傻了，这是肯定的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:128
translate chinese ep6_2021e2b9:

    # mc "Although... there's another reason why I tried to endure it."
    mc "但是……我选择默默忍受还有另外一个原因。"

# game/ep6.rpy:129
translate chinese ep6_0fba19b8:

    # e "Hm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:130
translate chinese ep6_f55ccd3d:

    # mc "...I just had a gut feeling, an impression that I wasn't even sure of before, but... There were times when I caught her napping."
    mc "……我只是有种直觉，虽然没有任何根据……当时有几次，我正好碰见艾妮在睡觉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:131
translate chinese ep6_14b37a91:

    # mc "It was like she was in real pain, and she kept on mumbling about something I couldn't understand. I tried patting her head once, and for some reason, she was suddenly comforted."
    mc "她好像在梦里承受着莫大的痛苦，嘴里还一直喃喃说着我听不懂的东西。我有次试着摸了摸她的头，不知道怎么回事，她好像一下子就安心了许多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:132
translate chinese ep6_57dcf27a:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah... I know what you are going to say... I was foolish to do that for the girl who mistreated me, but I wanted to find out the real reason why she was doing that."
    mc "是啊，我知道你想说什么……我居然会对霸凌我的女生这么温柔，我肯定是个傻子……但我只是想知道她到底为什么会那样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:133
translate chinese ep6_42bce9fc:

    # mc "I confessed to her, alright..."
    mc "确实，我向她表白了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:134
translate chinese ep6_525fa406:

    # mc "But that was too shallow a reason to do all those things to me, even for her."
    mc "但是，即便对她这种人而言，这也实在不像是让她一直霸凌我的充分原因。"

# game/ep6.rpy:135
translate chinese ep6_157f244b:

    # mc "In fact, before the school year started, we already..."
    mc "其实，在学年开始之前，我们就已经……"

# game/ep6.rpy:136
translate chinese ep6_3b21f354_1:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:137
translate chinese ep6_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "怎么了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:138
translate chinese ep6_e720d2ff:

    # mc "Ah, nothing. Nevermind that."
    mc "啊，没事。不用在意。"

# game/ep6.rpy:139
translate chinese ep6_b615e681:

    # mc "Anyway, my curiosity sure got me killed. And I regretted the fact that I did all those things for her."
    mc "不管怎么说，我的好奇心把我害惨了。而且我现在很后悔我以前对她做的那些事。"

# game/ep6.rpy:140
translate chinese ep6_c3db9fa4:

    # e "You could've just stayed away from us."
    e "你当时只要离我们远点就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:141
translate chinese ep6_cffa18ac:

    # mc "How could I? We were in the same class!"
    mc "怎么可能？我们在一个班啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:142
translate chinese ep6_d1d979f9:

    # e "Transferred schools, then?"
    e "那就转学？"

# game/ep6.rpy:143
translate chinese ep6_2cf7ca50:

    # mc "I'm not a pussy to run away. But even if I wanted to, it wouldn't have been that easy — our high school was the only one in this city."
    mc "我不是个会逃跑的懦夫。而且即使我想，也没有那么简单——毕竟全市就只有一所高中。"

# game/ep6.rpy:144
translate chinese ep6_466c189c:

    # mc "With [landlady!t] overseas, it would've been hard to do. It was still thanks to her that all this shit stopped, though."
    mc "再说，当时[landlady!t]人在国外，就更是难上加难了。虽然之后霸凌结束也是多亏了她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:145
translate chinese ep6_66491ce2:

    # mc "But hey, nobody's perfect. And I changed, mentally and physically, I am not the same person I once was."
    mc "但毕竟人无完人嘛。而且我也变了，不管是身体上还是心理上都变了。我不再是从前那个我了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:146
translate chinese ep6_e65ae650:

    # e "Are you sure about that?"
    e "你确定吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:147
translate chinese ep6_cb2312ca:

    # mc "Why not give me the benefit of the doubt? Ahahaha!"
    mc "你怎么总是下意识怀疑我呢？啊哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:148
translate chinese ep6_4ed49d4d:

    # e "{i}I still wonder what Miss Klara did to make the school principal accept her request. I was certain the principal was one of Hera's lackeys."
    e "{i}我还是不知道克拉拉太太到底做了什么才让校长同意了她的要求。我很确定校长也是赫拉的手下之一。"

# game/ep6.rpy:149
translate chinese ep6_9a23c7cf:

    # e "Did you know that the principal was one of Aine's mother's lackeys?"
    e "你知道校长也是艾妮的母亲的手下吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:150
translate chinese ep6_65d4fea8:

    # mc "Well, I'm not shocked to know that now. She gives me the impression that nothing is impossible for her."
    mc "嗯，现在就算知道是这样我也不会惊讶了。她给我的感觉就是手眼通天，无所不能。"

# game/ep6.rpy:151
translate chinese ep6_6111caf2:

    # e "So what's your plan? Have you come up with anything yet?"
    e "那你有计划了吗？有想到什么主意吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:152
translate chinese ep6_45bf3e7d:

    # mc "Yes. I wanted to talk to her personally and hear everything from her own mouth."
    mc "是的。我想和她见面，听她亲口说出所有真相。"

# game/ep6.rpy:153
translate chinese ep6_c509e7ac:

    # mc "Don't get me wrong, I'm not doing this for you guys. I still think your plan was too stupid for a detective to come up with, you know?"
    mc "别误会我，我可不是为了你们。我还是觉得你作为一个警察和侦探，想出来的那个结婚计划也太蠢了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:154
translate chinese ep6_4952893f:

    # mc "Especially since you know her very well."
    mc "特别是你明明也很了解她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:157
translate chinese ep6_98e11ef1:

    # e "*sighs*..."
    e "*叹气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:158
translate chinese ep6_b7fc7a74:

    # mc "I'm doing this for my own peace of mind. Will I help you or not? That depends on her answers."
    mc "我做这些都是为了让我能真正放下。我到底会不会帮你呢？这就要看她到时给我的答案了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:167
translate chinese ep6_42f4a46a:

    # e "I see..."
    e "我知道了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:168
translate chinese ep6_175c8de7:

    # e "But how will you do it? It's not that easy to get even a minute of her time."
    e "但你打算怎么做呢？普通人想见她哪怕一分钟都是不可能的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:169
translate chinese ep6_07f544f6:

    # mc "I know someone who's close to her. She managed to arrange a meeting with me and Hera in a cafe less than three weeks from now."
    mc "我认识一个跟她很亲近的人。她帮我安排了三周之后跟赫拉在一家咖啡店见面。"

# game/ep6.rpy:170
translate chinese ep6_2c3fe292:

    # e "Good luck with that, then. Let me know what you two speak about once it's done."
    e "那我就祝你好运了。你俩谈过之后请告诉我进展。"

# game/ep6.rpy:171
translate chinese ep6_1afa6f1d:

    # mc "You really don't have a single clue about it?"
    mc "关于赫拉你真的什么也不知道了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:172
translate chinese ep6_0554a742:

    # e "I already told you what I know."
    e "我知道的东西已经全都告诉你了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:173
translate chinese ep6_eaacd818:

    # e "{i}And probably what I can disclose..."
    e "{i}准确来说，是目前我能透露的所有东西……"

# game/ep6.rpy:174
translate chinese ep6_821b3464:

    # mc "Well, that sucks... I'll see what I can do, then. I'm not afraid of her."
    mc "好吧，这可不是什么好事……那之后我看看我还有什么能做的吧。我不怕她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:175
translate chinese ep6_8d8a263c:

