    mc "而且你都这么累了，肯定不能让你一起来啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:438
translate chinese ep6_363a2d73:

    # mc "I can already see Miss Jess being over the moon with the report I'll send her later."
    mc "我把报告给婕斯小姐发过去之后，她肯定要高兴得上天了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:439
translate chinese ep6_6bbd659c:

    # l "Experience really does speak for itself, huh?"
    l "看来熟能生巧确实不假啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:440
translate chinese ep6_01d677bc:

    # mc "Yeah, you got that right. Even though you can't always be good with some things, if you just keep on pushing, you'll eventually be able to get the grasp of it."
    mc "是啊，可不是吗。哪怕有些事你不擅长，只要不断逼着自己，最后总会找到窍门的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:441
translate chinese ep6_5b93cd1e:

    # mc "And I can see that from you. You've improved a lot in the past few days."
    mc "而且你也是这样。这段时间来你的进步非常大。"

# game/ep6.rpy:442
translate chinese ep6_7b470def:

    # mc "A great man once said..."
    mc "一位伟人曾经说过……"

# game/ep6.rpy:443
translate chinese ep6_e51efc24:

    # mc "'A jack of all trades is a master of none, but oftentimes better than a master of one.'"
    mc "什么都懂的人或许什么都不精通，但这时常要比只精通一件事要好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:444
translate chinese ep6_8cb18a00:

    # l "I think I can agree with you. I don't think I could've handled that many customers on my own if I was still panicking like I used to."
    l "我同意你的说法。要是我还跟以前那样容易慌张，今天肯定没法应付那么多客人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:445
translate chinese ep6_b32bb68e:

    # mc "See? You're getting used to the pressure!"
    mc "看吧？你已经习惯这里的压力了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:446
translate chinese ep6_07e068eb:

    # l "Your advice was really helpful, [mc!t]. Thank you."
    l "你的建议很有作用，[mc!t]。谢谢你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:447
translate chinese ep6_341c95fa:

    # mc "Hey, no worries! I'm always happy to help!"
    mc "不用在意！我永远乐意帮忙！"

# game/ep6.rpy:450
translate chinese ep6_6379690b:

    # l "I've been a little clumsy since I was a kid. Messing things up here and there."
    l "我从小时候开始就有点笨笨的。总是会搞砸一些事情。"

# game/ep6.rpy:451
translate chinese ep6_3f5c2ee2:

    # l "Even though this place isn't much to be proud of, I think I found another place where I belong. *giggles*"
    l "尽管这里不是什么伟大的地方，但我觉得我算是找到另一个归宿了。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:452
translate chinese ep6_e02ed8ba:

    # mc "Another place? You mean... there's another one?"
    mc "另一个？你是说……除了这里还有别的地方吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:453
translate chinese ep6_eddfba7a:

    # l "Ahh... The good old high school days..."
    l "啊……那是高中时候的事情了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:454
translate chinese ep6_bbd84ab3:

    # mc "High school days? Now I'm curious."
    mc "高中？你现在可勾起我的好奇心了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:457
translate chinese ep6_b276fe68:

    # l "Yep~! I was once a track and field athlete. I don't want to brag, but I was good at it."
    l "是啊~！我以前是田径运动员。我不是炫耀，但我的水平可是很不错的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:458
translate chinese ep6_3ba31742:

    # mc "I think you already did, just now, Lily."
    mc "我觉得你就是在炫耀，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:459
translate chinese ep6_4845f882:

    # l "Well, a little is fine?"
    l "就一小下，也没关系吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:461
translate chinese ep6_01e127f0:

    # mc "Haha! Go on. Don't mind me, I'm just pulling your leg."
    mc "哈哈！没事，你继续说吧。我就是故意损你一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:462
translate chinese ep6_79185a46:

    # l "Jeez..."
    l "你啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:466
translate chinese ep6_e92ec8e8:

    # l "Well, I guess... that's what you'd call an innate talent."
    l "嗯，我觉得……这就是所谓的天赋吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:469
translate chinese ep6_b3ec5188:

    # l "I joined the club for extra-curricular activity. I didn't intend to put all my focus on it. All I wanted was to get an extra grade, nothing more."
    l "我是为了参加课外活动才加入田径社团的。我本来没打算全身心地投入。我只想赚点额外的绩点，仅此而已。"

# game/ep6.rpy:472
translate chinese ep6_9bca4daa:

    # l "But as soon as I set foot on the track, I felt something in me that I never felt before."
    l "但我刚把脚踏上赛道的那一刹那，全身就有一种前所未有的感觉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:473
translate chinese ep6_7f1e08ed:

    # l "It's weird to say, but my feet felt like they belonged there. That they're meant to be on the track."
    l "很难描述出来，就是，我觉得我的双腿就应该属于那里。它们存在的意义就是在跑道上奔跑。"

# game/ep6.rpy:476
translate chinese ep6_8a02a22a:

    # l "A place where competitors give their all to reach the finish line is where I found my passion."
    l "运动员们拼尽全力，只为了第一个冲过终点线。我觉得这就是我毕生的热爱所在。"

# game/ep6.rpy:479
translate chinese ep6_2adf0d42:

    # l "It's not flashy compared to the other sports, that's for sure."
    l "跟其他运动比起来，跑步没什么可看的，这是事实。"

# game/ep6.rpy:480
translate chinese ep6_c6d36a08:

    # l "But the sound of people cheering for you, the immense pressure when you're at the starting line, the other runners' talents looming over you, and the joy of winning a race."
    l "但是，这里有观众们响亮的欢呼，有站在起点时巨大的压力，有其他跑者奋力的追赶，还有赢得比赛后无尽的喜悦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:481
translate chinese ep6_6d01cb6b:

    # l "It all captivated my heart."
    l "这一切都让我为之心旷神怡。"

# game/ep6.rpy:482
translate chinese ep6_a8b1cfa3:

    # l "After a year, I was already the main runner in the one and two hundred meter dash."
    l "一年之后，我已经是一百米和二百米短跑的主力了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:483
translate chinese ep6_8d7f196a:

    # l "Don't get me wrong, it was tough to get to that position. There were times I almost puked my stomach out because of our coach's intense training."
    l "别想得太轻松，想达到那个水平可是很不容易的。都不知道有多少次，教练把我折磨到连隔夜饭都吐出来了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:484
translate chinese ep6_f4d58f28:

    # l "Even so, I climbed to the top faster than all my other teammates."
    l "就是这样，我最后才成了队里跑得最快的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:485
translate chinese ep6_53882157:

    # mc "Really? Was it really that tough?"
    mc "真的吗？真的有那么辛苦吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:486
translate chinese ep6_5a6b0334:

    # l "Yeah, some people see it as a simple sport because all we do is just... well... run. It's not as cool as basketball or soccer, and that's true."
    l "是的，有些人觉得跑步是很简单的运动，因为毕竟就只需要跑而已。看着确实没有篮球或者足球那么有观赏性，这是事实。"

# game/ep6.rpy:487
translate chinese ep6_19c711cf:

    # l "But, that's not all there is to it. The sport is simple, but the training is not."
    l "但是，并不是这样的。跑步本身很简单，但是训练可完全不是那样的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:488
translate chinese ep6_0e2478d1:

    # l "It's a sport where you have to constantly be better... Better than anyone else..."
    l "这项运动要求你不断突破自己……不断超越别人……"

# game/ep6.rpy:491
translate chinese ep6_62497be7:

    # l "But... I guess that doesn't always happen. Things don't always go the way you wanted it to be."
    l "但是……没人能一直比别人快。比赛结果往往事与愿违。"

# game/ep6.rpy:494
translate chinese ep6_b48880eb:

    # yt "It seems that there's really more to her than meets the eye. I never thought of her as an athlete before."
    yt "看来她心里还藏着不少故事。我以前从来没想过她会是个运动员。"

# game/ep6.rpy:495
translate chinese ep6_852176d0:

    # yt "I'm curious what happened and why she stopped."
    yt "我想知道后来怎么样了，为什么她不再跑步了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:498
translate chinese ep6_238a0800:

    # mc "What happened though? Why did you stop running?"
    mc "后来发生什么了？你怎么放弃了呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:501
translate chinese ep6_5e1d008e:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:502
translate chinese ep6_28dadef4:

    # l "It's... not that I wanted to stop, but..."
    l "我……并不想停下，但是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:511
translate chinese ep6_058163c7:

    # l "Uhm... I think we should just talk about that some other time. I still need to get to the academy as soon as possible."
    l "呃……还是改日再说吧。我得尽快去学校了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:512
translate chinese ep6_23f321ce:

    # mc "Oh right! I forgot about that!"
    mc "噢，对了！我都忘了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:513
translate chinese ep6_6dc9685d:

    # mc "Let's close up shop real quick so we can go!"
    mc "那我们赶快把店给关了吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:516
translate chinese ep6_fb45cb1c:

    # l "Roger that!"
    l "遵命！"

# game/ep6.rpy:517
translate chinese ep6_8dfdae81:

    # mc "You're doing the salute wrong..."
    mc "你敬礼的姿势错了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:518
translate chinese ep6_1e9527fb:

    # l "Ahaha!"
    l "啊哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:519
translate chinese ep6_d541617d:

    # mc "Where's Freya, by the way?"
    mc "对了，芙蕾雅呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:522
translate chinese ep6_35b368ff:

    # l "I think she's still in the restroom trying to change out of the costume she wore earlier."
    l "她应该还在换衣服吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:523
translate chinese ep6_952ac003:

    # mc "Oh, jeez... Well, can you go check on her? She's been in there for quite a while now."
    mc "哦……那你能去看看她吗？她已经在里面换了挺久了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:524
translate chinese ep6_47caa2a4:

    # l "Got it!"
    l "收到！"

# game/ep6.rpy:534
translate chinese ep6_7f32f624:

    # yt "Ahh... What a day that was! At least it's over now. I'll just have to arrive early and prepare myself for tomorrow."
    yt "啊……今天可真要命！好在已经结束了。明天我一定得早点来，提前做好准备。"

# game/ep6.rpy:535
translate chinese ep6_6194c868:

    # yt "I've gotta pay Mr. Scott a visit, like I promised Naomi."
    yt "我还得去探望一下斯考特先生，我已经答应过娜奥米了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:536
translate chinese ep6_4c5d4490:

    # yt "...Oh, right! I have to tell [landlady!t] about his situation, too. I just hope he's actually fine."
    yt "……噢，对了！我还得把他的情况跟[landlady!t]也说一下。我希望他是真的没事了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:539
translate chinese ep6_e0eeb67f:

    # yt "I may get home a bit late than usual, so it might be a good idea to send my report to Miss Jess now."
    yt "今天估计要晚回家了，还是现在就把报告发给婕斯小姐吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:540
translate chinese ep6_57abe13c:

    # yt "It's hard to do it on my phone, but it's better than nothing."
    yt "在手机上写报告很难受，但总归比没有好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:541
translate chinese ep6_c25b6f07:

    # yt "I bet she'll be happy with the results as soon as she reads the report."
    yt "她看到今天的营业额之后肯定该高兴坏了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:544
translate chinese ep6_a125a33d:

    # j "Good, but that doesn't surprise me at all."
    j "很好，但其实我并不惊讶。"

# game/ep6.rpy:545
translate chinese ep6_0c0d2d89:

    # mc "Eeehhhh......"
    mc "啊这……"

# game/ep6.rpy:546
translate chinese ep6_4a5ba3d8:

    # j "Don't get depressed, now, I already expected that to happen. Consider that a trial, and it's good to know that you all survived it."
    j "别那么伤心，我不惊讶是因为我已经料到会这样了。就把今天当成一次测试吧，你们都挺过去了，这是好事。"

# game/ep6.rpy:547
translate chinese ep6_75172240:

    # mc "So you really did agree to Freya's idea?"
    mc "所以你真的同意了芙蕾雅的想法吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:548
translate chinese ep6_548a49c1:

    # j "Of course! Why would I reject such a brilliant idea?"
    j "当然！为什么我要拒绝那么好的方案？"

# game/ep6.rpy:549
translate chinese ep6_ef480a15:

    # j "She got a huge fan base, and Freya promoting the burger shack will make a huge impact on its numbers."
    j "她的粉丝量非常大，所以请她来打广告当然会极大的带动我们的生意。"

# game/ep6.rpy:550
translate chinese ep6_ff299299:

    # j "So we made a deal that I will let her do her thing while she promotes the business. It's a win-win situation."
    j "于是我就跟她说好，只要可以带来客人，她做什么都可以。这是双赢。"

# game/ep6.rpy:553
translate chinese ep6_32a82ff3:

    # mc "I see. I have no complaints about it as long as it benefits the shop. I'm pretty sure we'll get used to the amount of customers over time, too."
    mc "我知道了。只要对店里有好处，我就没有意见。我敢说再过一段时间我们也能适应店里目前的人流量了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:554
translate chinese ep6_6e59069e:

    # j "That's good to hear."
    j "那就好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:555
translate chinese ep6_10d8461d:

    # mc "I just can't believe she came up with that considering her age."
    mc "我只是不敢想象她小小年纪就能想到这种办法。"

# game/ep6.rpy:556
translate chinese ep6_6a359c9e:

    # j "I'd advise you to not take her so lightly, [mc!t]. She thinks differently from other girls her age."
    j "我建议你不要小瞧她，[mc!t]。她的想法跟同龄女生完全不一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:557
translate chinese ep6_16616612:

    # j "She's got a good sense for business — that's why I like her in the first place."
    j "她很有生意头脑——所以我才中意她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:558
translate chinese ep6_6c4f81f2:

    # mc "As long as you approved her idea, then I'm cool with it."
    mc "只要你同意她的想法，那我就也同意。"

# game/ep6.rpy:559
translate chinese ep6_77fc27a1:

    # j "By the way, I'm with your [landlady!t] right now. She wants to talk to you."
    j "对了，我现在跟你[landlady!t]在一起呢。她想跟你说几句话。"

# game/ep6.rpy:560
translate chinese ep6_9c05912c:

    # mc "Wait, really? How do you guys know each other?"
    mc "等等，什么？你们俩是怎么认识的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:561
translate chinese ep6_363c2eca:

    # j "It's a bit of a story, so I'll let her explain it to you."
    j "说来话长，就让她跟你解释吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:562
translate chinese ep6_60e6c864:

    # mc "Alright then."
    mc "好吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:565
translate chinese ep6_a0209601:

    # k "[mc!t]?"
    k "[mc!t]？"

# game/ep6.rpy:566
translate chinese ep6_caee50c1:

    # mc "Hey, [landlady!t]! What's going on? Why are you with Miss Jess?"
    mc "嘿，[landlady!t]！到底什么情况？你怎么跟婕斯小姐在一块呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:567
translate chinese ep6_f16ce5d6:

    # k "It's a long story, [mc!t]. But I'll get to the main points."
    k "这个说来话长，[mc!t]。我就挑主要的跟你说吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:568
translate chinese ep6_fec33614:

    # k "She's helping me along with her friend — Aurora — shaping up my company. Kana is with me too, by the way."
    k "她和她的朋友奥罗拉目前正在帮我建立我的公司。还有卡娜也在。"

# game/ep6.rpy:569
translate chinese ep6_40580820:

    # k "Kana was the one who asked them for help."
    k "就是卡娜去找她们两个来帮忙的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:570
translate chinese ep6_3565880d:

    # mc "So Kana knows her too? Damn... What a small world!"
    mc "所以卡娜也认识婕斯小姐吗？天啊……世界可真小！"

# game/ep6.rpy:571
translate chinese ep6_77800d59:

    # k "It looks like it, yes. *giggles*"
    k "好像确实是这样的。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:572
translate chinese ep6_dd89f944:

    # mc "How's everything going, though? All good?"
    mc "一切都还顺利吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:573
translate chinese ep6_12df682c:

    # k "Things are looking good at the moment, we finished planning our business strategy and have several papers to take care of, so far."
    k "目前来看进展不错。我们已经定好了经营策略，正在处理几份文件。"

# game/ep6.rpy:574
translate chinese ep6_2bd6d39e:

    # k "We decided to relax for a while and get back to it tomorrow."
    k "我们现在正在休息，打算明天再继续。"

# game/ep6.rpy:575
translate chinese ep6_4b6ca090:

    # k "There is still a lot to do, but with their help, I believe we'll get things done faster than what I was expecting."
    k "还有很多事情没有解决，但有了她们帮忙，肯定会比我原本预料的要快不少。"

# game/ep6.rpy:576
translate chinese ep6_0a253b88:

    # mc "I see. That's great to hear, [landlady!t]. Looking forward to seeing you soon."
    mc "我明白了。这真是好消息，[landlady!t]。我希望你能早点回家来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:577
translate chinese ep6_98dc1751:

    # k "Me too, [mc!t]."
    k "我也是，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:578
translate chinese ep6_176b4c2c:

    # mc "By the way, I'm on my way to Mr. Scott's house right now. I'll call you once I have time and fill you in about his condition."
    mc "对了，我现在正在去斯考特先生家的路上。我有空就会给你打电话，把他的情况告诉你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:579
translate chinese ep6_1a988d46:

    # k "Oh! I almost forgot about him!"
    k "噢！我差点都把他的事忘了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:580
translate chinese ep6_c21eed8e:

    # k "Yes, please do, [mc!t]. And please give him my regards."
    k "好的，之后请一定联系我，[mc!t]。麻烦你向他送去我的问候。"

# game/ep6.rpy:581
translate chinese ep6_155a0022:

    # mc "Will do, [landlady!t]."
    mc "好的，[landlady!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:582
translate chinese ep6_3d572f63:

    # k "Alright, I won't hold you any further. Please, take care and get home early, okay?"
    k "好了，我就不再耽误你的时间了。一路小心，早点回家，好吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:583
translate chinese ep6_261b6249:

    # mc "I might get home a bit late, but I won't stay there for too long."
    mc "我可能要稍晚一点才回家，但我不会在那待太久的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:584
translate chinese ep6_352b7b5f:

    # k "Great! Goodbye then, [mc!t]."
    k "很好！再见，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:585
translate chinese ep6_422ea9ef:

    # mc "Bye for now, [landlady!t]."
    mc "再见，[landlady!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:589
translate chinese ep6_2b922a7d:

    # k "Thanks."
    k "谢谢。"

# game/ep6.rpy:591
translate chinese ep6_57916a36:

    # j "I must say... You have a good [tenant!t], Klara."
    j "不得不说……你有个好[tenant!t]，克拉拉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:594
translate chinese ep6_0a844614:

    # k "Mmh... He's not perfect, that's what I certainly know. But he has the ability to have a positive effect on other people's lives."
    k "嗯……他肯定不完美，这我是知道的。但他确实能给周围人带来积极向上的影响。"

# game/ep6.rpy:595
translate chinese ep6_502dbbe4:

    # k "He may be unaware of it at the moment, but it's just a matter of time until he realizes it himself."
    k "他现在可能还没意识到，但之后他总有一天会发现的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:596
translate chinese ep6_47d23da8:

    # k "I just hope... My decision to get the girls in there was right."
    k "我只希望……我让那几个女孩住进我家的决定是对的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:597
translate chinese ep6_fe778ddb:

    # j "So, all of that was part of your plan from the beginning?"
    j "所以，这一切从一开始都是你计划好的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:598
translate chinese ep6_4763f0c5:

    # k "Yes, but it was a huge risk for me. I know he'll blame me when he learns that I let the girls stay there on purpose."
    k "是的，但我也冒了很大的风险。他一旦知道一切都是我安排的，一定会怪我的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:599
translate chinese ep6_4c06ec29:

    # k "But I'll take it. It's for their own good..."
    k "但我也愿意接受。这都是为了他们好……"

# game/ep6.rpy:602
translate chinese ep6_ed0ac606:

    # k "...and... for Hera too."
    k "……而且……也是为了赫拉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:603
translate chinese ep6_93d64714:

    # j "A huge sacrifice, huh?"
    j "巨大的牺牲，嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:604
translate chinese ep6_311141fa:

    # j "*chuckles* It seems that I'm not the only person here that educates people. The only difference between us two... is that you sacrifice a lot."
    j "*笑* 看来这里不止我一个人爱教育人。我们俩之间唯一的差别就是……你牺牲了很多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:607
translate chinese ep6_4ad79231:

    # k "*giggles* Well, I guess you can say that. But there's no turning back now."
    k "*笑* 好吧，我想你说得没错。但是现在已经不能回头了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:610
translate chinese ep6_666d39bd:

    # j "So, will you fight her or not?"
    j "所以，你会跟她斗到底吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:611
translate chinese ep6_1e32ace0:

    # k "I will. That's why I came back home. I'm not doing this on a whim."
    k "我会的。我回来就是为了这个。我可不是一时兴起才干这些的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:612
translate chinese ep6_a316d6af:

    # k "I will bring Hera to her knees and slap her back to reality. But... everything is up to [mc!t]."
    k "我要让赫拉屈膝下跪，狠狠给她几个耳光，让她认清现实。但是……一切都取决于[mc!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:613
translate chinese ep6_af21b008:

    # j "You and your [tenant!t] have exactly the same mentality, you know that?"
    j "你跟你[tenant!t]的心态真是一模一样，你知道吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:616
translate chinese ep6_b5466252:

    # k "I know that very well. That's why I trust he'll make things right."
    k "我很清楚。所以我才相信他可以让事情都重归正轨。"

# game/ep6.rpy:617
translate chinese ep6_ffc72e31:

    # j "You guys know you're against the current boss of the Mafia, right?"
    j "你应该很清楚你是打算对付黑手党的现任老大吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:618
translate chinese ep6_df6c62c0:

    # k "And here I am speaking with her younger sister like it's nothing."
    k "不仅如此，我现在还正在和黑手党老大的妹妹聊天呢。"

# game/ep6.rpy:619
translate chinese ep6_c689cb9a:

    # j "Ah, I don't want to be associated with them. I never stayed with them from the moment I could stand on my own feet anyways."
    j "别提了，我才不想跟他们扯上关系。我一有能力自立门户就立马跟他们划清了界限。"

# game/ep6.rpy:620
translate chinese ep6_d91f829f:

    # k "I know this fight won't be easy, but I will fight with sticks and stones if I have to."
    k "我知道这场仗不会轻松，但哪怕最后要用木棒跟石头战斗，我也不会放弃。"

# game/ep6.rpy:621
translate chinese ep6_ce007a5a:

    # k "Not just for the kids' sake — this is all for Hera, too."
    k "不只是为了孩子们——也是为了赫拉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:624
translate chinese ep6_0a428b67:

    # j "*chuckles* Nothing beats friendship at the end of the day."
    j "*笑* 看来到最后你还是放不下跟她的这段友情啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:625
translate chinese ep6_5ee90f8f:

    # j "And that's why I'm here. She can't touch any of you as long as she knows that I'm on your side."
    j "所以我才会来找你。只要我还站在你们这边，赫拉就不敢动你们一根汗毛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:626
translate chinese ep6_906d8a46:

    # k "I'm relieved to know that, Jess. Although... there's someone I'm really concerned about right now."
    k "你这话让我很安心，婕斯。但是……我现在还是特别担心一个人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:627
translate chinese ep6_3a5d0c82:

    # j "Hm? And who might that be?"
    j "嗯？你说的是谁？"

# game/ep6.rpy:630
translate chinese ep6_6fadf605:

    # k "Nevermind her daughter — I'm more worried about the servant."
    k "你可能觉得是赫拉的女儿，但并不是——我是在担心她的仆从。"

# game/ep6.rpy:631
translate chinese ep6_999a9a4c:

    # j "Emy? Or should we call her Emma now?"
    j "艾米？或者现在应该叫她艾玛了吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:632
translate chinese ep6_8ea463c4:

    # k "So that's her real name?"
    k "所以她的真名叫艾米？"

# game/ep6.rpy:633
translate chinese ep6_b21f99b8:

    # j "Yes, every servant has to change their name and profile before they start working for the Mafia. That's to keep things confidential."
    j "是的，每个仆人在为黑手党服务之前都要更换名字和身份。为了保密起见。"

# game/ep6.rpy:634
translate chinese ep6_5fe27520:

    # j "They have to follow certain rules by heart, like keeping their emotions under wraps and staying true to their pledge."
    j "还要遵守许多戒律，比如必须时刻隐藏自己的感情，还有永远保持忠诚之类的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:635
translate chinese ep6_79277277:

    # k "I see now..."
    k "我明白了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:636
translate chinese ep6_dcca2268:

    # k "I don't know what happened to her and [mc!t] in the past. But I feel like she's the one suffering the most from all of this."
    k "我不知道她跟[mc!t]之间在过去发生过什么。但我觉得她才是在这一连串的事情里面受苦最多的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:637
translate chinese ep6_419a1de2:

    # k "I want to end this as soon as possible. I can handle it, but I can't take any more of the kids' suffering."
    k "我想让这一切尽快结束。我自己可以忍受，但实在看不得这些孩子们受苦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:640
translate chinese ep6_4884f8ba:

    # j "You have to be patient, Klara. Don't let your feelings get to you. Just focus on the matters at hand right now."
    j "你要耐心，克拉拉。不要被情绪左右了理性。要专注于目前的事务上。"

# game/ep6.rpy:641
translate chinese ep6_723d291e:

    # j "Rushing this won't result in anything."
    j "再着急也不会有任何作用。"

# game/ep6.rpy:644
translate chinese ep6_3bb3fd20:

    # j "......"
    j "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:645
translate chinese ep6_7ad0404d:

    # j "And if my theory is correct... then Emma is our key to everything."
    j "而且如果我的想法没错的话……艾玛是解决一切的关键。"

# game/ep6.rpy:646
translate chinese ep6_26296101:

    # k "What do you mean?"
    k "你这是什么意思？"

# game/ep6.rpy:647
translate chinese ep6_bb662e69:

    # j "She's smart. That plan of hers that you told me about last night was perfect."
    j "她很聪明。你昨晚跟我说了她提出的计划，我思考过后觉得简直完美。"

# game/ep6.rpy:648
translate chinese ep6_e2174261:

    # k "You mean that she wants [mc!t] to marry Hera's daughter?"
    k "她想让[mc!t]和赫拉的女儿结婚的计划吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:649
translate chinese ep6_9f64a2bd:

    # j "Yes."
    j "是的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:650
translate chinese ep6_2de0dcfd:

    # k "Honestly I was against that plan of hers. I'm just not sure if that will work."
    k "说实话我并不赞成她的计划。实在太多不确定因素了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:651
translate chinese ep6_20edfb17:

    # j "Trust me, it may sound stupid but, that's actually better than what I had in mind, and I think I know what she's planning to do."
    j "相信我，这计划听起来很蠢，但是实际上比我之前想的还要好。我应该已经猜到她实际想做什么了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:652
translate chinese ep6_eb484427:

    # k "Tell me about it."
    k "说来听听。"

# game/ep6.rpy:653
translate chinese ep6_6933334e:

    # j "It has something to do with our family's name."
    j "跟我们家族的名声有关。"

# game/ep6.rpy:654
translate chinese ep6_48200ae0:

    # j "Considering that [mc!t] has no standing in society, he's the perfect choice for her plan."
    j "考虑到[mc!t]完全是个默默无闻的普通人，他就是最符合计划的完美人选。"

# game/ep6.rpy:655
translate chinese ep6_969ae49d:

    # j "Let [mc!t] marry Hera's daughter, lay low and attack when the time comes."
    j "在[mc!t]和赫拉的女儿结婚之后，先一直保持低调，等时机成熟再出击。"

# game/ep6.rpy:656
translate chinese ep6_48449860:

    # j "Hera leading the Mafia doesn't actually fit with its rules."
    j "赫拉领导整个黑手党这件事，其实并不符合我家定下的规矩。"

# game/ep6.rpy:657
translate chinese ep6_f8304225:

    # j "Just remember that no woman... can ever lead the group. That's our first and foremost rule."
    j "女人……绝不能指挥这个组织。这是我们最优先、最彻底的原则。"

# game/ep6.rpy:658
translate chinese ep6_6fc49ea4:

    # j "She must have went through the group's history and found that information."
    j "艾玛肯定是彻底查阅了组织的历史之后才找到这个关键信息的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:659
translate chinese ep6_e3af4e58:

    # k "*gasps* Don't tell me that she wants to..."
    k "*惊讶* 难道她是要……"

# game/ep6.rpy:660
translate chinese ep6_6caa12b1:

    # j "Mhm... Break the group for real this time around."
    j "嗯……这次她是要把组织彻底击溃了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:661
translate chinese ep6_ceb9245b:

    # j "Although, I bet she can't tell him anything at the moment, I know my sister may be the one holding her back. But..."
    j "但是，我猜艾玛现在应该还不能向他透露任何信息。我知道大概是我姐姐仍然让她有所顾虑。但是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:662
translate chinese ep6_2eb9fa0b:

    # j "You'll see when the right time comes. Just leave that part to them."
    j "等到了时候你就会知道了。就把这部分留给他们解决吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:663
translate chinese ep6_60ab5b56:

    # j "I will have to prepare a nice bottle of wine for myself when that happens."
    j "真到了好戏上演的时候，我可得备好一瓶红酒好好欣赏。"

# game/ep6.rpy:664
translate chinese ep6_84cc3d23:

    # k "Keeping some things mysterious?"
    k "到了这时候还要保持神秘吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:667
translate chinese ep6_d09ca093:

    # j "It's nothing like that. It's just a waste of time to explain it while it's still up in the air. But I have a good feeling that I'm right. We'll just have to watch it unfold."
    j "不是那样的。只是现在事情都是八字还没有一撇，即使解释了也是浪费时间。但我很有自信，我想的绝对没错。只要等着看就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:670
translate chinese ep6_2555e25a:

    # j "If that happens, then it will be a good opportunity for us to strike and do our part."
    j "如果真的如我所料，到时就是我们也发起攻击，一举拿下的最好时机。"

# game/ep6.rpy:671
translate chinese ep6_479668b6:

    # j "And prepare yourself. You're making a big decision as [mc!t]'s [landlady!t]."
    j "所以你要做好准备。你是[mc!t]的[landlady!t]，到时你要做出重大的选择。"

# game/ep6.rpy:672
translate chinese ep6_dbc2cf4b:

    # k "No, that won't be my decision. It's all up to him, I can't tell him what to do anymore. All I can do is have faith in him."
    k "不，不该由我来选。一切都得由他决定，我现在已经不能再左右他的人生了。我能做的只有相信他。"

# game/ep6.rpy:673
translate chinese ep6_e4ac9be1:

    # j "Well, that's still a theory, but we'll see if I'm actually right."
    j "好吧。这些终归都还是理论上的，到时就看看我猜的对不对吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:674
translate chinese ep6_66367fcd:

    # k "Alright, then. I trust you, Jess."
    k "好吧。我相信你，婕斯。"

# game/ep6.rpy:675
translate chinese ep6_f32546a9:

    # j "Haha! Save that trust for when we get results."
    j "哈哈！等到有结果的时候再夸我吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:676
translate chinese ep6_8989c651:

    # j "For now, let's wait till Aurora comes back with the good news."
    j "现在，我们就等着奥罗拉带着好消息回来吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:677
translate chinese ep6_332e2d2a:

    # k "Ah, that's right. Did you two find a good construction company?"
    k "啊，是的。你们俩找到合适的建筑公司了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:678
translate chinese ep6_dfabc46f:

    # j "We did. The problem is... how to convince him to join us."
    j "找是找到了。但问题是……怎么说服他加入我们。"

# game/ep6.rpy:679
translate chinese ep6_f778d16b:

    # j "Let's take our time and relax. Tomorrow will be a busy one."
    j "先抓紧时间好好休息吧。明天会很忙的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:680
translate chinese ep6_745d0824:

    # k "Sure!"
    k "好的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:690
translate chinese ep6_c8f09047:

    # sc "There ya go! Television's all good! What d'ya have next, love?"
    sc "好了！电视算是弄完了！还剩点啥，闺女？"

# game/ep6.rpy:694
translate chinese ep6_029f034b:

    # "*running*"
    "*跑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:698
translate chinese ep6_cdb8b135:

    # n "Huh? What did ya do?"
    n "啊？你干啥了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:699
translate chinese ep6_6c4df6cd:

    # sc "This?"
    sc "修电视？"

# game/ep6.rpy:702
translate chinese ep6_d275082d:

    # n "Oh, come on! For the last time, dad, the doctor and I already told ya, ya have to get some rest!"
    n "哎呀，爸！医生都说了，让你好好休息！"

# game/ep6.rpy:703
translate chinese ep6_3103d680:

    # sc "Naaah... Screw that bullshit! I am as fine as I was when I started this job, just look at me, and-"
    sc "唉……胡说八道！我的身体跟年轻的时候一样好，你看看我，还有——"

# game/ep6.rpy:704
translate chinese ep6_ea40d22b:

    # n "Nuh-uhh! The doctor may have told ya that yer back is all fine now. But it doesn't mean that ya can lift somethin' heavy already!"
    n "打住！医生确实说你的背恢复得不错，但是你也不能这么快就开始搬这么重的东西啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:707
translate chinese ep6_c7381bb8:

    # n "Ya need to take this seriously, dad! Go get some rest and just leave this to me."
    n "你得听话，爸！赶快休息去吧，我来弄就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:708
translate chinese ep6_e8b817e7:

    # n "And don't worry about the business, I can handle it on my own, ya know that better than anyone."
    n "工作的事你也不用担心，我自己都能解决，你肯定比谁都清楚我的能力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:709
translate chinese ep6_445cfb01:

    # sc "Ya know some parts of it, yes. But ya still have a long way to go before reaching your old man's level, young lady."
    sc "你是懂一点，这我承认。但要想达到你爹的水平，可还早得很呢，小朋友。"

# game/ep6.rpy:710
translate chinese ep6_551e11fe:

    # n "Bloody hell, ya know this is..."
    n "别胡扯了，你明明知道……"

# game/ep6.rpy:714
translate chinese ep6_3755c2a6:

    # "*doorbell rings*"
    "*门铃响起*"

# game/ep6.rpy:715
translate chinese ep6_e921b53e:

    # n "Hm? Expecting someone today, dad?"
    n "嗯？今天有人要来吗，爸？"

# game/ep6.rpy:716
translate chinese ep6_0a32939e:

    # sc "Nah, that must be your boyfriend, love. Don't be rude, go open the door, would ya?"
    sc "没有，应该是你男朋友吧，闺女。别没礼貌，快去开门，好吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:719
translate chinese ep6_1567df8b:

    # n "*sighs* Don't go thinkin' this conversation is over, ya just got lucky here."
    n "*叹气* 你可别以为我会就这么放过你，这次算你走运。"

# game/ep6.rpy:722
translate chinese ep6_4d8c5cd2:

    # sc "{i}I don't think I could win against her another time. Guess I'll just have to give it up and leave the rest to her. Haha."
    sc "{i}我下次估计就说不过她了。看来我还是得安心退休，把一切都交给她了。哈哈。"

# game/ep6.rpy:723
translate chinese ep6_2d0e866f:

    # n "Oh! Hey, mate!"
    n "噢！你好啊，伙计！"

# game/ep6.rpy:724
translate chinese ep6_a8a10d50:

    # n "Right, right! I forgot ya mentioned that yah'd be coming here today."
    n "哎呀，对了！我都忘了你说今天要来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:727
translate chinese ep6_df65a66b:

    # sc "Hrm?"
    sc "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:728
translate chinese ep6_936d280b:

    # n "Please, come in! Don't be shy!"
    n "快，快请进！不用客气！"

# game/ep6.rpy:729
translate chinese ep6_73fd6989:

    # mc "Thanks, Naomi."
    mc "谢谢，娜奥米。"

# game/ep6.rpy:732
translate chinese ep6_1ac92453:

    # sc "Aye! Look who's here! If it ent my boy, [mc!t]!"
    sc "嚯！瞧瞧谁来了！这不是我的好小子[mc!t]吗！"

# game/ep6.rpy:733
translate chinese ep6_44d01efb:

    # sc "Please, sit down, lad!"
    sc "来，请坐，小伙子！"

# game/ep6.rpy:736
translate chinese ep6_2677448b:

    # mc "It's been a while, Mr. Scott!"
    mc "好久不见了，斯考特先生！"

# game/ep6.rpy:737
translate chinese ep6_f1a134e6:

    # sc "Look at how ya've grown!"
    sc "看看，你都长这么大了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:738
translate chinese ep6_735993d4:

    # mc "Haha! It's just months since we last saw each other. I haven't grown that much, really."
    mc "哈哈！离我们上次见面也就过了几个月而已，我哪可能长大啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:739
translate chinese ep6_cf2a806f:

    # mc "How are you doing? All fine now, I guess?"
    mc "你身体怎么样？应该都挺好吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:742
translate chinese ep6_66bb5eb8:

    # sc "......"
    sc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:745
translate chinese ep6_5495c2a7:

    # n "Don't lie, dad."
    n "得说实话，爸。"

# game/ep6.rpy:748
translate chinese ep6_c228fe7d:

    # sc "Ah, well... I'm still recovering. I can at least stand up properly now, unlike a few weeks back where I couldn't even lift my back at all."
    sc "啊，其实……我还在恢复。现在我能轻松地站起来走路了，不像前几个星期，我连背都直不起来啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:749
translate chinese ep6_f728a3b2:

    # mc "That's great to hear! Although, you should still get some more rest just to be sure."
    mc "那就好！但是，你现在最好还是多休息休息吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:750
translate chinese ep6_b3f11e27:

    # mc "[landlady!t] was worried about your condition when I told her about you."
    mc "我跟[landlady!t]说过之后，她也很担心你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:751
translate chinese ep6_e29b0114:

    # mc "And weeks of recovery isn't that much, to be honest."
    mc "再说，几个星期的时间，也不是很久，还是要小心啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:754
