    yt "但是，她说得对……"

# game/ep6.rpy:926
translate chinese ep6_0dcb50a1:

    # yt "I might have been too naive about what's happening around me. I was only thinking of what might benefit me in the long run and ignored all the rest."
    yt "我可能是太天真了，没太在乎近段时间来发生在我身上的事。我只想着哪些事长远来看对我有利，而忽略了其他的东西。"

# game/ep6.rpy:927
translate chinese ep6_e55b9a70_1:

    # yt "......"
    yt "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:928
translate chinese ep6_84dcc4ae:

    # yt "I never thought that this would come from someone I barely even know. And she managed to grasp all this with only one conversation with Aine?"
    yt "我真没想到居然会从我几乎不认识的人嘴里听到这些话。而且她还是仅仅跟艾妮说过一次话之后就知道了这些。"

# game/ep6.rpy:929
translate chinese ep6_e465ebc2:

    # yt "If Aine really does have feelings for me... Then, I honestly don't know what I should do about it."
    yt "如果艾妮真的喜欢我的话……那，我完全不知道该怎么办了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:930
translate chinese ep6_f68c5b67:

    # yt "I did have feelings for her before, but all of those are gone by now. I abandoned everything when I left high school."
    yt "我以前确实喜欢她，但那些感情早就已经烟消云散了。我高中毕业以后就全部放下了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:931
translate chinese ep6_6c82cfb2:

    # yt "But why would she fall for me? Because of the comfort I gave her? That's the only reason I can think of right now."
    yt "但她怎么可能会喜欢上我？因为我能让她感到安心吗？这是目前我能想到的唯一原因了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:932
translate chinese ep6_722f1f8c:

    # yt "If that's the case, then she might be unaware of it herself."
    yt "如果是这样的话，可能连她自己也没有意识到。"

# game/ep6.rpy:933
translate chinese ep6_56090c2b:

    # yt "Seeking my comfort is just too shallow of a reason for her to fall for me. I need to know the real reason behind it."
    yt "仅仅是想寻求我的安慰实在不够让她喜欢上我。我得找到背后的真正原因才行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:934
translate chinese ep6_49002f15:

    # yt "*sighs*... Another problem added to my list."
    yt "*叹气*…… 又多了一个要操心的问题。"

# game/ep6.rpy:935
translate chinese ep6_2d4d1817:

    # yt "Urrgghhh!"
    yt "真烦！"

# game/ep6.rpy:938
translate chinese ep6_3581dfdb:

    # n "*giggles* I'm sorry, mate. Did I give ya a lot to think on? You were in deep thought for a while there."
    n "*笑* 对不住啊，伙计。我是不是让你一下子脑子不够用了？你刚刚沉思了好久。"

# game/ep6.rpy:939
translate chinese ep6_328e70d6:

    # mc "To be honest? Yes."
    mc "说实话，确实是你说的那样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:940
translate chinese ep6_24c48f81:

    # mc "But you made me realize what was happening, so I don't hold it against you."
    mc "但你让我意识到了眼下我所处的情况，所以我也不能怪你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:943
translate chinese ep6_112f84de:

    # n "I told ya I'm a straightforward kind of person."
    n "都说了，我是个直性子。"

# game/ep6.rpy:944
translate chinese ep6_b150e735:

    # n "If I have problems with ya, I'll tell ya about it. If I have somethin' to tell ya I'll tell ya right away. I don't like keepin' secrets."
    n "要是我对你有意见，我就会当面直接告诉你。要是我有事想跟你说，我就会立马去跟你说。我不喜欢在心里藏着秘密。"

# game/ep6.rpy:947
translate chinese ep6_ae4227ef:

    # n "Whatever you two are goin' through right now, and I don't know if she told you already, but she deeply regrets what she did to you before, mate."
    n "不管你俩现在是什么情况，我也不知道她之前跟你说过没有，但我还是要告诉你，艾妮很后悔她以前做的那些事，伙计。"

# game/ep6.rpy:948
translate chinese ep6_1fa15ab8:

    # n "There was no stain of doubt on the way she said it to me."
    n "这点是毋庸置疑的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:949
translate chinese ep6_231d66a4:

    # n "I'm not forcin' ya, but come on... You two are livin' under the same roof. Make things right before it's too late. Ya ain't kids any longer."
    n "我也不是逼你，但你好好想想……你俩现在都同居了。趁还来得及，赶紧让事情都回到正轨上来吧。你们都不是小孩了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:950
translate chinese ep6_6e41a375:

    # n "Furthermore, she's quite the looker, don't ya think?"
    n "再说了，她还长得那么漂亮，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:953
translate chinese ep6_e7880dce:

    # n "*winks*"
    n "*wink*"

# game/ep6.rpy:954
translate chinese ep6_dfcd178a:

    # mc "It seems that fixing mechanical things isn't your only expertise, huh?"
    mc "看来你的专长还不止修东西啊，是吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:957
translate chinese ep6_f447a975:

    # n "Haha! I don't have it on my CV... yet."
    n "哈哈！不过情感咨询我可还不敢写进简历里面。"

# game/ep6.rpy:960
translate chinese ep6_12652254:

    # n "Although I won't mind ya telling me more about you two next time. I'd love to hear more about yer story."
    n "下次你要是愿意给我讲你俩的事，我很乐意听。我很想知道你俩之间都有过些什么。"

# game/ep6.rpy:961
translate chinese ep6_77017e2e:

    # mc "*chuckles* We'll see about that."
    mc "*笑* 这个就之后再看吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:962
translate chinese ep6_59d523a8:

    # n "Lookin' forward to it then."
    n "那我就期待着咯。"

# game/ep6.rpy:964
translate chinese ep6_c1f98e41:

    # n "Please wait here for a moment. I'll go and get some coffee for ya before I forget about it."
    n "请在这稍等一下。我去给你拿咖啡豆，不然之后忘了就不好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:965
translate chinese ep6_6bf00ec9:

    # mc "Alright. I have to go home now. It's getting pretty late."
    mc "好吧。我也该回家了，时候不早了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:966
translate chinese ep6_f847f6fc:

    # n "Got it, just give me a second."
    n "好的，我马上回来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:974
translate chinese ep6_fe95085f:

    # n "Here you go, mate."
    n "给，拿好了，伙计。"

# game/ep6.rpy:983
translate chinese ep6_73fd6989_1:

    # mc "Thanks, Naomi."
    mc "谢谢，娜奥米。"

# game/ep6.rpy:984
translate chinese ep6_85982c49:

    # n "No worries!"
    n "不客气！"

# game/ep6.rpy:985
translate chinese ep6_88991318:

    # mc "Can you go get Mr. Scott for me? I want to say goodbye before I go."
    mc "你能帮我喊一下斯考特先生吗？我走之前想跟他道个别。"

# game/ep6.rpy:986
translate chinese ep6_66bf980c:

    # n "I'm afraid he's gone to sleep. It's weird, but he usually does it at this time of the day."
    n "抱歉，不过他已经睡觉了。这个时间就睡确实很奇怪，但一直以来他都是在这时候睡觉的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:987
translate chinese ep6_77096ce2:

    # n "Don't worry I'll tell him later that you already left."
    n "不用担心，之后我会告诉他你已经走了的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:988
translate chinese ep6_c2a448f3:

    # mc "Please do."
    mc "谢谢你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:989
translate chinese ep6_d32b09b5:

    # mc "Alright, I'm off then. See you, Naomi."
    mc "好了，那我先走了。再见，娜奥米。"

# game/ep6.rpy:990
translate chinese ep6_000f0af8:

    # n "Oh, wait. Give me yer phone for a moment."
    n "噢，等一下。把你的手机给我一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:991
translate chinese ep6_45993bdf:

    # mc "Uhh... sure, here!"
    mc "呃……好的，给！"

# game/ep6.rpy:994
translate chinese ep6_41df7470_1:

    # n "......"
    n "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:997
translate chinese ep6_02e26cf6:

    # n "There. I saved my phone number to yer contacts. Dad will probably go home tomorrow, so call me, instead, if ya need anythin'."
    n "好了。我把我的号码存进去了。我爸可能明天就回乡下了，所以你要是有事的话，给我打电话就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:998
translate chinese ep6_6ae58b30:

    # mc "Oh, of course!"
    mc "噢，好的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:999
translate chinese ep6_f7a929b4:

    # n "Catch'ya later, mate."
    n "再见了，伙计。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1000
translate chinese ep6_52e4f359:

    # mc "Sure!"
    mc "再见！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1002
translate chinese ep6_275ae371:

    # n "Please stay here for a moment. I'll go and look in on dad. He's been upstairs for a while now."
    n "麻烦你在这等一下。我得上楼去看看我爸，他已经在楼上挺久了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1003
translate chinese ep6_9245621e:

    # mc "Alright. I have to go home. It's getting pretty late."
    mc "好吧。我也该回家了，时候不早了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1004
translate chinese ep6_f847f6fc_1:

    # n "Got it, just give me a second."
    n "好的，我马上回来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1018
translate chinese ep6_17e17b7a:

    # n "He's sleeping. Don't worry I'll tell him later that you left already."
    n "他已经睡下了。没事，之后我会告诉他你已经走了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1019
translate chinese ep6_c2a448f3_1:

    # mc "Please do."
    mc "谢谢你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1020
translate chinese ep6_d32b09b5_1:

    # mc "Alright, I'm off then. See you, Naomi."
    mc "好了，那我先走了。再见，娜奥米"

# game/ep6.rpy:1021
translate chinese ep6_3d549c04:

    # n "Oh, wait. Give me yer phone for moment."
    n "噢，等一下。把你的手机给我一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1022
translate chinese ep6_45993bdf_1:

    # mc "Uhh... sure, here!"
    mc "呃……好的，给！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1025
translate chinese ep6_41df7470_2:

    # n "......"
    n "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:1028
translate chinese ep6_199886c6:

    # n "There. I saved my phone number to yer contacts. Dad will probably go home tomorrow, so call me instead if ya need anythin'."
    n "好了。我把我的号码存进去了。我爸可能明天就回乡下了，所以你要是有事的话，给我打电话就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1029
translate chinese ep6_6ae58b30_1:

    # mc "Oh, of course!"
    mc "噢，好的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1030
translate chinese ep6_f7a929b4_1:

    # n "Catch'ya later, mate."
    n "再见了，伙计。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1031
translate chinese ep6_52e4f359_1:

    # mc "Sure!"
    mc "再见！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1056
translate chinese naomipause2_ee8fffaf:

    # yt "That was a very short conversation, but damn... she blew me away..."
    yt "刚刚的谈话虽然很短，但是……她真的让我很吃惊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1057
translate chinese naomipause2_a94bbe31:

    # yt "Although her sudden interest in me and Aine puts me off a little bit. Why was she so interested to know our story?"
    yt "虽然她对我和艾妮莫名的兴趣让我摸不着头脑。为什么她那么想知道我们的故事？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1058
translate chinese naomipause2_202c8a2d:

    # yt "But I like that she's soft-spoken and very easy to talk to."
    yt "但她说话很温柔，平易近人，我很喜欢。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1059
translate chinese naomipause2_7eaccb9e:

    # yt "That's probably what got me to tell her some information about us."
    yt "所以我才会跟她透露了一些我高中时候的事情……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1060
translate chinese naomipause2_1adc8d10:

    # yt "She has the most soothing voice I've ever heard — like it would put me to sleep."
    yt "她的声音简直是我听到过最令人安心的——好像能把我哄睡着的摇篮曲一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1063
translate chinese naomipause2_4164d1f8:

    # yt "She sounds like someone who would be doing audio books for a living, to be honest. Haha!"
    yt "说实话，她更适合去给有声读物配音。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1066
translate chinese naomipause2_e55b9a70:

    # yt "......"
    yt "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:1067
translate chinese naomipause2_2012fc49:

    # yt "Hey, is that Emma?"
    yt "哎，那是艾玛吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1068
translate chinese naomipause2_521aa908:

    # yt "...Yeah, of course it's her. She has the weirdest detective outfit I've ever seen."
    yt "……是啊，肯定是她。穿着我见过最奇怪的侦探制服。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1069
translate chinese naomipause2_85702a39:

    # yt "I wonder what she's doing..."
    yt "不知道她在干嘛……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1072
translate chinese naomipause2_29e91096:

    # mc "Yow, Sherlock! What's up?"
    mc "哟，福尔摩斯！情况如何啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1073
translate chinese naomipause2_506880bf:

    # e "Nothing. I'm just on my way home. And please don't call me Sherlock."
    e "没什么。我只是正在回家而已。还有，请不要叫我福尔摩斯。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1074
translate chinese naomipause2_85301681:

    # mc "Bummer..."
    mc "没劲……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1075
translate chinese naomipause2_c17ef8ec:

    # mc "What's that?"
    mc "那是什么？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1076
translate chinese naomipause2_f86a4e18:

    # e "...It's about the case I'm currently assigned to. Why?"
    e "……跟我现在正在跟的案子有关。怎么了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1077
translate chinese naomipause2_e8e93cb7:

    # mc "Let me guess..."
    mc "我猜猜……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1078
translate chinese naomipause2_3f51d6fa:

    # mc "Some creepy stuff?"
    mc "是有点吓人的东西？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1079
translate chinese naomipause2_bc6a64c7:

    # e "Why, are you really into something creepy? You asked me that before too."
    e "为什么？你很喜欢恐怖的事情吗？你之前也这么问过我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1082
translate chinese naomipause2_8c7321e0:

    # e "The inside details are confidential but, yes. It's more than just something creepy."
    e "里面的内容是机密，不能透露。但确实，这个案子不止是吓人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1083
translate chinese naomipause2_706fb38b:

    # e "A guy reported that he found his wife murdered after he came home from his day job."
    e "一个男人下班之后报警说，他的妻子被杀了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1084
translate chinese naomipause2_24748c03:

    # mc "Uhm... Is that all?"
    mc "呃……没了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1087
translate chinese naomipause2_e9284666:

    # e "No, it's not just any type of murder, his wife was so torn apart that he could barely even recognize her."
    e "不，不是单纯的杀人案。他的妻子被分尸了，他花了很大劲才认出来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1088
translate chinese naomipause2_72f173c6:

    # mc "Oh, shit!"
    mc "我操！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1091
translate chinese naomipause2_d1d40d33:

    # e "Mhm... The crime was so gruesome that police couldn't find a single piece of evidence or any leads, so the investigation was passed over to our department."
    e "嗯……这个案子极其恶劣，而且警察还找不到任何证据和线索，所以调查就移交给我们部门了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1092
translate chinese naomipause2_f228b699:

    # e "I'm making a list of the evidence I found earlier and the details of the crime. I'm interrogating the suspect tomorrow."
    e "我正在给我之前找到的证据和案件的细节列清单。明天我要去审问嫌疑人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1093
translate chinese naomipause2_d122bb9a:

    # mc "Heeh... So, who's the suspect?"
    mc "哦……嫌疑人是谁呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1094
translate chinese naomipause2_15337828:

    # e "The man who reported the crime -- her husband..."
    e "就是报案的人——死者的丈夫……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1097
translate chinese naomipause2_23f08730:

    # mc "What the..."
    mc "怎么可能……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1098
translate chinese naomipause2_8d679da4:

    # mc "How were you able to tell that it was him?"
    mc "你怎么知道是他干的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1099
translate chinese naomipause2_f93f41f0:

    # e "It was easy..."
    e "很简单……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1100
translate chinese naomipause2_8a533202:

    # e "The way he spoke to me was already suspicious to begin with."
    e "他跟我说话的语气就已经很可疑了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1101
translate chinese naomipause2_81140c1d:

    # e "He took time to think about his answers and kept repeating the same phrases while his eyes never looked straight at me."
    e "他回答问题之前总是要想很久，说话时不断重复同一句话，而且还不敢直视我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1102
translate chinese naomipause2_0eacf8e7:

    # e "His fingers fidgeted whenever I asked him some questions related to the crime. That's basic psychology to determine if a person is lying or not."
    e "我问他有关案件的问题时，他的手指一直在乱动。这些特征都是能判断人是否在说谎的基本心理学知识。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1103
translate chinese naomipause2_5c365a65:

    # yt "Holy shit! I should be careful of her from now on! She'll easily be able to tell whenever I lie!"
    yt "我的妈啊！我以后可真得好好提防着她！她一眼就能看出来我是不是在骗她！"

# game/ep6.rpy:1104
translate chinese naomipause2_a281e681:

    # e "Knowing that he was lying to me, I asked him to remove the gloves he was wearing."
    e "看出他在撒谎之后，我要求他把戴着的手套给摘下来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1105
translate chinese naomipause2_d2be12f0:

    # mc "Huh? I don't get the logic behind it. Why his gloves?"
    mc "啊？我听不懂。跟手套有什么关系？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1106
translate chinese naomipause2_b0d89ace:

    # e "At least let me finish first..."
    e "听我说完……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1107
translate chinese naomipause2_6140a489:

    # mc "Okay... Miss Inspector..."
    mc "好的……神探小姐……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1108
translate chinese naomipause2_28899a41:

    # e "I found a small cut in his lips so I was assuming that his wife tried to fight back somehow. When he removed his gloves, there was some bruising and small cuts on his hands."
    e "我在他的嘴唇上看到了一个小伤口，就推测可能是他的妻子反抗的时候留下的。他摘下手套之后，我看见他的手上也有擦伤和小伤口。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1109
translate chinese naomipause2_136d1fac:

    # mc "So you were right to assume that they fought before he was actually able to kill her, then?"
    mc "所以这证明了他的确是在和妻子打斗之后杀了她，是这样吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1110
translate chinese naomipause2_e955bf51:

    # e "Mhm..."
    e "嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1111
translate chinese naomipause2_156cb16a:

    # e "But that alone can't prove that he's guilty, so I'm going to make him tell me the truth tomorrow."
    e "仅凭这些还是没法证明他有罪的。所以明天我要让他亲口承认。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1112
translate chinese naomipause2_d79ea3e9:

    # mc "That sounds tough! What will you do if he denies it anyway?"
    mc "这可不容易！他要是死不承认怎么办？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1113
translate chinese naomipause2_514f2534:

    # e "I have my ways. That's what I'm trained to do."
    e "我自有办法。我就是干这一行的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1114
translate chinese naomipause2_e63cc6eb:

    # mc "I got it. Good luck with that then."
    mc "我明白了。祝你好运吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1115
translate chinese naomipause2_e955bf51_1:

    # e "Mhm..."
    e "嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:1124
translate chinese naomipause2_153632f3:

