translate chinese naomipause2_c717b7c5:

    # m "...Thanks, but there's a lot in here. What do you want me to do this time?"
    m "……谢了，不过这里面可有不少钱啊。这次你又想派我去做什么？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1780
translate chinese naomipause2_ec2406b0:

    # un "Not much. I need you to watch someone for me."
    un "没什么。我想让你去监视一个人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1781
translate chinese naomipause2_c9e4ff94:

    # m "You mean I gotta stick with him or her? I still have college, you know?"
    m "是那种形影不离的监视吗？我还得上大学呢，你知道吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:1782
translate chinese naomipause2_0b15e1aa:

    # un "Just do it if you have time. Give me updates with his status and that's it. I might tell you to do something aside from that, just be ready."
    un "有时间的时候去就是了。时不时告诉我他的状况就好。除监视之外我可能之后还会给你其他的任务，做好准备。"

# game/ep6.rpy:1783
translate chinese naomipause2_18c0f1a5:

    # un "This is not me asking you, it's an order from my boss and I need your help."
    un "这可不是我在求你帮忙。是我老板的命令。我需要你帮我。"

