    # a "$1300 to be exact. It was supposed to be $1350, but since I bought a package, I got it at a discount."
    a "1300金城元。原价是1350金城元的，但是因为我打包全买了，就给我打了折。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2213
translate chinese naomipause2_f5c1f052:

    # mc "*chuckles* You really are a cheapskate, Aine. I gotta remember that from now on."
    mc "*笑* 你真是抠门啊，艾妮。从今往后我可会一直记着的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2214
translate chinese naomipause2_61512c7b:

    # a "I guess I should educate you on how to budget your money properly then."
    a "那我也得好好教教你怎么花钱了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2215
translate chinese naomipause2_9feb8925:

    # a "You need to be practical now that the prices of things are going up."
    a "现在物价都在涨，必须精打细算才行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2216
translate chinese naomipause2_e28f7efb:

    # mc "Haha. We'll see about that."
    mc "哈哈。这就日后再说吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2217
translate chinese naomipause2_50413b2e:

    # mc "Anyway, I need to get ready now. I have to be at work early today."
    mc "好了，我要去准备上班了。今天我得提前到才行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2218
translate chinese naomipause2_26b66431:

    # a "Alright, thank you for helping me, [mc!t]. I appreciate it."
    a "好的，谢谢你帮我，[mc!t]。我很感激。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2219
translate chinese naomipause2_ce330cfb:

    # mc "No worries."
    mc "不用谢。"

