    a "*亲*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2237
translate chinese naomipause2_13d78ef7:

    # a "My god... How can you be so tall?"
    a "天啊……你怎么这么高？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2238
translate chinese naomipause2_3ba263c1:

    # mc "Uhh... What was that for?"
    mc "呃……这是……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2239
translate chinese naomipause2_c3fb3714:

    # a "A second 'thank you'. That's for bringing us up here last night. I know you're the one who did it. *giggles*"
    a "第二次“谢谢你”。这次是为了感谢你昨晚把我们送回房间。我知道是你把我们送回来的。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2240
translate chinese naomipause2_17e52641:

    # a "I don't know how to repay you for all the kindness you're showing towards us, really."
    a "我都不知道该怎么回报你对我们的善意了，真的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2241
translate chinese naomipause2_969362e5:

    # mc "Hmm... Maybe surprise me with something then?"
    mc "嗯……那你可以试着给我一个惊喜？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2242
translate chinese naomipause2_02381fb3:

    # a "Okay! I'll think of that something. *giggles*"
    a "好啊！我之后想想该怎么办。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2243
translate chinese naomipause2_2468de4a:

    # mc "Jeez... I'll go now, alright?"
    mc "哈哈……那我就先走了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2244
translate chinese naomipause2_3e185893:

    # a "Yep... Have a nice day today, [mc!t]."
    a "好……一路顺风，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2245
translate chinese naomipause2_0dfdcd09:

    # mc "You too."
    mc "你也是。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2249
translate chinese naomipause2_c3faa3d5:

    # "*door closes*"
    "*关门*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2250
translate chinese naomipause2_3b21f354_8:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2251
translate chinese naomipause2_c8bc3300:

    # yt "I guess that's a way to start a day, huh?"
    yt "用这种方式开始新的一天也不赖，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2254
translate chinese naomipause2_048c490c_1:

    # yt "*lightly chuckles*"
    yt "*轻笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2255
translate chinese naomipause2_d552bf91:

    # yt "Let's get this done, then!"
    yt "好了，开始努力吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2268
translate chinese naomipause2_1ae51995:

    # k "Mhhn..."
    k "嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2274
translate chinese naomipause2_4514e1b2:

    # k "*yawns*..."
    k "*哈欠*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2283
translate chinese naomipause2_b35462ac:

    # cl "Finally waking up, huh, boss?"
    cl "终于醒了啊，老板。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2284
translate chinese naomipause2_1029bbb2:

    # cl "You're waking up late for someone who has a big job to do today."
    cl "今天还有大事要干，您未免起得也太晚了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2287
translate chinese naomipause2_4941d3d5:

    # k "Huh...?"
    k "什么……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2288
translate chinese naomipause2_7bfb671b:

    # k "I'm sorry. But... May I know who you are and why you are in my room?"
    k "不好意思。……你是哪位？为什么会在我的房间里？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2289
translate chinese naomipause2_2a3a7440:

    # cl "Right, how rude of me."
    cl "哦，对了。我可真没礼貌。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2292
translate chinese naomipause2_96a4a83a:

    # cl "My name is Claire. I'll be your and Jess' bodyguard for the time being. It's a pleasure to meet you, Miss Klara."
    cl "我叫克莱尔。负责保护你和婕斯的人身安全。很高兴认识你，克拉拉女士。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2295
translate chinese naomipause2_4cd87a6e:

    # k "Oh, I see... You're that person Jess was talking about last night."
    k "哦，原来如此……你就是婕斯昨晚提到的那个人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2296
translate chinese naomipause2_7d23c607:

    # k "The pleasure is mine, I'll be in your care for now."
    k "我也很荣幸，今后就多靠你了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2297
translate chinese naomipause2_295f7e7d:

    # k "{i}I can sense rudeness with the way she speaks, and that she's forcing herself to be respectful towards me. I'm not sure if I can trust her or not."
    k "{i}我能从她说话的语气里感觉到她的傲慢无礼，她只是在逼着自己尊重我而已。我不知道该不该相信她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2300
translate chinese naomipause2_6cd3b570:

    # cl "It's okay if you don't trust me at the moment. I truly deserve that."
    cl "你现在不信任我也可以。我完全理解。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2301
translate chinese naomipause2_101118ce:

    # k "{i}How did she know what I was thinking?!"
    k "{i}她怎么知道我在想什么？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2302
translate chinese naomipause2_561a7f85:

    # cl "...But this is a way for me to atone for my past sins on a journey for me to find my own way of living. So please allow me to serve you."
    cl "……我想弥补我过去犯下的罪孽，也想在旅途中找到真正属于我的那条路。所以请允许我为您服务。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2303
translate chinese naomipause2_1931baf4:

    # k "It's alright since I trust Jess with her decisions. But what do you mean by your 'past sins'?"
    k "没事，我相信婕斯的决策。但你过去的罪孽具体是什么呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2306
translate chinese naomipause2_295b0085:

    # cl "I bet you're familiar with me if you've lived in Golden Town."
    cl "您如果曾经在金城住过的话，肯定对我很熟悉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2307
translate chinese naomipause2_8c15cb0c:

    # cl "I was known by the name of 'Owl' for the past five years. If you do, then you might have an idea who I am."
    cl "过去五年里，我一直用的是“枭”这个名字。如果您听过这个名字的话，肯定就已经知道我到底都干过些什么了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2308
translate chinese naomipause2_f19979a3:

    # k "*gasps*!"
    k "*惊讶*！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2309
translate chinese naomipause2_a3d5ee91:

    # k "Y-you mean, you're that 'Owl'?! The real one?!"
    k "你——你真的，就是那个“枭”？！是本人吗？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2310
translate chinese naomipause2_2976381d:

    # cl "Yes. The real one."
    cl "是的。如假包换。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2311
translate chinese naomipause2_ac4e87b5:

    # k "There had been some reports of people trying to impersonate you and had been doing mischievous things around the city."
    k "有很多报道说有人冒充你，在城里到处做坏事。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2312
translate chinese naomipause2_c0065100:

    # k "But according to the rumors, the 'Owl' has pitch-black hair and a pair of bright sky-blue eyes. Both of your arms also have the tattoos that people were talking about."
    k "但流言说，“枭”留着漆黑的长发，还有一双蓝眼睛。你胳膊上的纹身也和人们私下里的传言一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2313
translate chinese naomipause2_3f3816ad:

    # k "Although... no one has actually ever seen you before."
    k "尽管……没人真正见过你……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2314
translate chinese naomipause2_3033b386:

    # cl "That's how I work, Miss Klara. Hence, my nickname."
    cl "这就是我行事的风格，克拉拉女士。所以我才有了这个代号。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2315
translate chinese naomipause2_440b6adc:

    # k "I guess you're not lying then..."
    k "看来你没在说谎……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2316
translate chinese naomipause2_1133a496:

    # k "But how come you're still..."
    k "但你怎么可能还……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2317
translate chinese naomipause2_33a87988:

    # cl "Alive?"
    cl "活着？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2318
translate chinese naomipause2_ddb0a791:

    # k "...Yes."
    k "……是啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2321
translate chinese naomipause2_47beee67:

    # cl "*chuckles* I may look as pale as a dead body, but I'm alive. Was I said to be dead?"
    cl "*笑* 我的皮肤确实跟尸体一样苍白，但我还活得好好的。大家都说我死了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2322
translate chinese naomipause2_0e6a16c1:

    # k "Yes, not only that, but I heard you were given a death sentence! Was that all... just a cover-up?"
    k "是啊，因为我听说你已经被判死刑了！那些全都是……假的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2323
translate chinese naomipause2_fdb8d11a:

    # cl "None of that ever happened. I've been living my life for the past two years trying to work my way back into reality."
    cl "所有那种传言都是胡扯。过去两年我都在专心生活，想让我自己回到现实里来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2324
translate chinese naomipause2_68b8619b:

    # cl "And now, here I am."
    cl "所以，现在我才会站在你面前。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2327
translate chinese naomipause2_5a45a682:

    # k "Was Jess the one who..."
    k "是婕斯在……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2328
translate chinese naomipause2_b26db272:

    # cl "No, it was another person. Although Jess helped me get back on my feet."
    cl "不，是另一个人。不过婕斯确实也帮我站稳了脚跟。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2331
translate chinese naomipause2_95c79725:

    # k "I see... I have been admiring her for her knowledge and power, but I couldn't understand where she's getting it all from."
    k "我知道了……我很钦佩她的知识和能力，但我不知道她到底是哪来的那么多本领。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2334
translate chinese naomipause2_62103df5:

    # cl "She's separating herself from her family's name, that's all I know as well."
    cl "她一直在竭尽全力跟她自己的家族划清界限，我也只知道这些了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2335
translate chinese naomipause2_c1bcaa7f:

    # cl "Years of knowing her, she's still a mysterious person, even for me and her friends."
    cl "我认识她很多年，但她依然是个很神秘的人，哪怕是我和她的朋友们也对她了解甚少。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2336
translate chinese naomipause2_63f55a83:

    # cl "She may be fragile physically, but we should never underestimate what she can do."
    cl "或许她本人只是个弱女子，但是我们绝不能低估她的能力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2339
translate chinese naomipause2_a12ded03:

    # cl "Which I did, and eventually lost to her."
    cl "我就低估过她，所以最后，我输给她了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2340
translate chinese naomipause2_f3f42a36:

    # k "You guys... are so full of mystery."
    k "你们一个个……都充满了谜团啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2341
translate chinese naomipause2_aa54acb4:

    # cl "The past is past, Miss Klara. We should never bring it back now."
    cl "过去的事都已经过去了，克拉拉女士。现在就不要再提从前了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2342
translate chinese naomipause2_fb7c5e36:

    # cl "You wouldn't want to hear the full story, either."
    cl "你也不会想听故事的全貌的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2343
translate chinese naomipause2_b4f39de2:

    # k "I'm very curious, but then... I should probably just leave it at that. I have my own business to take care of at the moment, and that's what I should focus on."
    k "我非常好奇，但是……最好还是不要再打听了。我现在还有自己的要事需要处理。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2344
translate chinese naomipause2_e8401fc5:

    # cl "Yes, we all should."
    cl "是啊，我们都是如此。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2345
translate chinese naomipause2_721fff29:

    # k "......"
    k "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2348
translate chinese naomipause2_2cab3090:

    # k "I never would've imagined that you're this pretty considering your status, Claire. But I guess you already know that, right?"
    k "考虑到你从前的行当，我从来没想过你会这么漂亮，克莱尔。不过我想你自己也应该很清楚自己的美貌吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2351
translate chinese naomipause2_f7cf4c6b:

    # cl "I never praised myself for it, but I'll take that as a compliment, Miss Klara. Thank you."
    cl "我从来没有因为我自己的容貌而感到自豪过，但我就当做您在夸奖我了，克拉拉女士。谢谢你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2352
translate chinese naomipause2_4ec7fa07:

    # k "Have you eaten your breakfast yet?"
    k "你吃过早饭了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2355
translate chinese naomipause2_eb4e4b2b:

    # cl "Not yet, I'm afraid. I haven't eaten anything since last night, actually."
    cl "还没有。我其实从昨晚开始就没吃过东西了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2356
translate chinese naomipause2_d67c1c27:

    # k "Oh, jeez! Come with me, I'll cook us both some breakfast!"
    k "噢，那怎么行！跟我来，我给咱们两个做些吃的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2357
translate chinese naomipause2_3e72ce73:

    # cl "Roger."
    cl "了解。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2358
translate chinese naomipause2_c214efb7:

    # cl "Should I wake Jess up too?"
    cl "我要把婕斯也喊醒吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2359
translate chinese naomipause2_e339f387:

    # k "If you would, please, dear. You young ones should never skip your breakfasts!"
    k "是的，拜托你了，亲爱的。你们这些年轻人可不能不吃早饭！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2360
translate chinese naomipause2_f495b299:

    # cl "So you're becoming my mother instead of my boss, huh?"
    cl "你这是从我的老板变成我的老妈了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2361
translate chinese naomipause2_a8a3686a:

    # k "That's just the right thing to do right now, dear. *giggles*"
    k "我只是在做我该做的事情，亲爱的。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2364
translate chinese naomipause2_d25db148:

    # cl "Thinking of my mother now..."
    cl "现在想想我的母亲……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2367
translate chinese naomipause2_5e4f8800:

    # cl "I... should probably never have done that..."
    cl "我……当初不该那样的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2370
translate chinese naomipause2_25f996d0:

    # cl "*chuckles* Life... What have you done to me?"
    cl "*笑* 生活啊……你怎么能这么对我？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2396
translate chinese klarapause2_94adabd3:

    # mc "Ahh... The good ol'... burger shack!"
    mc "啊……汉堡店……我的老家！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2397
translate chinese klarapause2_70beb4e1:

    # mc "*sniffs*..."
    mc "*吸气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2398
translate chinese klarapause2_d36c40bb:

    # mc "Ahh...!"
    mc "啊……！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2401
translate chinese klarapause2_42ab4549:

    # mc "I might be stupid, but the air here seems to be fresher than outside. This is the only place where I can not think of my problems, even if it is just a temporary reprieve."
    mc "这么说挺蠢的，但这里的空气感觉比外面的还要新鲜。只有在这里，我才能暂时不去考虑我脑子里的那一大堆问题。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2402
translate chinese klarapause2_08ada0f9:

    # mc "I should just live here instead!"
    mc "我干脆搬到这来住好了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2405
translate chinese klarapause2_3f482faa:

    # mc "Hahaaa! Bring the customers on, here I come~!!"
    mc "哈哈哈哈！让客人们都进来吧，我要上班咯~！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2408
translate chinese klarapause2_ef48cca8:

    # f "Hey!"
    f "喂！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2411
translate chinese klarapause2_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2412
translate chinese klarapause2_8f0cee41:

    # "*poke*"
    "*戳*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2413
translate chinese klarapause2_ab6c6a75:

    # f "Got'cha~!"
    f "抓到你咯~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2414
translate chinese klarapause2_8a8917c3:

    # mc "Oh, hey, Frey! You're early today!"
    mc "噢，你好啊，芙蕾！今天来得挺早！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2417
translate chinese klarapause2_cb8f9e47:

    # f "Heeh... Calling me by my nickname. Why are you so energetic that it seems like you just had some pot?"
    f "哈……都开始用爱称喊我了。怎么这么有精神啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2418
translate chinese klarapause2_246f261d:

    # mc "Never mind me, but what's with you sending me that picture last night?!"
    mc "先别管我了，你昨晚给我发那种照片什么意思啊？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2419
translate chinese klarapause2_e342ffbe:

    # mc "Do you actually want me to go to jail, huh?!"
    mc "你是想让我坐牢吗，啊？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2420
translate chinese klarapause2_6cc99d6f:

    # f "Hello~? I'm nineteen, Mister~! Just perfectly legal!"
    f "你有事吗~？我19岁了，先生~！完全合法！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2423
translate chinese klarapause2_e4301577:

    # f "Teeheee~!"
    f "嘻嘻~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2424
translate chinese klarapause2_21fb1853:

    # mc "Again, don't just 'teehee' me!"
    mc "再说一遍，别对着我“嘻嘻”！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2425
translate chinese klarapause2_46883f23:

    # mc "That caught me off guard and I didn't know what I would do after seeing that!"
    mc "你可吓到我了，看见之后我都不知道该干嘛了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2428
translate chinese klarapause2_1e6038c5:

    # f "Uhh... probably wank on it?"
    f "呃……可以对着我打飞机？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2429
translate chinese klarapause2_9b837800:

    # mc "I admit it's good wanking material, but don't shock me like that, I almost had a heart attack!"
    mc "我承认那张照片确实适合拿来干那种事，但求求你别再这么吓我了，我差点被吓出心脏病来了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2438
translate chinese klarapause2_d3bb853f:

    # f "There's a saying that girls like spontaneous men, so I was thinking I should apply that in reverse!"
    f "俗话说女生喜欢主动的男人，所以我就想看看这句话反过来是不是也成立！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2439
translate chinese klarapause2_5a9fdfb1:

    # f "I call it 'My #1 fan' service! I bet you liked it!"
    f "这是我给我的头号粉丝的特别福利！你肯定喜欢！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2440
translate chinese klarapause2_19aa973e:

    # mc "But I'm not your #1 fan!"
    mc "我又不是你的头号粉丝！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2441
translate chinese klarapause2_7e4e1cb1:

    # f "You will be, I just know it. Hahaha!"
    f "你早晚会是的，我就是知道。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2442
translate chinese klarapause2_d468502a:

    # mc "So have you done that to anyone besides me?!"
    mc "你不会给其他人也发过这种粉丝福利吧？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2443
translate chinese klarapause2_f6f1ccb3:

    # f "Nope! Never, until I found someone I could tease a bit."
    f "没有！我以前从来没干过这种事，直到某天我发现了一个适合我调戏的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2444
translate chinese klarapause2_6cc897f4:

    # mc "And that's me?"
    mc "那个人就是我？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2445
translate chinese klarapause2_48f059dd:

    # f "Yeppers!"
    f "是的呢！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2446
translate chinese klarapause2_28ec2bb3:

    # f "Hey, you're pretty fun to talk to, you can't blame me for teasing you! Hahaha!"
    f "跟你说话很有意思，也不能怪我想逗你！哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2447
translate chinese klarapause2_c2aa9b06:

    # mc "*sighs*..."
    mc "*叹气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2448
translate chinese klarapause2_2f5caf78:

    # mc "Now, I'm getting depressed..."
    mc "我要得抑郁症了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2449
translate chinese klarapause2_250000de:

    # f "Naah... I bet you want more of it."
    f "得了吧……我知道你肯定还想看。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2450
translate chinese klarapause2_c53d50b6:

    # f "Don't worry, I'll do it every night from now on. Well, if you ask me to, that is. Wahahaaa!"
    f "不用担心，今天开始我会每晚都给你发的。不过，你得先求我才行。哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2451
translate chinese klarapause2_c28031d8:

    # yt "This girl is definitely testing me."
    yt "这丫头肯定又是在逗我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2452
translate chinese klarapause2_243687cc:

    # f "Chin up now, we still got a lot to do. Lily is on her way here now too."
    f "好啦，打起精神，今天还有的忙呢。莉莉也马上就到了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2456
translate chinese klarapause2_94adabd3_1:

    # mc "Ahh... The good ol'... burger shack!"
    mc "啊……汉堡店……我的老家！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2457
translate chinese klarapause2_70beb4e1_1:

    # mc "*sniffs*..."
    mc "*吸气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2458
translate chinese klarapause2_d36c40bb_1:

    # mc "Ahh...!"
    mc "啊……！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2459
translate chinese klarapause2_c4b65ec0:

    # mc "I might be stupid, but the air here seems to be fresher than outside. This is the only place where I can not think of my problems even if it's a temporary reprieve."
    mc "这么说挺蠢的，但这里的空气感觉比外面的还要新鲜。只有在这里，我才能暂时不去考虑我脑子里的那一大堆问题。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2460
translate chinese klarapause2_df531ba6:

    # mc "I could just live here instead!"
    mc "我干脆搬到这来住好了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2461
translate chinese klarapause2_7beab2bd:

    # mc "Hahaaa! Bring the customers out, here I come~!!"
    mc "哈哈哈哈！让客人们都进来吧，我要上班咯~！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2467
translate chinese klarapause2_ae77a429:

    # "After the shift...."
    "下班之后……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2475
translate chinese klarapause2_773e7439:

    # mc "See? I told you we'd be fine if we're prepared for it. We got almost the same number of customers, and yet we're not nearly as exhausted as yesterday."
    mc "看见了没？我说了，只要做好准备，来这么多客人也没问题。今天客人的数量跟上次差不了多少，但是我们完全不累。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2476
translate chinese klarapause2_5123d003:

    # l "Haha! Yeah, I believe you now. We handled it just fine."
    l "哈哈！是啊，我现在信你了。我们今天确实干得不错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2477
translate chinese klarapause2_f35eed9c:

    # l "Although, this will be our everyday situation now. So I can't help but feel terrified."
    l "不过，以后就会每天都是这样子了。我还是感觉有点害怕。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2478
translate chinese klarapause2_ef6ed327:

    # mc "You'll get used to it, trust me."
    mc "总能习惯的，相信我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2481
translate chinese klarapause2_7d14c66b:

    # f "I'm sorry to leave you guys like this, but I have to get back home as soon as possible. My class schedule is early today."
    f "不好意思把你们两个丢下，但我今天必须尽快回家才行。我今天的课开始得很早。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2482
translate chinese klarapause2_2a9c1ca8:

    # f "I'll make it up to you next time, I promise."
    f "下次我会补偿你们的，我保证。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2483
translate chinese klarapause2_00dd9f44:

    # mc "Hey, I told you 'studies first', right? Don't worry about it. Lily and I got this."
    mc "我也说过“学习第一”，对吧？不用太在意，我和莉莉可以搞定的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2486
translate chinese klarapause2_cea2a4c2:

    # f "Thanks! Talk to you later, [mc!t]!"
    f "谢谢！再见啦，[mc!t]！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2489
translate chinese klarapause2_4b4400d9:

    # f "*winks*"
    f "*wink*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2490
translate chinese klarapause2_3025a19e:

    # yt "Jeez..."
    pass

# game/ep6.rpy:2493
translate chinese klarapause2_f012d74b:

    # mc "Anyway, how's it going on your side, Lily? You told me you're pretty busy with your studies too."
    mc "对了，你那边怎么样啊，莉莉？你之前也说过最近学习很忙吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2496
translate chinese klarapause2_dba32cde:

    # l "I'm struggling a little bit, because I'm pretty much average when it comes to smarts. But I'll be fine since I got some help from my classmates during study sessions."
    l "我遇到了点小困难，毕竟我不是特别聪明。但我的同学们帮了我很多，所以应该没什么大问题。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2497
translate chinese klarapause2_46ac204e:

    # l "I have no idea why I am always nervous about exams coming up. I'm passing them just fine, but I can't help it. *giggles*"
    l "我不知道为什么一到考试我就特别紧张。我知道自己肯定不会挂科的，但我就是控制不住。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2498
translate chinese klarapause2_020d68e3:

    # mc "I think most of us are, especially during our final year. I was pretty much the same during my last year in college."
    mc "大部分人应该都是这样的吧，特别是在最后一年的时候。我大学的最后一年差不多也是跟你一样的状态。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2499
translate chinese klarapause2_d45017e7:

    # mc "I didn't have a lot of confidence before. But I had to do what I had to do."
    mc "我以前也没什么自信。但是该做的事总要去做。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2500
translate chinese klarapause2_d87fa006:

    # mc "And... I graduated with honors, which I didn't actually expect. Hahaha!"
    mc "然后……我居然评上了优秀毕业生。我根本都没想到我也能评上。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2509
translate chinese klarapause2_bd0c409b:

    # l "Oh, really~? You never told me you graduated with honors! That's quite impressive, [mc!t]!"
    l "哇，真的吗~？你都没跟我说过！你挺厉害的啊，[mc!t]！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2510
translate chinese klarapause2_bea10bde:

    # mc "Aha haa... Thanks!"
    mc "啊哈哈……谢谢！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2511
translate chinese klarapause2_ade9e9c0:

    # mc "Yeah, I may have been at the top of the class, but I'm still here, working in a burger shack."
    mc "我确实是考过全班第一，但是呢，我现在还是在这个汉堡店上班，"

# game/ep6.rpy:2512
translate chinese klarapause2_0ac531f0:

    # mc "Though, I've never felt degraded by working here. I really love this place enough that I don't want to leave even if somebody offers me another job."
    mc "不过，在这工作也并没有什么丢脸的。我很喜欢这里，哪怕别人再给我一份工作，我也不想离开了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2513
translate chinese klarapause2_da5f2079:

    # mc "I could probably live in here if Miss Jess allowed me to. Ahahaha!"
    mc "要是婕斯小姐同意的话，我都想搬到这来住了。哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2514
translate chinese klarapause2_c64b5ef3:

    # l "Wait, you're not serious, right?"
    l "等等，你不会是认真的吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2515
translate chinese klarapause2_48378d5d:

    # mc "Nah... I'm just kidding. Don't get to be as crazy as me though."
    mc "没有……开个玩笑。你可别跟我一样发疯。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2516
translate chinese klarapause2_bfe6c1aa:

    # l "Haha. Don't worry. I love being in my bed and pillows every night."
    l "哈哈。不用担心。我很喜欢我的床和枕头。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2517
translate chinese klarapause2_5a5e95d0:

    # mc "Don't be angry, but I first thought that you were a couch potato. I was a bit shocked to learn that you were actually an athlete."
    mc "我这么说你别生气，不过我以前以为你是很宅的类型。知道你以前是运动员的时候我吓了一跳。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2518
translate chinese klarapause2_7f0496e1:

    # l "You got some good sense, I must say."
    l "你的直觉挺准的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2519
translate chinese klarapause2_33bfa60f:

    # mc "Wait, I was right to assume that?!"
    mc "等等，我难道还猜对了？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2520
translate chinese klarapause2_9b7b3c5b:

    # l "Yeah, you're not wrong. I used to be, but that changed weeks after I started training."
    l "是啊，你没说错。我以前是很宅，但自从我开始训练以后就变了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2521
translate chinese klarapause2_c4dd7a17:

    # l "I just love being on the track. I guess that's the same feeling when you told me that you want to live here. Haha!"
    l "我喜欢在跑道上的感觉。可能就跟你说想住在店里是一个感觉吧。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2522
translate chinese klarapause2_70671def:

    # mc "We both got something we relate to, huh?"
    mc "看来我们都有个自己最喜欢的地方啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2523
translate chinese klarapause2_75b11eb1:

    # mc "I really want to know about what happened now that you told me a little bit of it. I'm quite thrilled, to be honest."
    mc "自从你说了一小点之后，我就特别想知道你的故事的后续。说实话我非常感兴趣。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2524
translate chinese klarapause2_2502da37:

    # l "Mmh... It's... quite tragic, really. It was fun at first, but..."
    l "嗯……其实……整件事挺悲伤的。一开始比较快乐，但是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2525
translate chinese klarapause2_00dc6db8:

    # mc "...Was it that sad?"
    mc "……是那么伤心的故事吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2526
translate chinese klarapause2_b3ec279b:

    # l "Not so much... But if you're that eager to know about it, then I don't mind sharing it."
    l "倒也没有……如果你很想知道的话，我可以跟你讲讲。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2527
translate chinese klarapause2_961d223e:

    # mc "Please do!"
    mc "请一定给我讲讲！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2530
translate chinese klarapause2_6fa08a07:

    # l "......."
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2531
translate chinese klarapause2_9091f090:

    # l "*sighs*..."
    l "*叹气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2532
translate chinese klarapause2_ebd7d947:

    # l "Where should I even start?"
    l "我该从哪开始呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2533
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2534
translate chinese klarapause2_c3f3ee76:

    # l "I think there's nothing but that day... The day I was recruited to join the club."
    l "应该只能从那天开始了吧……我被社团招募的那天。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2535
translate chinese klarapause2_31a9c223:

    # l "It's when I first met our captain... Also the time I met my best friend and my partner on the team, Anne."
    l "那天我第一次遇见我们的队长……也是第一次遇见我最好的朋友，同时也是我在队里的搭档，安妮。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2541
translate chinese klarapause2_bcbb3b6a:

    # "*phone alarm rings*......"
    "*手机的闹钟响起*……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2544
translate chinese klarapause2_e06e41a6:

    # l "Urrhh..."
    l "啊啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2547
translate chinese klarapause2_b85c9ae8:

    # l "Yeah... I know... First day of school... Time to get up..."
    l "好吧……第一天上学……该起床了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2551
translate chinese klarapause2_067fd114:

    # l "*yawns*..."
    l "*哈欠*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2554
translate chinese klarapause2_9091f090_1:

    # l "*sighs*..."
    l "*叹气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:2567
translate chinese klarapause2_5e947466:

    # l "{i}Alright... Let's go."
    l "{i}好了……出发吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2585
translate chinese klarapause2_7e3ad5da:

    # l "*deeply exhales*"
    l "*深呼吸*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2588
translate chinese klarapause2_c7137c9e:

    # l "{i}Drealerra Academy... The only school in this city that has both high school and college."
    l "德列拉学院……这个城市唯一一所同时有大学部和高中部的学校。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2589
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_1:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2590
translate chinese klarapause2_edc77754:

    # l "How convenient..."
    l "还挺方便的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2593
translate chinese klarapause2_345a0347:

    # un "Ahh...! How come nobody ever wants to join the team...?"
    un "唉……！怎么没人愿意来呢……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2594
translate chinese klarapause2_d0b88cc4:

    # un "I mean..."
    un "你看看……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2597
translate chinese klarapause2_b3d5d88e:

    # un "Look at all those people trying to apply for the Volleyball club!"
    un "怎么偏偏有那么多人想加入排球社啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2600
translate chinese klarapause2_4fa6155a:

    # un "Well? You did join the team last year, didn't you?"
    un "至少去年你来了，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2601
translate chinese klarapause2_d1d3c185:

    # un "Why don't you stand up and try to hand out the forms for real this time, Anne?"
    un "安妮，要不你试试去发一下传单？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2602
translate chinese klarapause2_9392d261:

    # un "You're always so pumped up when it comes to training, but never bring that enthusiasm to other things like this."
    un "训练的时候你挺积极的，但是一到其他事你就没什么热情了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2603
translate chinese klarapause2_05f6055e:

    # an "Ehh...? I'm always pumped up, Cathy!"
    an "呃……？我一直都很积极啊，凯西！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2606
translate chinese klarapause2_031ee9d4:

    # ca "*sighs* You're obviously not..."
    ca "*叹气* 傻子都能看出来你一点也不积极……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2607
translate chinese klarapause2_bcefe68c:

    # ca "You need to learn while I'm still here."
    ca "你得趁我还在的时候多学一学。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2610
translate chinese klarapause2_576aba37:

    # ca "Hey, there's a first-year over there. Go and give her a form."
    ca "看，那边有个新来的。去给她发一张。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2611
translate chinese klarapause2_c0e51ebe:

    # an "Hm? How did you know she's a first-year?"
    an "啊？你怎么知道她是新生？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2612
translate chinese klarapause2_faba1c48:

    # ca "I have been attending this academy longer than you, how do you think I was able to tell?"
    ca "我在这学校里的时间可比你长，你以为我是怎么看出来的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2613
translate chinese klarapause2_c0cc3abd:

    # an "Ehh... You go and give her a form then..."
    an "呃……那还是你去吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2617
translate chinese klarapause2_5c1263e5:

    # ca "*punch*"
    ca "*锤*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2618
translate chinese klarapause2_2a069918:

    # ca "Stand up, you slug! Nisha isn't here, so it's your responsibility this time!"
    ca "快去，你个胆小鬼！尼莎今天不在，就该你负起责任了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2619
translate chinese klarapause2_a12b326d:

    # an "Okay, okay!"
    an "好吧，好吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2622
translate chinese klarapause2_836c3e22:

    # l "{i}Wow...! Look at all those people! What is happening? Is it a club?"
    l "{i}哇……！这么多人！什么情况？是社团在招新吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2625
translate chinese klarapause2_90b09553:

    # l "{i}I should look for a club to join as well. I wonder if there's a Manga club in this academy."
    l "{i}我也应该加入个社团了。不知道学校里有没有漫画社啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2626
translate chinese klarapause2_7e237d28:

    # l "{i}I don't particularly like it, but that's all I can think of joining right now. I'm not really good at sports, too..."
    l "{i}倒不是说我有多喜欢，但我现在能想到的只有这个了。我也不擅长运动……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2630
translate chinese klarapause2_d589bd5d:

    # an "Hey, you, first-year girl! Want to join the Track and field club?"
    an "嘿，那边那个新来的女生！想加入田径社吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2631
translate chinese klarapause2_3ec84b6e:

    # an "We give free tuition to those who join!"
    an "凡是新成员我们都提供免费指导哦！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2634
translate chinese klarapause2_5758e055:

    # l "Wait, for real~?!"
    l "等等，真的吗~？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2637
translate chinese klarapause2_f6dd175e:

    # ca "No, we don't. Stop making up stuff just to get people to join, will you, Anne?"
    ca "不，是假的。别再为了招人就在那胡编乱造了，安妮！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2640
translate chinese klarapause2_a049a87a:

    # l "Track and field club, huh?"
    l "你们是田径社的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2641
translate chinese klarapause2_30b66c41:

    # l "I'm not really good at sports, so I probably should say no."
    l "我不太擅长运动，还是算了吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2642
translate chinese klarapause2_0da0eec8:

    # an "Heeh? Do you have a club to join in mind then?"
    an "嗯？那你有想加入的社团吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2643
translate chinese klarapause2_320fa9d0:

    # l "Uhm... I'm thinking the Manga club?"
    l "呃……漫画社？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2644
translate chinese klarapause2_c8e3e88b:

    # an "No, we don't have a Manga club. And I'm being completely honest this time."
    an "我们这没有漫画社。这次我绝对没有骗你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2647
translate chinese klarapause2_8e33e8ef:

    # an "Right, Cathy?"
    an "对吧，凯西？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2648
translate chinese klarapause2_3c2dcacd:

    # ca "Mhm..."
    ca "嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2651
translate chinese klarapause2_218982ba:

    # l "Really? That's the only club I have in mind right now. I'm not confident about anything but studying."
    l "真的吗？我现在就只有这么一个想法。学习以外的事情我都没什么自信。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2652
translate chinese klarapause2_d6f6b448:

    # an "You're a smart ass, huh?"
    an "那你是个学霸咯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2653
translate chinese klarapause2_fbc8a162:

    # l "No, I'm not."
    l "不，也不算。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2654
translate chinese klarapause2_76a1ffd6:

    # an "Well then, have you ever seen a Track and Field competition before?"
    an "好吧。你以前看过田径比赛吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2655
translate chinese klarapause2_a4c32f50:

    # l "Just on TV... Like the Olympics you mean? Then yes."
    l "只在电视上看过……像是奥运会那种的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2656
translate chinese klarapause2_47c85e4f:

    # an "What do you think of it?"
    an "你觉得怎么样？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2657
translate chinese klarapause2_851a7d4b:

    # l "Uhm... It's boring?"
    l "呃……挺无聊的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2658
translate chinese klarapause2_880d3320:

    # an "Well, that must be because you suck at sports, indeed!"
    an "那肯定是因为你确实不擅长运动！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2659
translate chinese klarapause2_26629e44:

    # l "I told you already."
    l "我就是这么跟你说的啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2662
translate chinese klarapause2_58e316b1:

    # an "The adrenaline when the race is about to start..."
    an "比赛马上开始的时候，喷涌而出的肾上腺素……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2665
translate chinese klarapause2_b18c0574:

    # an "That feeling when you go {b}zoom{/b} to the finish line and win the race..."
    an "当你{b}飞奔{/b}穿过终点线，赢得比赛时的那种感觉……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2672
translate chinese klarapause2_ea8d226c:

    # an "Is just the best feeling ever!"
    an "那种感觉，真的是其他任何地方都体会不到的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2675
translate chinese klarapause2_e1d72b92:

    # ca "*chuckles* It must be nice to be simple-minded."
    ca "*笑* 做个单纯的人可真好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2676
translate chinese klarapause2_319ff08b:

    # ca "Don't go bragging now, Anne."
    ca "别瞎吹牛了，安妮。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2677
translate chinese klarapause2_bc23f3de:

    # an "I'm not! I'm just trying to convince her to give it a try!"
    an "我没有！我只是在说服她！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2680
translate chinese klarapause2_5d5e20bd:

    # an "Hey, what's your name?"
    an "你叫什么名字？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2681
translate chinese klarapause2_af53fc3d:

    # l "Uhm... Lily. My name is Lily."
    l "呃……莉莉。我叫莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2684
translate chinese klarapause2_a84edcc8:

    # an "Your last name?"
    an "姓呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2685
translate chinese klarapause2_373af2b9:

    # l "Kim. Lily Kim."
    l "我姓金。莉莉·金。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2686
translate chinese klarapause2_cf37161a:

    # an "I got it!"
    an "收到！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2689
translate chinese klarapause2_03a63902:

    # an "*scribbles* Lily... Kim..."
    an "*写字* 莉莉……金……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2690
translate chinese klarapause2_1ba1cf75:

    # an "There!"
    an "好了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2693
translate chinese klarapause2_553ca14f:

    # an "Listen, I listed you down as an applicant, alright?"
    an "你看，我已经把你给登记上了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2694
translate chinese klarapause2_67194098:

    # l "Huh? But I'm really not interested in joining your club."
    l "什么？但我真的对田径不感兴趣啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2697
translate chinese klarapause2_46ce09b2:

    # an "That's fine! Just think about it for now."
    an "没关系的！你回去再考虑一下就好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2700
translate chinese klarapause2_44ba5b07:

    # an "Look, I'll wait for you right here after the class is done this afternoon. I'll take you to the stadium so you can see things for yourself."
    an "嗯，下午放学之后，我还会在这里等着你。我带你去体育场，让你亲眼看看。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2701
translate chinese klarapause2_d1769be8:

    # l "The stadium?"
    l "体育场？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2704
translate chinese klarapause2_4812c4e8:

    # an "Yeah! We don't have a track here at the academy, so we use the city's stadium as our official training area."
    an "是啊！学校里没有跑道，所以我们是在市里的体育场训练的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2705
translate chinese klarapause2_4ae98ba8:

    # l "Wait, are you allowed to do that?"
    l "真的吗？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2706
translate chinese klarapause2_6f8b0c82:

    # an "Yep! Hundred percent! The government happily provided it for us!"
    an "是啊！百分百是真的！政府很乐意给我们提供场地。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2707
translate chinese klarapause2_6f12f758:

    # l "I see..."
    l "好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2708
translate chinese klarapause2_91d59164:

    # an "You don't have to join right away. But I want to show you something before you make your decision."
    an "你不用立刻决定的。但你真正决定之前，我想给你看一些东西。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2709
translate chinese klarapause2_7246d286:

    # an "Think about it, Lily."
    an "好好考虑一下吧，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2710
translate chinese klarapause2_5a82cd92:

    # l "O-okay..."
    l "好——好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2721
translate chinese klarapause2_fa69a100:

    # l "{i}Track and field, huh...?"
    l "{i}田径啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2722
translate chinese klarapause2_1cf031fa:

    # l "{i}I think there's a lot of types of events included, or whatever they call them..."
    l "{i}好像田径里包含很多项目，名字五花八门的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2723
translate chinese klarapause2_52aed1e6:

    # l "{i}The idea of me being an athlete isn't really sinking in to me."
    l "{i}当运动员说实话并不吸引我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2724
translate chinese klarapause2_ef91c3a4:

    # l "{i}I don't have any health issues, in fact, I'm quite fit to do it. But the sport doesn't really pique my interest at all."
    l "{i}我没有任何健康问题，相反，我觉得我的身体很适合运动。但是我就是没有兴趣。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2725
translate chinese klarapause2_0bba846a:

    # l "{i}It's just a simple sport anyway... Why was she so enthusiastic about it?"
    l "{i}本来也就只是个简单到无聊的运动……她为什么那么上心呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2726
translate chinese klarapause2_44724fa0:

    # l "{i}I bet anybody could do it. What else do they do aside from running?"
    l "{i}我觉得谁上谁都行。毕竟就只是跑步而已啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2727
translate chinese klarapause2_c6e2d9b3:

    # l "{i}Well... I guess I can go with her later and check it out at least."
    l "{i}嗯……要不我之后跟她去看看，亲眼体会一下吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2728
translate chinese klarapause2_f2a8ac83:

    # l "{i}I won't lose anything by doing so. It's not like my parents are around to scold me anymore."
    l "{i}去一趟我也不会损失什么。毕竟我的父母也不会再来说我了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2729
translate chinese klarapause2_b37ebf6e:

    # l "{i}Sorry, mom and dad. I might have to go back home a bit late today..."
    l "{i}对不起，妈妈，爸爸。今天我估计要晚回家了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2732
translate chinese klarapause2_3e576da9:

    # g1 "Hey, you want to join the Volleyball club? I heard they have a lot of slots for tryouts this year!"
    g1 "哎，你要加入排球社吗？我听说他们今年有很多名额呢！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2733
translate chinese klarapause2_03c17e8b:

    # g2 "Really?"
    g2 "真的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2734
translate chinese klarapause2_57d6d18b:

    # g2 "What will we even do there? We are not cut out for that kind of sport. Volleyball is for tall players, dumbass."
    g2 "我们去那干嘛？我们根本就不适合打排球啊。排球是给高个子的人玩的，傻瓜。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2735
translate chinese klarapause2_70247080:

    # g1 "Come on! It will make us look cooler, I am telling you! Just imagine wearing the club's official jersey!"
    g1 "别这么说嘛！去了会让我们看着很帅的！想想穿上排球社的运动衫的样子！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2736
translate chinese klarapause2_6c295cbe:

    # g2 "That's all you are aiming for by joining a club? Jeez..."
    g2 "你加社团就是为了这个？天啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2737
translate chinese klarapause2_0259d102:

    # g1 "Yeah, but it's not a bad idea to try, right?"
    g1 "是啊，试试又没什么坏处，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2738
translate chinese klarapause2_3eb484e3:

    # g2 "Well... That ain't so bad... Is it?"
    g2 "好吧……确实不是什么坏主意……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2739
translate chinese klarapause2_191aacf9:

    # l "{i}It seems like Volleyball is pretty popular here, huh? Everyone seems interested in joining their club."
    l "{i}排球社这么受欢迎啊？每个人都想进。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2740
translate chinese klarapause2_9d52d7ac:

    # l "{i}Anyway, I should focus on today's classes before thinking about anything else."
    l "{i}不过，现在还是别想别的，专心上课吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2741
translate chinese klarapause2_239bb141:

    # l "{i}That's what I came here for, first and foremost, not for these silly little clubs everyone is talking about right now."
    l "{i}毕竟学习才是我来上学的目的，可不是那些花里胡哨的社团活动。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2751
translate chinese klarapause2_ef2c7e6e:

    # an "Alright, now we wait."
    an "好了，现在只能等她了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2752
translate chinese klarapause2_2bf0b06e:

    # an "My convincing technique might be a little bit shallow, but... oh well..."
    an "我招新的技巧可能不太行，但是……希望……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2753
translate chinese klarapause2_657af60d:

    # an "I can wait for thirty minutes, if she doesn't show up, then I'll take it as a 'no' from her."
    an "我最多能等30分钟，要是她不来，那就当她拒绝了吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2756
translate chinese klarapause2_e16ec90c:

    # an "*crack*"
    an "*咔*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2758
translate chinese klarapause2_e16ec90c_1:

    # an "*crack*"
    an "*咔*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2760
translate chinese klarapause2_e16ec90c_2:

    # an "*crack*"
    an "*咔*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2762
translate chinese klarapause2_e16ec90c_3:

    # an "*crack*"
    an "*咔*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2765
translate chinese klarapause2_1b391abf:

    # an "Hup!"
    an "哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2768
translate chinese klarapause2_1b391abf_1:

    # an "Hup!"
    an "哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2771
translate chinese klarapause2_d65181d4:

    # an "Hng...!"
    an "嗯……！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2774
translate chinese klarapause2_bea18325:

    # an "Hm?"
    an "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2777
translate chinese klarapause2_6dc8f4e8:

    # an "Hey, hey, hey~! Look who's here!"
    an "哎，哎，这儿呢！瞧瞧谁来了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2780
translate chinese klarapause2_0356c188:

    # an "Have you finally decided to join? Or..."
    an "你决定要加入了吗？还是说……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2781
translate chinese klarapause2_f97fc243:

    # l "Not yet. I just want to check it out for now."
    l "还没呢。我只是想先去看看。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2782
translate chinese klarapause2_b0b0c0ef:

    # l "I mean... it wouldn't hurt to join. It's an extracurricular activity anyway, but it will be pointless if I'm not interested in it."
    l "其实……就算真的入社了也没什么坏处。毕竟只是课外活动而已。但如果我不感兴趣的话就没意义了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2783
translate chinese klarapause2_7a978f79:

    # an "You make a good point there. I won't force you to join after this. It's all up to you, but trust me, my teammates are all awesome people!"
    an "你说得很对。我不会强迫你加入的。一切都交给你自己决定，但请你相信我，我的队友们都很棒的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2786
translate chinese klarapause2_509edbab:

    # an "Anyway... Wear these!"
    an "好啦……穿上这个吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2787
translate chinese klarapause2_062a68cf:

    # l "Running shoes? What for?"
    l "跑鞋？为什么？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2788
translate chinese klarapause2_fbe3ab35:

    # an "It's testing time!"
    an "当然是为了测试啦！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2789
translate chinese klarapause2_be152d59:

    # l "Huh? But I'm not-"
    l "啊？但是我——"

# game/ep6.rpy:2790
translate chinese klarapause2_6659e8a9:

    # an "Nope! Come on, just do it! The stadium is just a kilometer away."
    an "行啦行啦！穿上就是了！体育场只有一千米远。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2791
translate chinese klarapause2_6ff02078:

    # an "And besides, no school shoes are allowed inside the stadium."
    an "再说了，体育场里也不让穿皮鞋。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2792
translate chinese klarapause2_f0258aab:

    # l "Eh? That's weird..."
    l "是吗？那还挺奇怪的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2793
translate chinese klarapause2_10181e68:

    # an "Yep, it is! It's just a team rule that we came up with. We gotta pay respect to the Gods of Track and Field! Ahaha!"
    an "当然啊！这是我们一致同意的队规。要尊重田径之神！哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2794
translate chinese klarapause2_5a71e2f2:

    # l "*sighs*... I can see this is going downhill already."
    l "*叹气*……我已经开始有不好的预感了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2802
translate chinese klarapause2_04197991:

    # l "{i}The shoes are a good fit for me. How did she..."
    l "{i}这双鞋我穿着很合适。她怎么……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2805
translate chinese klarapause2_a29e4017:

    # l "How did you know my foot size?"
    l "你怎么知道我的脚的尺码的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2806
translate chinese klarapause2_372135d4:

    # an "Hm? I didn't. It's just a guess since we're pretty much the same height."
    an "啊？我不知道呀。我只是看你跟我差不多一样高，就猜你会穿这么大的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2809
translate chinese klarapause2_d698475f:

    # an "If it didn't fit, then... well... I dunno..."
    an "要是不合适的话，那……嗯，我也不知道……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2810
translate chinese klarapause2_0ad6b005:

    # l "{i}What an airhead..."
    l "{i}真是个笨蛋啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2813
translate chinese klarapause2_3c193f5e:

    # an "But hey, you look pretty good in them! Look at you~!"
    an "但是，你穿着很棒啊！你瞧瞧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2814
translate chinese klarapause2_90b23313:

    # l "Yeah, it's not that bad."
    l "是啊，确实很不错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2817
translate chinese klarapause2_d2e8a078:

    # an "The school uniform is still not that great though... I hate it. It's so tight that I can barely breathe!"
    an "但是校服就不怎么样了……我不喜欢。实在太紧了，我穿着都呼吸不了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2820
translate chinese klarapause2_47bbf2f1:

    # an "Let's not do any more chatting. Time is gold! I mean it... Literally."
    an "先别聊天啦。时间就是金钱！我这句话……可就是得用字面意义理解。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2821
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_2:

    # l "......"
    l "......."

# game/ep6.rpy:2822
translate chinese klarapause2_fb820f3c:

    # l "I don't get it..."
    l "我听不懂……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2823
translate chinese klarapause2_5b0da4d8:

    # an "*giggles* I'll tell you about it next time. Time for a short warm-up now!"
    an "*笑* 之后我会跟你解释的。现在是热身时间！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2824
translate chinese klarapause2_c6c955e3:

    # l "Okay..."
    l "好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2832
translate chinese klarapause2_2dbbd358:

    # an "Alright, here we are!"
    an "好了，我们到啦！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2835
translate chinese klarapause2_7691eb11:

    # an "......"
    an "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2836
translate chinese klarapause2_8e6d3633:

    # an "Huh? Where is she?"
    an "哎？她人呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2837
translate chinese klarapause2_dfe041d9:

    # an "Ahh! I must have left her behind!"
    an "不好！肯定是没跟上我！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2840
translate chinese klarapause2_2ee443bb:

    # l "*huff* *huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2841
translate chinese klarapause2_4c5bf9cb:

    # an "Oh, there you are! I thought I lost you or something. Did you have trouble keeping up?"
    an "噢，你在这啊！我还以为你跟丢我了。你很难跟上我吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2844
translate chinese klarapause2_c9b2fe08:

    # l "Isn't it... obvious? I thought... we were just going for a jog? Why were you... running so fast?"
    l "你难道……看不出来吗？我还以为……只是要慢跑一下？你为什么……跑那么快啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2845
translate chinese klarapause2_2ee443bb_1:

    # l "*huff* *huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2846
translate chinese klarapause2_94308772:

    # an "Ahaha! I'm sorry, I'm sorry! But really, I was just jogging!"
    an "啊哈哈！对不起，对不起！但我真的只是在慢跑！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2847
translate chinese klarapause2_06f49f5a:

    # l "You're lying!"
    l "怎么可能！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2848
translate chinese klarapause2_fbadafa7:

    # l "*huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2849
translate chinese klarapause2_b583d2ec:

    # an "Nope! Trust me, my teammates jog a lot faster than me."
    an "不骗你！我跟你说，我的队友们的慢跑可比我快多了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2850
translate chinese klarapause2_deb47e70:

    # l "For real?"
    l "真的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2851
translate chinese klarapause2_5253ba04:

    # an "Yeah! Isn't it exciting?"
    an "是啊！是不是很兴奋？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2852
translate chinese klarapause2_464fe725:

    # l "No, not really. It makes me nervous instead."
    l "不，一点也不兴奋。我更紧张了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2853
translate chinese klarapause2_d6615252:

    # an "Wahahaha~!"
    an "啊哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2854
translate chinese klarapause2_e14379b9:

    # an "Come here, I'll show you the environment here."
    an "来吧，我带你四处转转。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2858
translate chinese klarapause2_68368b28:

    # an "Let me introduce to you our second home..."
    an "向你介绍我们的第二个家……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2861
translate chinese klarapause2_d0a4d933:

    # an "The city's official stadium..."
    an "市里的公立体育场……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2870
translate chinese klarapause2_d18ead9e:

    # l "Wow... It's... It's really huge..."
    l "哇……这……这里也太大了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2871
translate chinese klarapause2_a128787d:

    # an "Right~?"
    an "对吧~？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2872
translate chinese klarapause2_2f6ff1b6:

    # an "How does this compare to the things you saw on televisions?"
    an "实物跟你在电视里看见的比起来怎么样？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2873
translate chinese klarapause2_988d1bc6:

    # l "I-it's nothing like it. It looks very small compared to this..."
    l "呃，完全没法比较啊。电视上看的体育场都显得特别小……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2874
translate chinese klarapause2_90456e40:

    # an "To be honest with you, Olympic-sized stadiums are way bigger. It's just that the camera angles make them look smaller because they usually film things from up top."
    an "实话告诉你，奥运会级别的体育场比这里还要大得多。只是通常田径比赛都从空中俯拍，所以是摄像机的角度让场馆显得更小了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2875
translate chinese klarapause2_147faaaf:

    # an "But once you're the one inside the stadium, you can actually see things for yourself."
    an "真正的魅力，还是要靠你亲眼来看看才能体会。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2876
translate chinese klarapause2_fcbb6b80:

    # an "We are lucky that we have this as a training ground instead of an ordinary school track."
    an "我们很幸运，能在这里，而不是学校里普通的跑道上训练。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2877
translate chinese klarapause2_c4c1c38e:

    # an "This right here is our second home. The place where we shed blood, sweat, and tears in order to get to the top."
    an "这里就是我们的第二个家。我们就在这里流血、流泪、流汗，只为能跑得最快。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2878
translate chinese klarapause2_2e604620:

    # l "*gulps*"
    l "*吸气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2879
translate chinese klarapause2_dcb2c77d:

    # an "Heh... Are you still nervous?"
    an "嗯……你还是很紧张吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2880
translate chinese klarapause2_78445686:

    # l "No, right now... I'm just in awe. I've never been in an actual stadium before. This is my first time."
    l "不，不是……我只是感到有些……敬畏。我之前从来没来过体育场。这是第一次。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2883
translate chinese klarapause2_13631e9e:

    # an "Well, I'm glad I could be the one to deflower you. Wahaha!"
    an "好吧，那我很高兴可以收下你的第一次。啊哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2886
translate chinese klarapause2_124b3a16:

    # l "You could've said that with a bit more tact, you know?"
    l "你说话之前从来都不过脑子的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2887
translate chinese klarapause2_f23ec98c:

    # an "Haha. Don't mind me, that's just the way I talk. Don't let it get to you."
    an "哈哈。别在意，我说话一直这样。别生气嘛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2890
translate chinese klarapause2_1bab0ece:

    # an "Come! Let's take a walk on the track. I'll introduce you to the team while we're at it."
    an "来吧！我们在跑道上走走。同时我也会给你介绍一下队里的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2891
translate chinese klarapause2_adf11e47:

    # l "Are we allowed to do that?"
    l "可以随便逛吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2892
translate chinese klarapause2_4be86639:

    # an "Of course! Just because they are in the middle of training, doesn't mean we can't step inside."
    an "当然！虽然她们正在训练，但这也不影响我们。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2894
translate chinese klarapause2_491644e4:

    # l "Alright then."
    l "好吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2898
translate chinese klarapause2_05a59654:

    # l "*steps*"
    l "*踏上*"

# game/ep6.rpy:2899
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_3:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:2900
translate chinese klarapause2_d0bf7c5b:

    # l "That's weird..."
    l "好奇怪……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2901
translate chinese klarapause2_9a6298cc:

    # an "Hm? How does the rubber feel?"
    an "橡胶的感觉如何？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2902
translate chinese klarapause2_fbc0b4bd:

    # l "Is the track made of rubber?"
    l "跑道是用橡胶做的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2905
translate chinese klarapause2_6e2a7b3e:

    # an "Yeah, a hundred percent synthetic rubber. It's composed of rubber particles so it makes the spike shoes grip to it a lot better."
    an "是啊，百分百的合成橡胶。这样能让钉鞋抓得更紧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2908
translate chinese klarapause2_41954ab0:

    # l "It's a bit springy... but it feels... quite comfortable?"
    l "有点弹性……但是感觉……还挺舒服的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2909
translate chinese klarapause2_03136928:

    # an "Haha! I had almost the same reaction when I first stepped in here. That makes me happy in a way."
    an "哈哈！我第一次踩在这上面的时候，也是跟你几乎一样的反应。这种感觉让我还挺开心的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2910
translate chinese klarapause2_96fb2627:

    # an "But yeah, it's better than running on tracks made of dirt, rocks, and sand, that's for sure. You can feel every step you make on a rubber track."
    an "但是，在这里跑步，肯定比在全是灰尘、石头和沙子的跑道上舒服得多。在橡胶跑道上，能清楚地感受到自己踏出的每一步。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2913
translate chinese klarapause2_179c02ef:

    # l "Now that you mention it, how long have you been running?"
    l "对了，你练跑步多久了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2916
translate chinese klarapause2_23eafd14:

    # an "Ehm... Well... I got interested in it since I was in primary school. I saw a Track and Field competition on TV just like you."
    an "嗯……我自己的话……我在上小学的时候就已经感兴趣了。我跟你一样，在电视上看到了田径比赛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2917
translate chinese klarapause2_bcf9f4a3:

    # an "I got curious and started running during middle school. So it has been years, and I never stopped since then."
    an "我很好奇，就在初中的时候开始跑步了。所以，我跑步已经很多年了，中间我从来没有停下过。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2920
translate chinese klarapause2_2e124dda:

    # l "Have you ever won?"
    l "你拿过冠军吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2921
translate chinese klarapause2_298594c6:

    # an "You can't win every time, there's a lot of prodigies out there that are much better than you. But I did win quite a lot of events already."
    an "没人能一直当第一的，总有一些奇才会比你厉害的多。但是，我确实拿过不少比赛的冠军了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2922
translate chinese klarapause2_2c7a8bb3:

    # an "If we are talking about experience, I have loads of it! Haha!"
    an "要是谈经验的话，我可是身经百战了！哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2923
translate chinese klarapause2_451ec8ef:

    # an "Although, it has been eating away at my studies. All I can think about is training and running since I started."
    an "不过，代价就是我的功课都荒废了。我一开始跑步之后满脑子就只有训练和奔跑这两件事了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2926
translate chinese klarapause2_84653405:

    # l "Uhm... I think you've got your priorities backwards..."
    l "呃……我觉得你是不是把学习和跑步的优先级搞反了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2927
translate chinese klarapause2_a24a2826:

    # an "That's the biggest drawback, being involved seriously in sports while studying isn't an easy task. You gotta manage your time properly."
    an "这就是最大的坏处。你不可能全身心地投入运动，同时还努力学习的。必须合理安排时间才行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2928
translate chinese klarapause2_2508fc42:

    # l "Do you?"
    l "那你能做到合理安排时间吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2929
translate chinese klarapause2_ea7df294:

    # an "No, I don't."
    an "当然做不到。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2930
translate chinese klarapause2_f0a5246c:

    # l "I thought so..."
    l "我就知道……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2933
translate chinese klarapause2_1fcd1934:

    # un "Anne, you have thirty minutes. Finish it up and do your drills. Don't forget the usual five laps of jog."
    un "安妮，给你30分钟的时间。带人转完之后就开始例行练习。别忘了那五圈慢跑。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2934
translate chinese klarapause2_7d2f5e4a:

    # an "Yeah, yeah! I got it, Ed! But I already jogged on my way here."
    an "好，好！知道啦，艾德！但是我来的路上已经慢跑过了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2935
translate chinese klarapause2_1b5023e0:

    # ed "No, add another five laps on top of that. We need to work on your stamina."
    ed "那就再加五圈。该练练你的耐力了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2936
translate chinese klarapause2_0679a08a:

    # an "Yes! Copy that, Ed!"
    an "好！知道了，艾德！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2939
translate chinese klarapause2_5b3ca317:

    # ed "*sighs* If only the rest of this team was more like you."
    ed "*叹气* 要是剩下的人都像你这么听话就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2942
translate chinese klarapause2_c35998ab:

    # an "That's Ed, by the way. He is both our coach and our trainer."
    an "那个是艾德。他是我们的教练和训练师。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2945
translate chinese klarapause2_8b6a236d:

    # an "He's been coaching the team for almost five years now. At least, that's what he says."
    an "他已经在队里执教快5年了。至少他是这么说的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2946
translate chinese klarapause2_ab50f49c:

    # an "He's considered one of the top trainers in the whole region. He is very strict, but pays excellent attention to your progress."
    an "他是这一带最顶尖的训练师之一。他要求非常严格，但是也会对每个人的进度格外上心。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2947
translate chinese klarapause2_8975860d:

    # an "When you have him as a coach, there is no doubt that you'll shed tears in no time."
    an "有他做教练，恐怕没一会儿你就要哭鼻子了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2950
translate chinese klarapause2_494db845:

    # un "Yes, team captain wannabe. Do your drills or you will be the one who will shed tears in no time, airhead."
    un "是啊，下任队长。赶紧去练习，不然没一会儿就轮到你哭鼻子了，笨蛋。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2951
translate chinese klarapause2_280f3ac7:

    # an "Ugh! Mind your own business, you monster! Can't a woman slack for a bit?!"
    an "烦哎！管好你自己，你个怪物！我就不能休息一会儿吗？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2954
translate chinese klarapause2_e94b52a7:

    # un "By the way, good job finding an applicant in my place. I will buy you a popsicle after today's training."
    un "对了，谢谢你替我招到了新人。训练完之后我请你吃雪糕。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2955
translate chinese klarapause2_8710fd7c:

    # an "Wait, really~?!"
    an "哇，真的吗~？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2956
translate chinese klarapause2_7504c687:

    # un "We'll talk about it later. Bye~!"
    un "之后再说吧。拜拜~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2962
translate chinese klarapause2_5be8f780:

    # an "The one I just talked to is Nisha."
    an "刚刚和我说话的人是尼莎。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2965
translate chinese klarapause2_8b70410e:

    # an "The other one is her twin sister Natasha."
    an "另一个人是她的双胞胎妹妹，娜塔莎。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2966
translate chinese klarapause2_6854abea:

    # an "Both are in their 3rd year."
    an "她俩都是高三的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2967
translate chinese klarapause2_e6b523c0:

    # an "The two of them are our distance runners. They run all the longest races which are the 3000 and 5000 meters."
    an "这二位是队里的长跑选手。最长的3000米和5000米她们都能跑。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2968
translate chinese klarapause2_86201145:

    # an "They even run the 1500 meters race. They're real monsters in terms of stamina."
    an "她们甚至还能跑1500米的比赛。在耐力这方面，她俩真的是怪物。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2969
translate chinese klarapause2_ba0ef7f6:

    # an "Though, if you ask me who's stronger, I'd say Nisha. She started running way before her twin sister followed her."
    an "但，如果你想知道她俩谁的实力更强的话，我觉得是尼莎。她开始跑步的时间比她妹妹早很多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2970
translate chinese klarapause2_eb2e4855:

    # an "If you want some tips on improving your lungs, you should talk to them. Or you can always just ask for advice from Ed instead."
    an "如果你想要一些加强肺部的建议，去问她俩就对了。或者，不管什么事情，你都可以去问问艾德，看他有什么建议。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2971
translate chinese klarapause2_62b4b8fc:

    # an "But all that will depend on your strength and what event you're going to compete in."
    an "但那都取决于你的实力，以及你想参加哪种比赛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2972
translate chinese klarapause2_124475e7:

    # l "I see."
    l "我知道了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2973
translate chinese klarapause2_92dd6b23:

    # an "Don't think about it for now. Once you finally decide to join, that's when we'll test you out and find what event coach will put you in."
    an "现在先不用考虑这些。一旦你决定要加入了，我们会给你一些测试，看你适合哪种距离的比赛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2974
translate chinese klarapause2_816204f9:

    # l "Alright."
    l "好吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2980
translate chinese klarapause2_d3638423:

    # an "Yoh, Lidia! Your jumps are flawless as always! Keep up the good work!"
    an "哟，莱迪亚！起跳还是很漂亮啊！继续保持！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2983
translate chinese klarapause2_01369704:

    # lid "Thanks, Second Captain. But I'm your senior, you should treat me like one."
    lid "谢了，队长二号。但我是你的前辈，你最好还是多尊重我一点。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2984
translate chinese klarapause2_1d98c5a1:

    # an "I always do!"
    an "我一直都很尊重你！"

# game/ep6.rpy:2985
translate chinese klarapause2_f145ea6a:

    # lid "No, you obviously don't."
    lid "不，你显然没有。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2988
translate chinese klarapause2_80a928ad:

    # un "Hey, Anne! Is she a new applicant? Is she joining?"
    un "嘿，安妮！这就是新人吗？她决定要加入了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:2991
translate chinese klarapause2_01c9f133:

    # an "Not yet, I guess? I'm just showing her around for now."
    an "暂时还没有？我只是带她四处转转。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2992
translate chinese klarapause2_e9bedcab:

    # un "Oh, I see..."
    un "噢，好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:2995
translate chinese klarapause2_927dd89e:

    # un "I hope you actually will join the team, we are kinda one person short at the moment."
    un "我希望你最终愿意加入我们，我们现在正好缺一个人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2996
translate chinese klarapause2_52f13964:

    # l "I'll think about it."
    l "我会仔细考虑的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:2999
translate chinese klarapause2_1361dd7c:

    # un "Awesome! Enjoy the tour~!"
    un "棒极了！祝你旅途愉快~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3000
translate chinese klarapause2_222ebc70:

    # l "I will, thanks!"
    l "好的，谢谢！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3003
translate chinese klarapause2_5ea88234:

    # l "She's so jolly!"
    l "她好活泼啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3006
translate chinese klarapause2_5be9b3bd:

    # l "I like her! Haha!"
    l "我喜欢她！哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3009
translate chinese klarapause2_568f2dbc:

    # an "Yep, that's Miwa for you."
    an "是啊，米瓦就是这样的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3012
translate chinese klarapause2_9d47806a:

    # an "The other one is her cousin, Lidia. Also both in their 3rd year."
    an "另一个是她的表亲，莱迪亚。也是都是高三的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3013
translate chinese klarapause2_720a5b47:

    # an "The two of them compete in the hurdle events. Both 100 and 400 meters hurdles."
    an "这两位是跨栏选手。100米栏和400米栏都参加。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3014
translate chinese klarapause2_bfd765c8:

    # an "Don't let their looks fool you, especially Miwa. She doesn't like to talk about it, but she's one heck of a hardcore when it comes to her events."
    an "别被她们的外表给骗了，特别是米瓦。她平时不爱谈这些，不过跨栏这方面，确实没什么人能跟她比。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3015
translate chinese klarapause2_656ad04d:

    # an "She may be short, but she's always managed to win something in all her competitions so far. Every city in the region has eyes on her right now."
    an "她虽然矮，但目前参加过的所有比赛里面，她全都取得过奖项。各个城市可都有不少双眼睛盯着她呢。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3016
translate chinese klarapause2_d4064421:

    # an "I'm just glad that she's on our team or she'd be trouble."
    an "还好她是我的队友，不然可就麻烦了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3017
translate chinese klarapause2_11980822:

    # l "How about her sister?"
    l "那她的表亲呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3018
translate chinese klarapause2_95204bcf:

    # an "Lidia? She's good! Like... extremely good! I think she has the most perfect jumping form I've seen, by far!"
    an "莱迪亚？她也很厉害！就……非常厉害！我觉得她的跨栏动作是我见过的最完美的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3019
translate chinese klarapause2_252582e2:

    # an "So much so that the coach compliments her every time she jumps over a hurdle. Haha!"
    an "甚至教练每次看到她跨栏都会忍不住夸她。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3020
translate chinese klarapause2_11e59c1d:

    # an "In terms of overall strength... both are pretty even."
    an "这两位的综合实力……可以说不分伯仲。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3021
translate chinese klarapause2_ccc45e6d:

    # an "They even count each other's scores whenever they do a time trial!"
    an "她俩甚至每次切磋的时候都会记录胜负！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3022
translate chinese klarapause2_0e6dd7f0:

    # an "Right now, it's 21-22 in favor of Lidia. I'm sure Miwa will tie that score again next time, so it's just a bother to try and think about it."
    an "目前，比分是21-22，莱迪亚领先一分。不过米瓦下次肯定就会赢回来的，所以就不要费力去想她俩谁强谁弱这种问题了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3025
translate chinese klarapause2_9a92b59f:

    # l "I get it, but why does everyone like to call you second captain or something like that?"
    l "我知道了。不过为什么每个人都爱喊你队长二号这种外号呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3026
translate chinese klarapause2_50f03792:

    # an "Eh, no... I'm not a captain, I'm not the type to shoulder responsibility for a team. I just like to compliment everyone for their hard work, that's all."
    an "呃……我不是队长。我不是那种能担负起带领整个队伍前进的责任的人。我只是喜欢在大家努力的时候给她们一些赞美，仅此而已。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3027
translate chinese klarapause2_6f12f758_1:

    # l "I see..."
    l "我明白了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3030
translate chinese klarapause2_3677cc7c:

    # ca "Hey, you're here. Clap for us real quick, Anne."
    ca "嘿，你来啦。过来帮我们拍个手，安妮。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3031
translate chinese klarapause2_f4a8048c:

    # an "Heeh... Doing your workouts already?"
    an "哈……已经开始训练了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3034
translate chinese klarapause2_294b7c0f:

    # un "Yeah, coach gave us ten rounds of 300 meters this time."
    un "是啊，教练这次让我们跑10个300米。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3035
translate chinese klarapause2_261b755a:

    # an "Just ten?! That's pretty light!"
    an "才10个？！这么轻松啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3036
translate chinese klarapause2_30762b84:

    # un "Well, ask coach. 'Cuz I have no idea why. But I love this workout, this is the only distance where I can beat Cap'n."
    un "谁知道呢，问教练去。我也不知道为什么。不过我喜欢这种练习，也就在这个距离我才能跑赢队长了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3037
translate chinese klarapause2_f0f9ade8:

    # ca "*chuckles* Tell me that once you actually do, Brook."
    ca "*笑* 等你真正赢过我之后再说吧，布鲁克。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3038
translate chinese klarapause2_2fb6f7a7:

    # an "Alright, enough chit-chat. Time to run ladies."
    an "好了，就聊到这吧。该起跑了，女士们。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3041
translate chinese klarapause2_5316b3ad:

    # br "I'm ready."
    br "我准备好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3044
translate chinese klarapause2_7691eb11_1:

    # an "......"
    an "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3047
translate chinese klarapause2_04a0deef:

    # an "Set!"
    an "预备！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3050
translate chinese klarapause2_a1434b19:

    # an "*claps*!"
    an "*拍手*！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3051
translate chinese klarapause2_a2992cf1:

    # l "Are they the middle distance runners?"
    l "她们是中距离的选手吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3052
translate chinese klarapause2_cb10e81e:

    # an "Damn right! You catch on pretty quick, Lily!"
    an "非常对！你学得挺快啊，莉莉！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3055
translate chinese klarapause2_ad6c1d15:

    # an "Brook..."
    an "布鲁克……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3056
translate chinese klarapause2_38641468:

    # an "We both tried out for the team last year and she used to be my partner, but coach recently discovered her stamina and moved her to be Cathy's partner instead."
    an "我们两个都是去年加入队里的，她之前是我的搭档。但教练最近发现她的耐力不错，就把她调去当凯西的搭档了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3057
translate chinese klarapause2_7fe22c04:

    # an "At the moment, she's still trying to get used to the workouts and has been trying to match Cathy's time."
    an "现在，她还在努力适应新的训练内容，也正在追赶凯西的成绩。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3060
translate chinese klarapause2_249d0737:

    # an "Cathy..."
    an "凯西……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3061
translate chinese klarapause2_a13ba0fe:

    # an "Our one and only Captain, and the best in the whole universe!"
    an "我们独一无二、仅此一个的队长，也是全宇宙最好的队长！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3062
translate chinese klarapause2_0a1b62ef:

    # an "She might look intimidating, but that's just her looks. She's good at inspiring and lifting everyone's mood whenever we are struggling. That's why I love her. Haha!"
    an "她看着有点吓人，但也只是看着而已。在我们遇到困难的时候，她是最能给我们启发、给我们打气的人。所以我特别爱她。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3063
translate chinese klarapause2_1f9b563b:

    # an "You'll discover her qualities as a captain when you get to know her more."
    an "你多了解她之后，就会发现她有多适合当队长了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3064
translate chinese klarapause2_c5adf153:

    # l "So, what are the events the middle runners handle?"
    l "中距离的选手是跑哪种比赛呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3065
translate chinese klarapause2_311a9445:

    # an "Right now, they are both running the 400 and 800 meters events. You can consider them sprinters in a way, but with much better endurance."
    an "目前，她们是参加400米和800米的比赛。你也可以把她们当成一种特别的短跑选手，因为她们的耐久力要更好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3066
translate chinese klarapause2_6f12f758_2:

    # l "I see..."
    l "我知道了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3069
translate chinese klarapause2_2c388fb6:

    # an "And lastly, there's me."
    an "而最后呢，就是我了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3072
translate chinese klarapause2_81f00d2f:

    # an "Pardon the late introduction, but my name is Anne. Nice to meet you, Lily."
    an "抱歉我这么晚才自我介绍，我的名字是安妮。很高兴认识你，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3073
translate chinese klarapause2_befd7966:

    # l "Yeah, nice to meet you too."
    l "认识你我也很高兴。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3074
translate chinese klarapause2_f1abf7f9:

    # an "I handle the best of all the events! The sprints!"
    an "我专攻的是所有比赛里最棒的！那就是短跑！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3075
translate chinese klarapause2_e1d3b3e4:

    # an "There's three events for sprinters, actually. 100, 200, and 400 meters dash. If you're running international, that is."
    an "短跑其实有三种比赛。100米，200米和400米。但那是参加国际性赛事的情况。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3076
translate chinese klarapause2_401aec77:

    # an "High school competitions only consider 100 and 200 as sprinter's events."
    an "高中之间的比赛只有100米和200米两个项目。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3077
translate chinese klarapause2_91598817:

    # an "400 and 800 are middles."
    an "400米和800米是中距离。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3078
translate chinese klarapause2_5ede9547:

    # an "1500, 3000, and 5000 meters runs are the long-distance."
    an "1500米，3000米和5000米跑是长跑。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3079
translate chinese klarapause2_668f3ec9:

    # an "In international competitions they classify 3000 meters as a middle distance, which is really absurd if you ask me. That's obviously a long run. Haha!"
    an "国际比赛里，3000米被归到中距离那一档了，我觉得特别奇怪。这明显是长跑嘛。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3080
translate chinese klarapause2_125796aa:

    # l "Yeah, that's a pretty long run to be considered middle distance."
    l "是啊，那种距离绝对算不上是中距离了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3081
translate chinese klarapause2_a128787d_1:

    # an "Right~?"
    an "对吧~？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3084
translate chinese klarapause2_b94dfab9:

    # an "So... Was that interesting enough to convince you to join the team?"
    an "那么……你现在感兴趣了吗？愿意加入吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3085
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_4:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3088
translate chinese klarapause2_d898dd59:

    # l "...I am definitely intrigued... but..."
    l "……我当然有了兴趣……不过……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3089
translate chinese klarapause2_68ff5afb:

    # an "But...?"
    an "不过……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3090
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_5:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3093
translate chinese klarapause2_f4d5bdfa:

    # l "...Huh?"
    l "……哎？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3096
translate chinese klarapause2_30a44593:

    # l "Whaaa~!"
    l "哇啊啊~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3097
translate chinese klarapause2_0ce30657:

    # l "W-w-why are you all here?!"
    l "为——为——为什么你们全来了啊？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3100
translate chinese klarapause2_789feee7:

    # ca "We're quite interested to hear what you're going to say, please don't mind us."
    ca "我们都很想知道你的答案是什么，不用在意我们。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3103
translate chinese klarapause2_97a6d0e2:

    # miw "Come on... Join us! We can't compete for the upcoming winter tournaments if we lack one member..."
    miw "来吧……加入我们吧！要是缺一个人的话，我们就不能参加冬天的联赛了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3106
translate chinese klarapause2_059cf8a1:

    # ca "Actually, we can. But the team will be at a huge disadvantage."
    ca "事实上，也不是不能。只是我们会有非常大的劣势。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3107
translate chinese klarapause2_2c7d6998:

    # ca "You guys can still run your events, sure. You might all win, and that's great. But that's not all there is to Track and Field."
    ca "你们依然能正常参加自己的比赛。你们还可能全部拿到冠军，那就太棒了。但是田径不止是这样的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3108
translate chinese klarapause2_3fac8f09:

    # ca "There is a point system that determines the team that wins a meet. Whether the whole team wins or loses the competition is decided by that system."
    ca "有一个积分机制决定一个队伍的整体名次。整个队伍的输赢都是靠这个机制来决定的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3109
translate chinese klarapause2_40c4410a:

    # ca "Every athlete who runs gets one point even if you lose. As long as you reach the finish line, that's all that matters."
    ca "每位运动员不论名次，只要完成比赛，就可以积一分。不管快不快，越过终点线才是最重要的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3110
translate chinese klarapause2_dbf2cb97:

    # ca "And there's no better joy than to win as a team."
    ca "而世上也没有比作为一个队伍一起走向胜利更快乐的事了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3111
translate chinese klarapause2_9e1cdf6f:

    # an "Damn right, Captain~!"
    an "说得太对了，队长~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3112
translate chinese klarapause2_1a1eca77:

    # ca "But we are not forcing you, Lily. I'm just trying to tell you that we need another teammate who will aim for the Nationals this year."
    ca "但我们不会强迫你的，莉莉。我只想告诉你，我们还需要一个人，来帮助我们一起冲击今年的全国联赛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3115
translate chinese klarapause2_608405b4:

    # ca "And I'm not joking. Our team has been one of the top competitors in the region for almost ten years straight."
    ca "并且，不开玩笑地说，我们这个队伍已经连续十年都是全国最顶尖的队伍之一了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3116
translate chinese klarapause2_b8af972a:

    # ca "Drealerra Academy is a living legend when it comes to sports. And the Track and Field team always aims for the top."
    ca "在运动领域，德列拉学院一直都是传说级的。而我们田径队的目标就只有冠军。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3119
translate chinese klarapause2_b217963b:

    # l "I get it, yeah... But, I don't even know if I can handle it."
    l "我知道了，好吧……但是，我都不知道我有没有这个能力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3120
translate chinese klarapause2_903ba988:

    # l "When I stepped on the track today, I felt something clicking with me. I can't really explain what it is, but I was terrified of that feeling."
    l "我今天第一次踏上跑道的时候，感觉心里有一股躁动。我说不清楚那是什么感觉，但我有点害怕。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3121
translate chinese klarapause2_d6680b60:

    # l "When Anne took me for a tour, I was glad to meet new people. But at the same time, I was intimidated."
    l "安妮带我参观的时候，能认识新的人，我很高兴。但同时，我也被吓住了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3122
translate chinese klarapause2_00f159fb:

    # l "I'm... just not the kind of girl who's into sports."
    l "我……恐怕不是适合运动的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3123
translate chinese klarapause2_73ffbef5:

    # l "I didn't even think of playing any sports, even once in my life."
    l "我这辈子甚至从来都没想过要参加任何体育活动，一次都没有。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3126
translate chinese klarapause2_90b7564f:

    # ca "I can't disagree with you. We all went through the same thing and everyone here knows that kind of feeling."
    ca "我懂你的意思。我们都经历过一样的事，这里的每个人也都知道你刚刚提到的那种感觉是什么样的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3129
translate chinese klarapause2_0ba4ce8e:

    # ca "It's just a sport. It's just a club."
    ca "一开始你会想，“就只是个运动而已”，“就只是个社团活动而已”。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3132
translate chinese klarapause2_8a63770f:

    # ca "But once you taste the joy of winning a race, that's when you'll realize that Track and Field is fun."
    ca "但是一旦你知道了成为第一名是什么滋味，你就同时也会领悟田径的乐趣。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3135
translate chinese klarapause2_a0f331b0:

    # an "Mhm! Mhm~!"
    an "嗯！嗯~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3138
translate chinese klarapause2_6552039c:

    # ed "Hey, you guys! Get back to training!"
    ed "喂，你们几个！快回去训练！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3139
translate chinese klarapause2_cb0ad484:

    # ev "Yes, sir!"
    ev "收到，教练！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3142
translate chinese klarapause2_31eed320:

    # an "Don't push yourself, Lily. You're still welcome to join any time."
    an "不用逼自己，莉莉。我们随时都欢迎你加入。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3143
translate chinese klarapause2_af2add43:

    # an "However, I wouldn't advise you to take too long to come up with a decision, or you'll be late for the training schedule. It'll be hard for you to catch up."
    an "但是，我不建议你花太久时间去决定，不然你会错过很多训练。到时候你就赶不上了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3144
translate chinese klarapause2_74bb7915:

    # l "I respect you guys, so... I will think about it and decide tonight."
    l "我很尊重你们，所以……我今晚就会考虑，然后做决定的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3145
translate chinese klarapause2_52e3a213:

    # l "I don't want to keep you in suspense over nothing."
    l "我不想让你们白白期待。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3148
translate chinese klarapause2_7691eb11_2:

    # an "......"
    an "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3151
translate chinese klarapause2_6fb6a055:

    # an "It's nice to know that you're a lot more mature than me."
    an "你比我成熟得多，我很开心。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3152
translate chinese klarapause2_dd926c2c:

    # an "If you ever decide to join, please be my partner."
    an "如果你决定加入，请做我的搭档。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3155
translate chinese klarapause2_5c7aa40a:

    # an "Later, Lily. I have to warm up for my drills and workout."
    an "之后再见了，莉莉。我该去热身，然后训练了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3165
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_6:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3168
translate chinese klarapause2_ec6fcb01:

    # l "*sighs*"
    l "*叹气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3171
translate chinese klarapause2_a220698e:

    # l "{i}What should I do now?"
    l "{i}我该怎么办？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3172
translate chinese klarapause2_3cab4520:

    # l "{i}Joining a club is not half bad since an extracurricular activity is what I wanted. But a sports club?"
    l "{i}加入社团不是坏事，毕竟我就是想要课外活动。但是体育社团？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3173
translate chinese klarapause2_221f04b4:

    # l "{i}I know that if I'm not motivated enough, I won't be able to keep up with it. Especially considering what I saw earlier, it seems to be a pretty intense sport."
    l "{i}我知道要是我热情不足的话，我肯定是跟不上其他人的步调的。特别是今天我还亲眼看过了，都是些竞争性很强的项目。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3174
translate chinese klarapause2_846926b4:

    # l "{i}There's definitely more to it than what I expected it to be. I guess my opinion about it was clearly wrong."
    l "{i}跑步显然比我想的要有深度得多。我之前的观念是完全错误的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3175
translate chinese klarapause2_fa189e64:

    # l "{i}From now on, I should never judge anything before knowing what it really is."
    l "{i}从今往后，我在没有完全了解清楚之前可不能随意下定论了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3178
translate chinese klarapause2_5bdd6954:

    # l "{i}But what was that thing I felt when I first stepped onto the track?"
    l "{i}但我第一次站上跑道的那时候，那到底是什么感觉？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3179
translate chinese klarapause2_6c192276:

    # l "{i}I had butterflies in my stomach, but at the same time, my feet never felt lighter than ever."
    l "{i}那感觉甚至让我有点害怕，但是同时，我又感觉全身无比轻盈。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3180
translate chinese klarapause2_d4aaedc7:

    # l "{i}I felt like it was sucking me in. A feeling that strong, yet so unknown... It only makes me more nervous."
    l "{i}就好像在吸入我一样。这感觉既强烈，又神秘……只让我感到紧张。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3183
translate chinese klarapause2_29ad8632:

    # an "This right here, is our second home. The place where we shed sweat, blood, and tears in order to get to the top."
    an "这里就是我们的第二个家。我们就在这里流血、流泪、流汗，只为能跑得最快。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3186
translate chinese klarapause2_8a63770f_1:

    # ca "But once you taste the joy of winning a race, that's when you'll realize that Track and Field is fun."
    ca "但是一旦你知道了成为第一名是什么滋味，你就同时也会领悟田径的乐趣。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3192
translate chinese klarapause2_9091f090_2:

    # l "*sighs*..."
    l "*叹气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:3193
translate chinese klarapause2_43559ee0:

    # l "{i}I'll just order out tonight... I'm too tired to cook right now."
    l "{i}今晚还是点外卖吧……太累了，不想做饭了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3194
translate chinese klarapause2_23787b1a:

    # l "{i}All this thinking uses up all my strength."
    l "{i}光是想这些就花光了我的力气。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3197
translate chinese klarapause2_a82f1ac1:

    # l "Hm?"
    l "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3198
translate chinese klarapause2_e95090f0:

    # l "{i}Ahh... I forgot to return Anne's shoes!"
    l "{i}啊……我忘了把安妮的鞋还她！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3199
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_7:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3200
translate chinese klarapause2_8909c316:

    # l "{i}Did she... do that on purpose?"
    l "{i}她是……故意没有提醒我吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3203
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_8:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3212
translate chinese klarapause2_8b1c16fb:

    # "The next afternoon..."
    "第二天下午……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3220
translate chinese klarapause2_8c0f4b61:

    # an "Hey, Cath..."
    an "嘿，凯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3221
translate chinese klarapause2_83697bd5:

    # ca "Hm?"
    ca "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3222
translate chinese klarapause2_9f6a3919:

    # an "Do you think she'll come?"
    an "你觉得她会来吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3223
translate chinese klarapause2_a752b8b7:

    # ca "I have no idea. We did what we could to convince her."
    ca "我不知道。我们已经尽力说服她了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3224
translate chinese klarapause2_edfb8a79:

    # ca "As for what I saw with her, based on the way she talks, she is clearly a timid person. There's a high probability that she won't join us."
    ca "从我观察到的情况，以及她说话的方式来看，她很明显是个胆小的人。她很可能不会来了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3225
translate chinese klarapause2_012a8b67:

    # an "Aww... I gave her my extra pair of shoes too...!"
    an "唉……我都把我备用的鞋给她了……！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3228
translate chinese klarapause2_56803c31:

    # br "Wait, you did what?!"
    br "等等，你什么？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3229
translate chinese klarapause2_f5f64948:

    # br "Don't tell me you gave her my shoes!"
    br "你可别告诉我你给的是我的鞋！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3230
translate chinese klarapause2_d946f9ce:

    # an "Nah... They were mine. Yours are the one I'm using right now."
    an "不……是我自己的。你的我现在正穿着呢。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3233
translate chinese klarapause2_bb26d23f:

    # ca "But..."
    ca "但是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3234
translate chinese klarapause2_bea18325_1:

    # an "Hm?"
    an "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3235
translate chinese klarapause2_46b919ef:

    # ca "I was exactly like her when I first joined the team."
    ca "我刚刚加入的时候，也跟她一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3238
translate chinese klarapause2_9c2a2f0d:

    # an "Really? You never told me that story before!"
    an "真的吗？你以前从来没跟我说过！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3239
translate chinese klarapause2_6af2af25:

    # ca "Well... I don't often think about that time, because look where I am now."
    ca "嗯……我不怎么回想那个时候，毕竟，看看我现在的样子。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3240
translate chinese klarapause2_e41230c4:

    # an "Yeah, yeah... You're currently the best middle runner in the region, I know... You don't have to brag about it."
    an "是啊，是啊……你现在是整个区域最好的中距离选手，我知道……你没必要炫耀的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3243
translate chinese klarapause2_e882dd4a:

    # ca "I was not into it, because... it's just a club, it's just a silly little sport. Where would it take me even if I reached the top?"
    ca "我刚开始没有什么动力，因为……就只是个社团而已，只是闲着没事跑一跑而已。就算我成了第一，对我又有什么好处？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3244
translate chinese klarapause2_dd1322b9:

    # ca "Those were my thoughts before I joined."
    ca "我加入之前就是这么想的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3245
translate chinese klarapause2_dcd41285:

    # ca "But all it took me was the resolve to do it."
    ca "但我只需要下定决心去做。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3247
translate chinese klarapause2_1982fb02:

    # ca "It doesn't matter if you like it or not. There will always be something that will pull you towards that path."
    ca "不管喜欢还是不喜欢，都不重要。总会有一些事情把你引向那条路的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3251
translate chinese klarapause2_24b513cb:

    # "*steps*"
    "*踏上*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3254
translate chinese klarapause2_83a5a521:

    # br "And... I guess you guys don't have to worry about that."
    br "各位……看来你们不需要担心了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3255
translate chinese klarapause2_7ecd094e:

    # an "Hm? Why?"
    an "嗯？为什么？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3258
translate chinese klarapause2_56d58e3c:

    # br "Look who's here."
    br "看看谁来了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3259
translate chinese klarapause2_36c9f659:

    # ca "*chuckles* I guess I was wrong about her."
    ca "*笑* 看来我小瞧她了啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3262
translate chinese klarapause2_983ddd5a:

    # an "Whaaa...!"
    an "哇啊啊……！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3263
translate chinese klarapause2_00befec0:

    # an "Lily~!"
    an "莉莉~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3264
translate chinese klarapause2_71ffd1bd:

    # an "Go talk to coach Ed for now! We can't stop once we start warming up!"
    an "你现在先去找艾德教练说吧！我们一开始热身就不能停下了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3265
translate chinese klarapause2_a6e47cf4:

    # l "Alright!"
    l "好的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3268
translate chinese klarapause2_f8414788:

    # ed "Well? Have you finally made up your mind? Anne and Cathy told me all about you yesterday."
    ed "哦？终于下定决心了吗？安妮和凯西昨天跟我说了你的情况。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3269
translate chinese klarapause2_deb43db1:

    # ed "I honestly thought you'd never come back."
    ed "我其实没觉得你会回来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3270
translate chinese klarapause2_ea49e968:

    # l "Yes, I want to try it out. Whether I can handle it or not, I won't know unless I try."
    l "我想试一试。不试的话，永远不知道我能不能做到。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3273
translate chinese klarapause2_5e73b079:

    # ed "That's fine. As long as you have the resolve to do it, that's all that matters."
    ed "没关系。只要你有决心就够了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3274
translate chinese klarapause2_9ab6b16b:

    # ed "I will shape you into something you can be proud of, so prepare yourself."
    ed "我会把你培养成你最好的样子的，做好准备。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3275
translate chinese klarapause2_aae73c08:

    # l "T-thank you for having me!"
    l "请——请多指教！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3276
translate chinese klarapause2_c875e2cd:

    # ed "I have good eyes for other people's personalities, and I saw you as a very timid person as soon as I saw you here."
    ed "我看人一向很准，昨天你一来，我就看出来你是个胆小的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3277
translate chinese klarapause2_48046a67:

    # ed "Honestly, I wasn't interested in you."
    ed "说实话，当时我对你不感兴趣。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3278
translate chinese klarapause2_e371c167:

    # l "{i}Now that he mentions it... He never even talked to me yesterday."
    l "{i}他这么一说……好像昨天他确实一句话都没有跟我说过。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3279
translate chinese klarapause2_e6bcf8e5:

    # ed "But you changed my opinion. Even though you still reek of timidity, you at least have the courage to try this out. I must commend you for that."
    ed "不过你让我刮目相看了。尽管还是有点胆怯，至少你有尝试一下的勇气了。这点我必须称赞你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3280
translate chinese klarapause2_248824e9:

    # ed "However..."
    ed "然而……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3281
translate chinese klarapause2_294c2c2b:

    # ed "Don't think you're fully accepted just yet. I still need to see what you can do."
    ed "别以为你已经完全合格了。我还是要看看你有多大能耐。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3282
translate chinese klarapause2_9fb060e4:

    # ed "If you're no good, then we'll just have to look for someone else."
    ed "如果你完全不行的话，我们就会去找别人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3283
translate chinese klarapause2_c85b4d9b:

    # l "I understand."
    l "我明白。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3284
translate chinese klarapause2_9595a8dd:

    # ed "Good."
    ed "很好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3285
translate chinese klarapause2_c9eec491:

    # ed "Now, get ready and join the rest with their warm-up. Just follow your captain's orders for now."
    ed "准备一下，去跟其他人一起热身吧。听队长的指示就好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3286
translate chinese klarapause2_4827ace7:

    # l "I got it, sir!"
    l "明白了，先生！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3287
translate chinese klarapause2_82a03b95:

    # ed "Don't call me sir. Just coach or Ed is fine."
    ed "别叫我先生，叫我教练或者艾德就行了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3288
translate chinese klarapause2_1db29370:

    # l "S-sure!"
    l "好——好的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3291
translate chinese klarapause2_d558da9d:

    # ed "{i}I might be more strict than usual, but I have to do it in order to bring out what she can do."
    ed "{i}我刚刚比平常更严厉，不过我得震住她，才能完全激发出她的潜力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3292
translate chinese klarapause2_6b6580d9:

    # ed "{i}There's a lot of schools that will be a challenge to us. We need to work twice as hard this year."
    ed "{i}今年有很多学校对我们来说都是强大的对手。必须加倍努力才行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3299
translate chinese klarapause2_93cedd3d:

    # "Thirty minutes later..."
    "半个小时之后……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3308
translate chinese klarapause2_2ee443bb_2:

    # l "*huff* *huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3311
translate chinese klarapause2_342fcca8:

    # ca "Stand up straight, Lily. It's easier for you to breathe that way."
    ca "要站直，莉莉。站直了才更容易呼吸。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3312
translate chinese klarapause2_4ad7c926:

    # ca "Besides, you don't want coach to yell at you this early on. Haha."
    ca "而且，你也不想让教练这么早就开始吼你吧。哈哈。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3315
translate chinese klarapause2_7f14026c:

    # l "Oh, s-sorry!"
    l "哦，不——不好意思！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3316
translate chinese klarapause2_a214180c:

    # ca "No need to apologize, just make sure to remember it all the time.."
    ca "没必要道歉，只要记住这一点就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3317
translate chinese klarapause2_a317e899:

    # l "I got it."
    l "好的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3318
translate chinese klarapause2_eafe357c:

    # l "But why is it easier to breathe when standing straight? I often see people slouching when they're out of breath."
    l "但是为什么站直的时候更容易呼吸呢？我看其他人累得喘不上气的时候都是低头、弯腰的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3321
translate chinese klarapause2_a0dc49bd:

    # ca "It's fine to slouch, but here in Track and Field, it's different. We use our lungs almost non-stop, which puts a huge stress on them."
    ca "低着头没什么大影响，但是在田径场上，情况就不一样了。我们几乎无休止地使用肺部，给肺带来了很大负担。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3322
translate chinese klarapause2_568dde61:

    # ca "When you stand up straight, the air passes into your lungs with less effort. The blood circulates better that way as well."
    ca "站直的时候，空气就能更容易进到肺里。这样有助于血液循环。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3323
translate chinese klarapause2_1e542f3f:

    # ca "You might not notice it at the moment, but trust me, when you do your workouts."
    ca "现在你可能没注意到，但是开始练习之后，你慢慢就知道了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3324
translate chinese klarapause2_0598ad81:

    # ca "You'll feel it."
    pass

# game/ep6.rpy:3325
translate chinese klarapause2_6f12f758_3:

    # l "I see..."
    l "我明白了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3328
translate chinese klarapause2_fe7a9417:

    # l "I'll take note!"
    l "我会记住的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3329
translate chinese klarapause2_b8399ac6:

    # ca "Aha haa... You don't have to salute just because I'm the captain, you know?"
    ca "啊哈哈……哪怕我是队长，你也不用向我敬礼啊，"

# game/ep6.rpy:3332
translate chinese klarapause2_22a889c7:

    # l "I'm sorry, I'm sorry."
    l "不好意思，不好意思。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3333
translate chinese klarapause2_48d5aae8:

    # ca "Jeez..."
    pass

# game/ep6.rpy:3336
translate chinese klarapause2_b041783b:

    # l "By the way, was that the usual jogging pace? It's very fast, I could barely keep up."
    l "对了，慢跑的速度一直这么快吗？我很难跟得上。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3337
translate chinese klarapause2_cb87d07d:

    # ca "You mean the five-lap warm-up? No-"
    ca "五圈热身跑吗？不——"

# game/ep6.rpy:3340
translate chinese klarapause2_c5cbdc25:

    # an "No it's not! We're lucky our captain is the one holding the pace. It gets way worse when the longest runners are in charge!"
    an "不是的！队长领跑算我们走运。那些跑长跑的来领跑的时候才是真的噩梦！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3341
translate chinese klarapause2_0f62e178:

    # an "Those damn stamina monsters!"
    an "她们就是永远不会累的怪物！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3344
translate chinese klarapause2_48a00326:

    # ni "Hey, I heard my name. Ahaha!"
    ni "是不是有人在夸我啊？啊哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3345
translate chinese klarapause2_77e5e516:

    # an "Yes! We're talking about you!"
    an "是啊！我可爱死你了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3346
translate chinese klarapause2_71e83e26:

    # ni "There, there... I'll buy you popsicles later too, don't worry."
    ni "行啦，行啦……我之后给你买雪糕吃，别担心。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3349
translate chinese klarapause2_a87237fa:

    # an "Really~?"
    an "真的吗~？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3350
translate chinese klarapause2_d0434b8a:

    # ca "Why the heck do you love popsicles that much?"
    ca "你怎么这么喜欢雪糕啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3353
translate chinese klarapause2_3153524a:

    # an "I dunno? I just love them!"
    an "我也不知道。我就是喜欢！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3354
translate chinese klarapause2_213dd4c3:

    # an "But hasn't coach given us lighter workouts in the past few days? What's up with him?"
    an "教练这几天怎么减轻了练习量啊？他怎么想的？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3355
translate chinese klarapause2_cd5d950b:

    # ca "You always ask for harder training, this is getting scary, you know that?"
    ca "你总是想练得更多，这样很吓人的，你知道吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3356
translate chinese klarapause2_67a22d7c:

    # ca "But you guys better prepare yourselves. I know very well that something's up if coach is treating us like this."
    ca "但你们最好做好心理准备。我很清楚，要是教练开始给我们减负了，那就是有大事要来了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3359
translate chinese klarapause2_db0aa5bb:

    # ed "Alright! Huddle up, everyone!"
    ed "好了！所有人，集合！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3362
translate chinese klarapause2_7134942c:

    # ed "How's the warm-up? You weren't slacking just because it was a warm-up, were you?"
    ed "热身情况怎么样？没有因为只是个热身就在偷懒吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3365
translate chinese klarapause2_4b32d498:

    # an "You're the one who's making us slack, Ed..."
    an "你才是那个让我们偷懒的人，艾德……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3366
translate chinese klarapause2_8f9a458f:

    # ca "Hey..."
    ca "喂……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3367
translate chinese klarapause2_88b86157:

    # ed "Well, don't worry. I'll give you guys what you want tomorrow."
    ed "哼，别担心。到了明天就让你们好好出出汗。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3368
translate chinese klarapause2_96830329:

    # ev "Hrm...!!"
    ev "你……！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3371
translate chinese klarapause2_693a835d:

    # an "Eek! Why are you all looking at me like you want to kill me?!"
    an "你们怎么一个个都好像要杀了我一样？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3374
translate chinese klarapause2_50bdffb1:

    # ed "Relax, girls. That's what I'm intending to do. You might have noticed a slight drop in the difficulty of your workouts, and that was to not stiffen your body for the upcoming regimen."
    ed "放松，姑娘们。这是我特意安排的。你们可能也注意到了，最近训练的难度有所下降。这是为了让你们的身体能更好适应接下来的训练方案。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3375
translate chinese klarapause2_6f7746ba:

    # ca "See? I called it."
    ca "看吧？我就知道。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3376
translate chinese klarapause2_6ecc5279:

    # ed "For the next five days, your training will slowly get harder and harder."
    ed "接下来的五天里，你们的训练会越来越难。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3377
translate chinese klarapause2_3bed1df2:

    # an "Nice! Now we're talking!"
    an "很好！这才像话嘛！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3378
translate chinese klarapause2_348b5158:

    # ed "Don't expect it to be the same as before. The other schools are bringing out their big guns and have recruited overseas students."
    ed "别以为还能跟以前一样轻松。其他的学校都开始拿出真功夫了，甚至还引入了外国学生。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3379
translate chinese klarapause2_eb7a2516:

    # l "Wait, is that even allowed?"
    l "啊，还能这样吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3382
translate chinese klarapause2_857a489e:

    # an "Actually, yes. It is quite normal, in fact."
    an "是的。实际上这是很平常的事情。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3383
translate chinese klarapause2_b174324f:

    # an "All schools have the freedom to do so. As long as those recruits are actually enrolled with the school they represent, nobody can complain."
    an "所有学校都有这么做的自由。只要那些外国学生真正加入了他们代表的学校的学籍，那就符合规定。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3384
translate chinese klarapause2_dbef42b2:

    # an "If you haven't noticed yet, Nisha and Natasha come from a different country as well."
    an "你要是还没看出来的话，我可以告诉你尼莎和娜塔莎就是外国人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3385
translate chinese klarapause2_6f12f758_4:

    # l "I see..."
    l "我知道了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3388
translate chinese klarapause2_fcc69979:

    # ed "Well said, Anne."
    ed "说得很好，安妮。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3391
translate chinese klarapause2_640651d1:

    # ed "If only the rest of your teammates were the same as you... *sighs*"
    ed "要是你的队友们都像你一样就好了…… *叹气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3394
translate chinese klarapause2_66366d60:

    # na "What's the difference? I mean... duh...! The only thing that sets her apart from the rest of us is that she's an airhead."
    na "有什么区别？她跟我们唯一的不同就是她的脑子不太好使。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3397
translate chinese klarapause2_ceef5359:

    # an "Whaaat did you saaay?! You wanna go, hrrmmnn...?"
    an "你说什么~~？！要打架吗，啊……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3398
translate chinese klarapause2_ff6f1ab3:

    # l "Should you guys actually be fighting at this time?"
    l "你俩这时候这么搞真的合适吗……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3399
translate chinese klarapause2_7d8ff96e:

    # an "You really get on my nerves as soon as you open your mouth, Natasha! Hrmmnn...!"
    an "你一开口就能气到我，娜塔莎！哼……！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3400
translate chinese klarapause2_d01cadd1:

    # na "What? Everyone calls you that too, but you don't get upset. Why me?"
    na "什么？每个人都那么说你，你也没生气啊。怎么偏偏跟我过不去？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3401
translate chinese klarapause2_4bce61e1:

    # an "You're different because you really mean it!"
    an "你不一样，因为你真的是那么想的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3402
translate chinese klarapause2_be5c60e5:

    # na "Well... It's the truth."
    na "因为……事实就是这样啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3405
translate chinese klarapause2_b1f3d9b9:

    # an "See?!"
    an "看见了吧？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3406
translate chinese klarapause2_5100e22c:

    # ed "This is no time for chatter."
    ed "别闲聊了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3407
translate chinese klarapause2_46319764:

    # ed "All of you proceed to the 50-meters mark and give me 5 rounds."
    ed "每个人，去50米的起点，给我跑5次。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3410
translate chinese klarapause2_425f72ee:

    # an "Wait, that's all?"
    an "就这么点？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3411
translate chinese klarapause2_895eb4a9:

    # ed "That's all of it. Take your time for today, tomorrow will be another story."
    ed "就这么点。珍惜今天吧，明天可没有这么轻松了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3412
translate chinese klarapause2_b4c4403e:

    # an "OK, we got it, Ed."
    an "OK，知道了，艾德。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3415
translate chinese klarapause2_66d67ac5:

    # ed "And Anne..."
    ed "还有，安妮……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3416
translate chinese klarapause2_8354ed2b:

    # an "Hm? Yes, coach?"
    an "嗯？怎么了，教练？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3417
translate chinese klarapause2_82565532:

    # ed "I need your help with Lily later."
    ed "之后我需要你帮我一起测试莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3420
translate chinese klarapause2_68c53bbd:

    # an "Heeh... Are we doing it?"
    an "哈……终于要来了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3421
translate chinese klarapause2_b15071ba:

    # l "Uhm... Doing what?"
    l "呃……什么要来了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3422
translate chinese klarapause2_4b920b35:

    # an "*giggles* You'll see, you'll see!"
    an "*笑* 一会你就知道了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3425
translate chinese klarapause2_f87b5051:

    # miw "We didn't have the opportunity to talk much yesterday, so pardon my late introduction."
    miw "抱歉，我这么晚才自我介绍，昨天我们没什么机会说话。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3426
translate chinese klarapause2_1aba5d06:

    # miw "Your name is Lily, right? My name is Miwa, I'm in hurdles. Nice to meet you, Lily~!"
    miw "你叫莉莉，对吧？我的名字是米瓦，我是跑跨栏的。很高兴认识你，莉莉~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3427
translate chinese klarapause2_db676bd5:

    # l "No worries. Nice to meet you too, Miwa."
    l "没事的。认识你我也很高兴，米瓦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3430
translate chinese klarapause2_5003d971:

    # miw "Everyone, You should formally introduce yourselves too~!"
    miw "各位，都来跟莉莉正式做一下自我介绍吧~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3433
translate chinese klarapause2_f1a2022b:

    # lid "Hey, there. The name's Lidia, I am also in hurdles alongside Miwa."
    lid "你好。我叫莱迪亚，跟米瓦一样是跨栏选手。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3434
translate chinese klarapause2_9784b296:

    # lid "People always tell me that I smile all the time, but I'm actually not. That's just the shape of my lips. Nice to meet you."
    lid "大家都说我总是一直在微笑，但不是那样的。我的嘴唇就是这个形状。很高兴认识你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3435
translate chinese klarapause2_17ab83d7:

    # l "Uhm... That's weird."
    l "呃……还挺怪的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3438
translate chinese klarapause2_7213ad5d:

    # na "Yo, Natasha here. I'm a distance runner. Glad you could be with the team."
    na "哟，我是娜塔莎。我是搞长跑的。欢迎你加入队伍。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3439
translate chinese klarapause2_f4a49c87:

    # na "Don't get my personality wrong, I'm just specially rude to Anne."
    na "别对我的性格产生误会，我只是对安妮态度不好而已。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3440
translate chinese klarapause2_49f21b9c:

    # an "Damn you!"
    an "去你的吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3443
translate chinese klarapause2_c55b8daa:

    # ni "You probably already know me, but I'm Nisha. Like my sister Natasha, I'm running the longest events. Nice to meet you, Lily."
    ni "我是尼莎，你可能已经认识我了。我专攻长跑。很高兴认识你，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3446
translate chinese klarapause2_49e4af82:

    # br "Brook at your service, ma'am! I'm one of the best middle runners on the team! Glad to see you come back, Lily!"
    br "布鲁克为您效劳，女士！我是队里最好的中距离选手之一！很高兴你能加入我们，莉莉！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3447
translate chinese klarapause2_07650c3c:

    # ca "There's only the two of us in middles, Brook."
    ca "跑中距离的只有我们两个，布鲁克。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3450
translate chinese klarapause2_358e6c2a:

    # br "You don't have to make it obvious that you're better than me, cap'n!"
    br "你也没必要这么明显地暗示你比我强吧，队长！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3453
translate chinese klarapause2_8a655867:

    # ca "Anyway, you already know me, but my name is Cathy and I'm your captain. Sorry that I judged you right away. I was totally wrong."
    ca "总之，你已经认识我了，但我还是介绍一下我吧。我叫凯西，是你的队长。很抱歉，我之前小瞧你了。是我错了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3456
translate chinese klarapause2_2da8c283:

    # l "Mhm! Nice to meet you guys."
    l "嗯！很高兴认识你们。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3457
translate chinese klarapause2_4c513bd3:

    # l "But I have a quick question."
    l "不过我有个小问题。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3458
translate chinese klarapause2_46a8d7f1:

    # ca "Just ask away, Lily. Don't hold back."
    ca "问就是了，莉莉。不用拘谨。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3459
translate chinese klarapause2_8eba0587:

    # l "Uhm... Aren't there supposed to be other events here? Like that thing where you throw a metal ball and also those jumping events I saw on TV."
    l "嗯……这里不应该还有其他项目的比赛吗？比如我在电视里看到的扔铅球和跳远之类的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3460
translate chinese klarapause2_f0f65ddf:

    # ca "Oh, the field events, you mean?"
    ca "噢，你是说田赛啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3461
translate chinese klarapause2_857b4328:

    # ca "We do have them too. But they're on a different team with a different coach."
    ca "确实有那些。不过那都是另一个队伍，另一个教练了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3462
translate chinese klarapause2_66b68ba9:

    # ca "They have their own training ground as well, so you won't see them until the competitions."
    ca "他们有独立的训练场地，所以得到比赛的时候才能看见他们了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3463
translate chinese klarapause2_f45a9091:

    # l "Oh... I see now."
    l "噢……我知道了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3466
translate chinese klarapause2_791a2e29:

    # an "Let's go first, Lily."
    an "我们第一个开始吧，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3467
translate chinese klarapause2_16a92d29:

    # l "Eh? First?"
    l "呃？第一个？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3468
translate chinese klarapause2_006e633a:

    # an "Yep! We usually do it in pairs so there's a challenge to it."
    an "是啊！我们一般都是成对起跑，这样更有竞争性。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3469
translate chinese klarapause2_0ce56d82:

    # an "Start us up, please, captain!"
    an "队长，麻烦你给我们发令了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3472
translate chinese klarapause2_8f188d1c:

    # ca "Alright."
    ca "好的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3473
translate chinese klarapause2_3a4cfef5:

    # ca "Are you ready, Lily?"
    ca "准备好了吗，莉莉？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3474
translate chinese klarapause2_b0a7d948:

    # l "Uhm... We're just running to the finish line, right?"
    l "嗯……只用跑到终点线就好，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3475
translate chinese klarapause2_a6668fe6:

    # ca "Yeah. Don't feel pressured, this is just a workout. There's no winning or losing here."
    ca "是啊。不用紧张，只是练习而已。现在是不考虑输赢的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3476
translate chinese klarapause2_e2a54dc5:

    # l "Okay, then I'm ready."
    l "好的，我准备好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3477
translate chinese klarapause2_50a82b3e:

    # an "Do a starting pose, Lily. Since we don't use a starting block right now, find a pose that you're comfortable on your feet with."
    an "要摆好起跑的姿势，莉莉。现在没有起跑器，所以要找到一个适合让脚随时发力起跑的姿势。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3478
translate chinese klarapause2_3d1aa90b:

    # an "Any will do, actually."
    an "其实什么姿势都可以。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3479
translate chinese klarapause2_7279e8c6:

    # an "When you feel that pose grips well, then just say 'Set', and Cathy will shout the 'Go' signal."
    an "你觉得姿势摆好了以后，就说“准备好了”，之后凯西会发出“起跑”的口号。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3480
translate chinese klarapause2_a89794b8:

    # an "Also try to run right when she shouts. Not before, not after. You got it?"
    an "还有，要在她开口的一瞬间起跑。不能早，也不能晚。明白了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3481
translate chinese klarapause2_c85b4d9b_1:

    # l "I understand."
    l "明白了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3484
translate chinese klarapause2_67f49097:

    # l "{i}A starting pose, huh... I think I saw one when I researched Track and Field last night..."
    l "{i}起跑的姿势啊……我昨晚查田径的资料的时候看到了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3487
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_9:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3488
translate chinese klarapause2_aa3c53d3:

    # l "{i}This feels good..."
    l "{i}这个不错……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3489
translate chinese klarapause2_3fd33742:

    # ca "{i}Ahh... The classic running pose. Good choice."
    ca "{i}啊……经典姿势啊。不错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3492
translate chinese klarapause2_52c8546b:

    # l "Set!"
    l "准备好了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3495
translate chinese klarapause2_71ca778e:

    # ca "Go!"
    ca "跑！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3498
translate chinese klarapause2_5fcfe7b5:

    # l "{i}Urk!"
    l "{i}啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3499
translate chinese klarapause2_4c1307c9:

    # l "{i}She's... so fast!"
    l "{i}她……跑得好快！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3502
translate chinese klarapause2_c719f080:

    # an "Alright~!!"
    an "好耶~！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3505
translate chinese klarapause2_21bfb885:

    # na "Hey, hey. What are you doing beating the newbie, huh, Anne?"
    na "喂，喂。怎么这么欺负新人啊，安妮？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3506
translate chinese klarapause2_825c6369:

    # ev "Yeah, yeah! What an absolute showoff!"
    ev "就是就是！就知道炫耀！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3509
translate chinese klarapause2_04f91981:

    # ed "Aha haaa..."
    ed "啊哈哈哈……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3512
translate chinese klarapause2_921681e0:

    # an "I'm a sprinter! What do you slugs expect?!"
    an "我就是跑短跑的！不然你们以为呢？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3513
translate chinese klarapause2_fbadafa7_1:

    # l "*huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3516
translate chinese klarapause2_bf05e24b:

    # an "Hey, Lily."
    an "哎，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3519
translate chinese klarapause2_a82f1ac1_1:

    # l "Hm?"
    l "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3520
translate chinese klarapause2_b7f60a34:

    # an "*tap* *tap*"
    an "*拍* *拍*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3523
translate chinese klarapause2_6a563236:

    # l "Ah, right. No slouching."
    l "啊，对了。不能低头。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3524
translate chinese klarapause2_ad707f3e:

    # an "Good. Always raise your head up whenever you finish a run. Try to make it a habit from now on."
    an "很好。跑完之后一定要记得把头抬起来。要试着从现在开始养成习惯。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3525
translate chinese klarapause2_acd9915b:

    # ed "Come here for a moment, Lily."
    ed "过来一下，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3528
translate chinese klarapause2_a3a9e2d2:

    # l "Yes, coach?"
    l "怎么了，教练？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3531
translate chinese klarapause2_95e93dc2:

    # ed "Throw your hands up like this every time you run. What you did just now makes it harder for you to move forward."
    ed "跑的时候要像这样摆手。你刚刚的姿势不利于你前进。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3532
translate chinese klarapause2_06dd7804:

    # ed "Don't throw it high, just target it right below your chin or in front of your face."
    ed "也不要摆得太高，到下巴以下或者脸的正前方就好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3535
translate chinese klarapause2_78fb173b:

    # ed "And when sprinting, don't clench your fists. That makes your hands heavier to throw."
    ed "还有，短跑的时候不要握拳。这样手部会更重，摆起来更费力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3536
translate chinese klarapause2_38cba080:

    # ed "Just keep both of your hands relaxed and you'll see what I mean."
    ed "跑的时候放松双手，就能体会到我的意思了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3537
translate chinese klarapause2_94b45591:

    # l "Copy!"
    l "明白！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3540
translate chinese klarapause2_859448bc:

    # an "Alright, you monsters..."
    an "好了，该你们这群怪物了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3542
translate chinese klarapause2_a36e08f9:

    # an "Go!"
    an "跑！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3547
translate chinese klarapause2_a36e08f9_1:

    # an "Go!"
    an "跑！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3552
translate chinese klarapause2_a36e08f9_2:

    # an "Go!"
    an "跑！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3555
translate chinese klarapause2_6fe1b2a8:

    # an "Hey, Natasha! Put more effort in your sprints!"
    an "喂，娜塔莎！跑短跑的时候多用点劲！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3556
translate chinese klarapause2_c25e0229:

    # na "Huuuuh?!! Why don't you say that again in my face, you little bitch?!!"
    na "什么？！！你有本事当着我的面再说一次，你个小贱人？！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3559
translate chinese klarapause2_77e4d2e5:

    # l "Are you two usually like that?"
    l "你俩一直这样吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3560
translate chinese klarapause2_b4bd5223:

    # an "Well, yeah... Our personalities just always collide with each other's."
    an "呃，是啊……我们的性格确实经常容易摩擦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3561
translate chinese klarapause2_805bd5f4:

    # an "But don't worry, we never get to a physical fight or anything like that. Haha!"
    an "但你不用担心，我俩永远不可能真的打起来之类的。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3562
translate chinese klarapause2_b53a16f4:

    # l "That's good to know."
    l "那就好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3565
translate chinese klarapause2_75cdbea2:

    # an "Are you ready to go again?"
    an "准备好再来一轮了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3566
translate chinese klarapause2_d30ad63c:

    # l "Yeah, four more rounds, right?"
    l "当然，还有四次，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3567
translate chinese klarapause2_77729bb6:

    # an "Yep!"
    an "没错！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3570
translate chinese klarapause2_19d44452:

    # l "Alright, I'm ready."
    l "好了，我准备好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3573
translate chinese klarapause2_7b880f36:

    # an "Your call, Lily."
    an "等你发话了，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3574
translate chinese klarapause2_52c8546b_1:

    # l "Set!"
    l "预备！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3576
translate chinese klarapause2_a3be6a9f:

    # an "Go~!"
    an "跑~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3583
translate chinese klarapause2_521a2a54:

    # "Fifteen minutes later..."
    "十五分钟以后……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3592
translate chinese klarapause2_2ee443bb_3:

    # l "*huff* *huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3593
translate chinese klarapause2_92bb33f3:

    # an "All tired now?"
    an "累了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3594
translate chinese klarapause2_c26e2612:

    # l "Yeah, but I'm still fine."
    l "是啊，但我还能继续。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3595
translate chinese klarapause2_97a6754b:

    # an "Heeeh... Not bad!"
    an "嘿嘿……不赖！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3598
translate chinese klarapause2_b06b01da:

    # an "Ed~! It's time!"
    an "艾德~！是时候了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3599
translate chinese klarapause2_11e824b4:

    # l "Huh?"
    l "啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3600
translate chinese klarapause2_9cc74d08:

    # ed "Lily, Cathy, and Anne, come to me. The rest of you, go ahead and start your cool down, that will be all for today."
    ed "莉莉，凯西，安妮，来我这。剩下的，可以去休息了。今天就到此为止。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3603
translate chinese klarapause2_14d456bf:

    # ed "It's time for your tryout. Get ready."
    ed "到你的考核时间了。准备好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3604
translate chinese klarapause2_8c19d2d8:

    # l "Okay, but... What should I do this time?"
    l "好的，但是……具体要考什么呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3605
translate chinese klarapause2_561a1470:

    # ed "Since the only slot we have left is the sprints, I would like to see what you can do at that distance."
    ed "现在只有短跑还有空缺了，所以我想看看你在这个距离上的表现如何。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3606
translate chinese klarapause2_c774c67e:

    # ed "I'll let you run a single 100 meter dash and time it out."
    ed "你去跑100米，但是这次要计时。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3607
translate chinese klarapause2_e9501e8c:

    # l "A-alright..."
    l "好——好的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3610
translate chinese klarapause2_66ffe78c:

    # ed "Take her to the starting line, Anne. And take this."
    ed "带她去起跑线，安妮。带上这个。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3611
translate chinese klarapause2_51a613e6:

    # ed "It's already loaded with blank rounds."
    ed "已经装好空包弹了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3612
translate chinese klarapause2_bb7d8a6e:

    # an "Leave it to me."
    an "交给我吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3615
translate chinese klarapause2_5a16ea7a:

    # ed "You time her out, Cathy. I would like to focus on her performance."
    ed "你给她计时，凯西。我要仔细观察她的动作。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3616
translate chinese klarapause2_f7d72d1f:

    # ca "You're usually the one timing the applicants out, coach. What's the problem?"
    ca "一般都是你来计时的啊，教练。什么情况？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3617
translate chinese klarapause2_e2f8e85e:

    # ed "Have you noticed the way she throws her legs after I told her to relax and open up her hands earlier?"
    ed "我刚刚告诉她要放松、打开双手之后，你注意到她腿部的动作了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3618
translate chinese klarapause2_03b45de1:

    # ca "I don't think so. I wasn't paying that much attention to her."
    ca "没有。那时候我没太注意她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3619
translate chinese klarapause2_d2646674:

    # ed "It was perfect."
    ed "她的动作非常完美。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3620
translate chinese klarapause2_2afb7a92:

    # ca "Really?"
    ca "真的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3621
translate chinese klarapause2_58553393:

    # ed "Do you know anything about her history? Any physical activities or something like that?"
    ed "你知道她过去的履历吗？参加过任何体育运动吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3622
translate chinese klarapause2_a5279059:

    # ca "Uhm... Not that I know of, coach. All I know is that she has a mountain bike, so she might be using it every day for travel."
    ca "呃……完全不知道，教练。我只知道她有辆山地自行车，所以她可能每天都骑着自行车出行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3625
translate chinese klarapause2_a96ee074:

    # ca "Wait..."
    ca "等等……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3626
translate chinese klarapause2_f41f5cc4:

    # ed "Yeah... Her legs are used to pedaling. So much so that she applies it with the way she runs."
    ed "是啊……她的双腿已经习惯踩踏板的动作了。以至于在奔跑的时候也用的是踩踏板的动作。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3627
translate chinese klarapause2_c91bbdbd:

    # ed "She has so much leg power, but it's getting wasted due to her overall bad running form."
    ed "她的腿部力量非常强，但是因为跑的姿势不对，都浪费掉了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3628
translate chinese klarapause2_c99ac980:

    # ca "Interesting..."
    ca "有意思……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3631
translate chinese klarapause2_6e91876d:

    # an "Oh yeah~! Let's go, Lily!"
    an "噢耶~！快来，莉莉！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3632
translate chinese klarapause2_749ec4e3:

    # l "I'm... honestly not ready for this..."
    l "我其实……真的没准备好……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3633
translate chinese klarapause2_76d42b59:

    # an "Are you nervous?"
    an "你很紧张吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3634
translate chinese klarapause2_2c518906:

    # l "Yeah, my hands are actually shaking, yet my legs are calm. I'm feeling weird right now."
    l "是啊，我的手都在发抖，但是腿却很冷静。我现在感觉非常奇怪。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3635
translate chinese klarapause2_7959e55e:

    # an "That's quite normal. Even we get nervous for time trials."
    an "这很正常。我们几个在计时跑之前也很紧张。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3636
translate chinese klarapause2_708a2cae:

    # an "Just don't forget to breathe, okay?"
    an "一定不要忘记呼吸，知道了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3639
translate chinese klarapause2_a317e899_1:

    # l "I got it."
    l "知道了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3642
translate chinese klarapause2_17bd73f3:

    # an "Now then, for the real starting position..."
    an "好了，该教你真正的起跑姿势了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3643
translate chinese klarapause2_e83deedf:

    # an "Try and copy me."
    an "学着我做。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3646
translate chinese klarapause2_12b8ea05:

    # l "Like this?"
    l "这样吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3647
translate chinese klarapause2_82ad92c0:

    # an "Yeah, not bad at all! It's much more comfortable with a starting block, but... Oh well..."
    an "很好，非常不错！这个姿势如果有起跑器的话会舒服得多，不过……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3648
translate chinese klarapause2_b3742995:

    # an "Let's just make do for now."
    an "现在就先凑合一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3649
translate chinese klarapause2_b831d553:

    # an "Next is the 'Set' pose."
    an "然后是“预备”的姿势。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3652
translate chinese klarapause2_ef9772f2:

    # an "It's easy. You'll basically just lift your butt up like this..."
    an "很简单。只要像这样把臀部抬起来就好……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3653
translate chinese klarapause2_ec8c6ede:

    # an "Then, put all your lower body's weight to your left leg to kick you off when the gun fires."
    an "然后，把下半身的重心全都放到左腿，好让自己在枪响的时候立即起跑。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3654
translate chinese klarapause2_768b460f:

    # l "Alright, I'll see what I can do."
    l "好的，我试一试。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3655
translate chinese klarapause2_7954edd1:

    # an "Stand up for now, Lily. You don't want to stay in that position for a long time. Ahahah!"
    an "现在就先站起来吧，莉莉。一直保持这个姿势可不舒服。啊哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3656
translate chinese klarapause2_705a04b2:

    # l "Sure."
    l "好的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3659
translate chinese klarapause2_a6415d69:

    # an "One last tip."
    an "最后一个建议。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3660
translate chinese klarapause2_d0493eab:

    # an "After I yell 'Set' and you lift your butt up, inhale as much as you can through your nose within that one second. Then let it all out through your mouth after the gun fires."
    an "在我喊出“预备”，你抬起臀部之后，在那一秒钟里要用鼻子尽可能多地吸气。然后，在枪响之后把气通过嘴巴全部呼出去。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3661
translate chinese klarapause2_deeda988:

    # l "So, basically exhale it at the same time when I go for the run, right?"
    l "所以，就是要在起跑的同时呼气，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3662
translate chinese klarapause2_a4a4e07c:

    # an "Exactly! You really do learn fast, Lily!"
    an "没错！你学得很快，莉莉！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3663
translate chinese klarapause2_27ddfbb9:

    # l "But what about that one second you mentioned just now?"
    l "不过你刚刚说的一秒钟是什么意思？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3664
translate chinese klarapause2_3c82f060:

    # an "Ahh... that's the time interval between 'Set' and 'Go' right before you run."
    an "啊……就是开跑之前“预备”和“起跑”之间的时间间隔。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3665
translate chinese klarapause2_cf6ebd29:

    # an "The first one is usually 'On your marks', that's when you do your starting position from standing up."
    an "第一个口令一般是“各就位”。这个口令之后，要从站姿变成起跑姿势。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3666
translate chinese klarapause2_2370b6cb:

    # an "Umpires will check your pose and make sure your hands don't go beyond the starting line."
    an "裁判在这个时候会检查你的姿势，确保你的手没有越过起跑线。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3667
translate chinese klarapause2_8f53cbad:

    # an "Then, there's the 'Set', I told you what it is already."
    an "然后，是“预备”口令。我已经跟你讲过这个口令了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3668
translate chinese klarapause2_5fc5efe6:

    # an "Lastly, the 'Go', or the gun fires."
    an "最后，是“起跑”，或者是枪响。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3669
translate chinese klarapause2_a3d43a12:

    # an "Those two only have a one-second interval. When 'Ready' is shouted, there's no turning back. Everything will be up to you at that point."
    an "这两个口令之间只有一秒钟的间隔。在你喊出“准备好了”之后，就不能回头了。到那个时候，一切都取决于你自己。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3670
translate chinese klarapause2_c6da4467:

    # l "Alright, let's get this done, then."
    l "好吧，我们开始吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3673
translate chinese klarapause2_d044105b:

    # an "Hey, Ed! We're ready~!"
    an "喂，艾德！我们准备好了~！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3676
translate chinese klarapause2_0f3f90fe:

    # an "That's our go signal."
    an "他们示意可以开始了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3679
translate chinese klarapause2_7691eb11_3:

    # an "......"
    an "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3680
translate chinese klarapause2_589e11dd:

    # an "Lily?"
    an "莉莉？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3683
translate chinese klarapause2_a82f1ac1_2:

    # l "Hm?"
    l "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3684
translate chinese klarapause2_53bea21d:

    # an "Breathe. You got me?"
    an "要呼吸。记住了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3687
translate chinese klarapause2_6c7934a3:

    # l "*smiles* Roger!"
    l "*微笑* 了解！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3688
translate chinese klarapause2_fb0541a2:

    # an "Good."
    an "很好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3689
translate chinese klarapause2_784bf9fe:

    # an "Are you all set?"
    an "准备好了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3690
translate chinese klarapause2_9dd093bb:

    # l "Yeah, let's do this!"
    l "是的，开始吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3693
translate chinese klarapause2_78358639:

    # an "Alright, Lily. Get ready..."
    an "好，莉莉。准备……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3694
translate chinese klarapause2_4f667be7:

    # an "On your mark!"
    an "各就位！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3700
translate chinese klarapause2_7691eb11_4:

    # an "......"
    an "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3703
translate chinese klarapause2_7691eb11_5:

    # an "......"
    an "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3706
translate chinese klarapause2_04a0deef_1:

    # an "Set!"
    an "预备！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3712
translate chinese klarapause2_22a403b2:

    # l "*inhales deeply*"
    l "*大口吸气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3716
translate chinese klarapause2_47237c5b:

    # "*gun fires*"
    "*枪响*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3719
translate chinese klarapause2_95bf317a:

    # an "Whoa~! Hey there, Miss fast starter!"
    an "哇哦~！你好啊，天才小姐！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3720
translate chinese klarapause2_7246ac47:

    # an "Her overall form is still as bad, though... I'm sure coach noticed that already."
    an "她的姿态还是很差，不过……教练肯定也已经注意到了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3723
translate chinese klarapause2_506a7f85:

    # br "Wohohooo~! Look at those legs throw! Let's go, baby!"
    br "喔吼吼~！看看这大长腿！加油，宝贝！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3724
translate chinese klarapause2_fa8283a0:

    # lid "Is that the timid girl we met yesterday? That form tells me otherwise, though."
    lid "这还是昨天那个胆小的女生吗？看起来可一点都不像。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3727
translate chinese klarapause2_05c19b61:

    # miw "Unfortunately, it looks like she's taking it seriously to me!"
    miw "在我看来她可是拼尽全力了啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3730
translate chinese klarapause2_c0cefaaa:

    # ca "*click*"
    ca "*按*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3733
translate chinese klarapause2_f37c9788:

    # ca "......"
    ca "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3736
translate chinese klarapause2_3cca7f37:

    # ca "Exactly 16 seconds, coach!"
    ca "正好16秒，教练！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3739
translate chinese klarapause2_fbadafa7_2:

    # l "*huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3742
translate chinese klarapause2_e1b74d10:

    # l "Is it... *huff*"
    l "这成绩…… *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3743
translate chinese klarapause2_8436b8bf:

    # l "...bad?"
    l "……很差吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3744
translate chinese klarapause2_af8ab05b:

    # ca "Well..."
    ca "这个嘛……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3747
translate chinese klarapause2_a56e461b:

    # ed "It is bad, yes."
    ed "是的，很差。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3750
translate chinese klarapause2_c0896aaa:

    # ed "But..."
    ed "但是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3751
translate chinese klarapause2_83697bd5_1:

    # ca "Hm?"
    ca "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3754
translate chinese klarapause2_86dd3024:

    # ed "Can you go for another round, young lady?"
    ed "你还能再跑一次吗，姑娘？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3755
translate chinese klarapause2_1e4fe26d:

    # l "Yeah... Yeah, I think I still can... I'm just out of breath at the moment."
    l "可以……可以，我觉得我还有劲……我就是现在有点喘不上气。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3758
translate chinese klarapause2_3dac370b:

    # ed "Hey, Brook!"
    ed "嘿，布鲁克！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3761
translate chinese klarapause2_1f912509:

    # br "Yes, coach?"
    br "怎么了，教练？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3762
translate chinese klarapause2_54b88135:

    # ed "Can you let Lily borrow your spikes for a while? We'll do a re-try."
    ed "你能把钉鞋借给莉莉穿一下吗？我们要再试一次。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3763
translate chinese klarapause2_036d8e86:

    # br "Sure! Hold on..."
    br "当然！等一下……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3766
translate chinese klarapause2_14fedef5:

    # br "Here!"
    br "给！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3767
translate chinese klarapause2_93f62ebd:

    # br "Since Anne's shoes fit you, I'm pretty sure these will be a good fit too."
    br "既然你能穿安妮的鞋，那这双你穿着肯定也适合。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3768
translate chinese klarapause2_d25d0c11:

    # br "We both have the same size feet despite me being taller. I have small feet. Haha!"
    br "我俩脚的尺码一样，尽管我更高一点。我的脚很小。哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3769
translate chinese klarapause2_f76e56c0:

    # l "Thanks, Brook."
    l "谢谢，布鲁克。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3770
translate chinese klarapause2_ffb1eaaf:

    # br "No worries. Give it your all this time around."
    br "不用谢。这次要使出全力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3771
translate chinese klarapause2_dce67a98:

    # l "Mhm!"
    l "嗯！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3779
translate chinese klarapause2_a8936bdc:

    # ed "How do they feel?"
    ed "感觉如何？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3780
translate chinese klarapause2_57fc324a:

    # l "Ehmm... They feel weird..."
    l "嗯……非常奇怪……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3781
translate chinese klarapause2_e6120971:

    # br "Hahaha! How nostalgic this is!"
    br "哈哈哈哈！好怀念的对话啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3782
translate chinese klarapause2_57e66a2b:

    # br "I had almost the same reaction when I first wore my spikes! It feels weird at first, but they will help you a lot, trust me."
    br "我第一次穿钉鞋的时候也是这个反应！刚开始感觉很奇怪，但是对你的成绩会有很大帮助的，相信我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3783
translate chinese klarapause2_4033dabb:

    # br "Try taking a jog and see for yourself."
    br "慢跑一会，自己体会一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3786
translate chinese klarapause2_5e1d008e_10:

    # l "......"
    l "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3787
translate chinese klarapause2_5b22bc62:

    # l "They... grip through the rubber. It's not slippery anymore. Although my heels are falling flat, there's no bounce at all."
    l "这双鞋……会刺穿橡胶。脚底一点也不滑了。尽管我的脚后跟都踩到了地上，却一点回弹的力道都没有。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3790
translate chinese klarapause2_7b1dab16:

    # ed "And that's the purpose of the spike shoes."
    ed "这就是钉鞋的作用。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3791
translate chinese klarapause2_24b6da74:

    # ed "Sprinters never use their heels, only their toes."
    ed "短跑选手从来不用脚跟，只用脚尖。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3792
translate chinese klarapause2_62d1a4b0:

    # ed "On this re-try, I want you to try and run tiptoe. We'll still do the same and time you out."
    ed "这次测试，我要你踮着脚尖跑步。还是跟上次一样的流程，也会计时。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3793
translate chinese klarapause2_fab8d244:

    # ed "Listen to the gunfire, do you understand?"
    ed "仔细听好发令枪，明白了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3794
translate chinese klarapause2_954b4baa:

    # l "I got it, coach."
    l "明白了，教练。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3795
translate chinese klarapause2_8addfdcb:

    # ed "Good. Now, go back to Anne."
    ed "很好。回安妮那去吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3798
translate chinese klarapause2_f174d735:

    # l "Roger!"
    l "了解！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3799
translate chinese klarapause2_e86e3794:

    # ed "Is saluting a mannerism of yours, or something? You don't have to do that."
    ed "敬礼是你个人的习惯之类的吗？你没必要敬礼的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3802
translate chinese klarapause2_cfafb5f0:

    # l "Ahaha... Yeah, my father used to work in the military. I got it from him."
    l "啊哈哈……是啊，我爸爸以前是军人。我从他那学的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3803
translate chinese klarapause2_c56a939f:

    # ed "I see..."
    ed "我知道了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3804
translate chinese klarapause2_b5e977b5:

    # ed "This will be your last run, Lily. Give it your all."
    ed "这是你最后一跑，莉莉。用尽全力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3805
translate chinese klarapause2_e8f4c6eb:

    # l "Understood!"
    l "明白！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3808
translate chinese klarapause2_81612424:

    # ca "Why did you let her use spikes, coach? Won't her feet be in shock with the sudden change of bounce?"
    ca "为什么你要让她穿钉鞋，教练？她的脚应该没法适应弹力的突然变化吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3809
translate chinese klarapause2_6a1623cb:

    # ca "I know how it felt when I first used spikes for a time trial."
    ca "我还记得我第一次穿钉鞋跑计时赛时的感觉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3812
translate chinese klarapause2_6162d7df:

    # ed "We'll think about that later. For now..."
    ed "这就之后再说吧。现在……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3813
translate chinese klarapause2_8e65fe06:

    # ed "I really want to see her leg power. Something with the way she runs seems to be off."
    ed "我真的很想看看她的腿部力量。她跑的方式有点不对劲。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3814
translate chinese klarapause2_711f9f30:

    # ed "We'll see how that changes now that she has a better grip."
    ed "看看她在抓地力更好的情况下会不会有什么改变。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3815
translate chinese klarapause2_56c40c64:

    # br "......"
    br "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:3818
translate chinese klarapause2_c17608d2:

    # ed "Don't look at me like that, Brook. I know what you want to say."
    ed "别那么看着我，布鲁克。我知道你想说什么。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3819
translate chinese klarapause2_c84a62bf:

    # br "Yeah, you're one heck of a sadist, coach. You're scary..."
    br "是啊，你可真是个虐待狂，教练。真是吓人……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3822
translate chinese klarapause2_41ac1deb:

    # an "Hey, look at that~! The runner's partner! The legendary spikes!"
    an "哇，看看这是什么！跑者的最佳搭档！传说中的钉鞋！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3825
translate chinese klarapause2_4cafacba:

    # an "Ed, you bastard! Hahaha!"
    an "艾德，你个王八蛋！哈哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3826
translate chinese klarapause2_056ae8b4:

    # l "Hm? Why? What's wrong?"
    l "嗯？怎么了？有什么不对劲的吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3829
translate chinese klarapause2_fae057bf:

    # an "Well... Coach obviously wants to get a performance out of you. It's not ideal to suddenly use spikes for the first time, you know?"
    an "这个嘛……教练显然是想看看你的极限表现如何。刚入门就穿钉鞋可不是好事，你知道吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3830
translate chinese klarapause2_3f5827ae:

    # an "The sudden change of bounce on your feet by changing from your usual running shoes to spike shoes will probably cause a bit of stress to your feet after this."
    an "从普通跑鞋换成钉鞋之后，脚部跟地面之间的弹力也会改变。这种突然的变化可能会给脚带来一些压力。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3831
translate chinese klarapause2_28a3afeb:

    # an "But it will improve your performance, that's for sure."
    an "但你的成绩也会提高，这是肯定的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3832
translate chinese klarapause2_f6a3e3b9:

    # l "If it will give me a better time, I won't complain."
    l "如果能让我跑得更快的话，我没意见。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3833
translate chinese klarapause2_32fe8e4d:

    # an "Heeh... Where's the 'you' from yesterday?"
    an "哈……昨天的你跑哪去了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3843
translate chinese klarapause2_41013307:

    # l "*exhales deeply*..."
    l "*大口吐气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:3846
translate chinese klarapause2_12d0dc34:

    # l "{i}My vision is clear..."
    l "{i}视野非常清晰……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3847
translate chinese klarapause2_cef7270a:

    # l "{i}I can see the finish line from here..."
    l "{i}从这里可以一眼望到终点线……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3848
translate chinese klarapause2_96614c6a:

    # l "{i}I can feel the pressure, but I'm not nervous anymore..."
    l "{i}依然能感觉到压力，但我不再紧张了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3849
translate chinese klarapause2_829d7388:

    # l "{i}I'm a bit tired, yet my body feels so light..."
    l "{i}我有点累了，但身体还很轻盈……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3850
translate chinese klarapause2_6f02325e:

    # l "{i}I can even hear my heart beat..."
    l "{i}连自己的心跳声都可以听见……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3851
translate chinese klarapause2_41969d4c:

    # l "{i}Is this because of the spike shoes?"
    l "{i}是因为这双钉鞋吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3852
translate chinese klarapause2_04a0deef_2:

    # an "Set!"
    an "预备！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3855
translate chinese klarapause2_1d6f01fc:

    # l "{i}I don't know..."
    l "{i}我不知道……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3856
translate chinese klarapause2_eab86450:

    # l "{i}At this moment... I just want to..."
    l "{i}此时此刻……我只想……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3860
translate chinese klarapause2_47237c5b_1:

    # "*gun fires*"
    "*枪响*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3861
translate chinese klarapause2_9995adfb:

    # l "{i}Run..."
    l "{i}奔跑……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3864
translate chinese klarapause2_d41d7006:

    # an "Holy Jesus!"
    an "我的妈呀！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3867
translate chinese klarapause2_616c5100:

    # an "Hold on, I need to know her time!"
    an "等等，我也得知道她的成绩！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3870
translate chinese klarapause2_82455103:

    # ni "Huh?"
    ni "啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3871
translate chinese klarapause2_68e19f93:

    # na "Well? I guess we have another sprinter, huh?"
    na "瞧瞧？看来队里的短跑不缺人了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3872
translate chinese klarapause2_38799194:

    # lid "Yeah, it looks like it."
    lid "是啊，说得没错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3875
translate chinese klarapause2_27362940:

    # ed "That leg and arm throw, they're perfect. Her head wobbles a bit, but that can be fixed."
    ed "腿和胳膊的摆动，非常完美。头晃得比较厉害，但可以纠正。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3876
translate chinese klarapause2_8df6fddb:

    # ed "It looks like we found a diamond in the rough, huh?"
    ed "看来在沙子里淘到钻石了啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3879
translate chinese klarapause2_c0cefaaa_1:

    # ca "*click*"
    ca "*按*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3882
translate chinese klarapause2_a67a8ab1:

    # ca "Whoa~! It's..."
    ca "天啊~！是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3883
translate chinese klarapause2_6be201e3:

    # ca "It's 14.2 seconds, coach!"
    ca "是14.2秒，教练！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3884
translate chinese klarapause2_7872a467:

    # br "Wait, hold on... That much?!"
    br "等等，等等……这么快吗？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3885
translate chinese klarapause2_470d09b4:

    # br "Are you sure you timed her right, Cap'n?"
    br "你没弄错吧，队长？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3888
translate chinese klarapause2_2ee443bb_4:

    # l "*huff* *huff* *huff*"
    l "*喘气* *喘气* *喘气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3889
translate chinese klarapause2_751b47e2:

    # l "Aaahh!"
    pass

# game/ep6.rpy:3890
translate chinese klarapause2_82af3b29:

    # ca "Yeah... I timed her right when the gun fired and when she reached the finish line."
    ca "绝对没有……我是看准枪响和她冲线的那瞬间掐表的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3891
translate chinese klarapause2_c875d23f:

    # ca "The stopwatch won't be lying either..."
    ca "这个秒表也绝对不可能有问题……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3892
translate chinese klarapause2_cb9fb44d:

    # br "You cheeky little..."
    br "那她真的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3893
translate chinese klarapause2_2a5bd933:

    # br "Is this really a girl who hasn't been on a track before?!"
    br "她真的以前从来没有练过跑步吗？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3896
translate chinese klarapause2_cc990fb4:

    # an "Hey, Cath~! How much is it?"
    an "喂，凯~！几秒？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3897
translate chinese klarapause2_fd1f009d:

    # l "I want to know too."
    l "我也想知道。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3900
translate chinese klarapause2_e445fb60:

    # ca "Look..."
    ca "你看……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3901
translate chinese klarapause2_e94bfc8c:

    # an "14.2~?!"
    an "14.2~？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3902
translate chinese klarapause2_8f823ebe:

    # an "How much was her first one?"
    an "她第一次的成绩是几秒？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3903
translate chinese klarapause2_b31a4060:

    # ca "16 seconds flat."
    ca "正好16秒。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3907
translate chinese klarapause2_a640a884:

    # an "*whistles*"
    an "*口哨*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3908
translate chinese klarapause2_fa7aa6fe:

    # an "Almost two seconds away, huh? Friggin' hell, Lily!"
    an "快了将近两秒啊，小姐？酷毙了，莉莉！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3909
translate chinese klarapause2_6c905b86:

    # an "Are you sure this is your first time running?"
    an "真的是你第一次跑步吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3910
translate chinese klarapause2_1e5e8dfd:

    # l "Yes, I'm sure of that. I told you, I never had any interest in sports before."
    l "是啊，我确定是第一次。说过了，我之前对运动一点兴趣都没有。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3913
translate chinese klarapause2_42bb52b5:

    # ed "You should now. 14.2 seconds on your first time? It's called potential. There's is so much potential in you."
    ed "那你现在该有兴趣了。第一次就跑14.2秒，你知道是什么概念吗？是无穷的潜力。你身上有无限的可能。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3914
translate chinese klarapause2_3c761c26:

    # l "Is it... good?"
    l "这是……很好的成绩吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3915
translate chinese klarapause2_c7176e14:

    # an "Huh?! You don't even need to ask that, you know?!"
    an "这还用问吗？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3916
translate chinese klarapause2_dd7500e8:

    # ed "Anne's current best is 12.3 seconds."
    ed "安妮的个人最佳成绩是12.3秒。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3917
translate chinese klarapause2_73a96ce6:

    # ed "Each second is already a huge gap, every millisecond counts."
    ed "每一秒都是巨大的差距，每一毫秒都至关重要。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3918
translate chinese klarapause2_8be98723:

    # ed "A millisecond of improvement requires rigorous training. That's how it is in sprints."
    ed "仅仅一毫秒的提升也需要无数艰苦的训练。短跑就是这种运动。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3919
translate chinese klarapause2_921d5042:

    # ed "And you're pretty much just a second away from her."
    ed "你跟她的差距现在也只有两秒了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3922
translate chinese klarapause2_2cf6e593:

    # an "Well? It looks like we're going to be partners from now on~! *giggles*"
    an "好吧，看来接下来我们俩就是搭档了~！ *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:3925
translate chinese klarapause2_84f9fe9c:

    # ed "Let me officially welcome you to the Track and Field club, Lily."
    ed "请允许我正式欢迎你加入田径社，莉莉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3926
translate chinese klarapause2_bd068c5b:

    # ed "Never give up and work with us on our way to the top."
    ed "希望你永不放弃，和我们一起冲击冠军。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3933
translate chinese klarapause2_3cc981d5:

    # "A week later..."
    "一周之后……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3948
translate chinese klarapause2_13034fc6:

    # l "{i}Alright! Let's go!"
    l "{i}好了！出发吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3952
translate chinese klarapause2_98bea42d:

    # l "{i}To the track~!!"
    l "{i}去跑步咯~！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3957
translate chinese klarapause2_870e9ef3:

    # l "And that's how I was introduced to the Track and Field club."
    l "我就是这么加入田径社的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3958
translate chinese klarapause2_06a41aea:

    # l "I changed so much after that day — all the timidity in me slowly faded away. So sports is basically half of what I am right now."
    l "那天之后我变了非常多——从前那个胆小的我逐渐消失了。可以说体育造就了起码一半的现在的我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3959
translate chinese klarapause2_b0a80e2f:

    # l "It was really fun! Although, coach's training was still spartan as heck!"
    l "当时真的很有意思！尽管教练的训练方式非常斯巴达！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3962
translate chinese klarapause2_bcb099be:

    # mc "That's for sure! I had so much fun listening to it that it makes me want to run too! Haha!"
    mc "那当然了！光是听你讲我就觉得很有趣了，连我都想去试试跑步了！哈哈！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3963
translate chinese klarapause2_f0c049ae:

    # l "I'm glad you liked it."
    l "你能喜欢我也很开心。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3964
translate chinese klarapause2_acb4e4ab:

    # l "There's still more to it though. But..."
    l "故事当然还没结束。不过……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3965
translate chinese klarapause2_4404f9bb:

    # l "We can talk about it some other time. The next few days will be a bit busy for me, by the way, so I may have to leave early."
    l "剩下的之后再讲吧。对了，接下来几天我比较忙，可能要提前下班。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3966
translate chinese klarapause2_63964bea:

    # mc "Sure! I can do the closing by myself, you take care of your studies first, don't worry about me!"
    mc "没问题！我自己一个人也能搞定关店的流程，你专心学习就好，不用顾虑我！"

# game/ep6.rpy:3967
translate chinese klarapause2_9815ecdd:

    # l "Thanks, [mc!t]."
    l "谢谢，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3968
translate chinese klarapause2_c84e8bbc:

    # mc "I have a question though..."
    mc "不过我有个问题……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3969
translate chinese klarapause2_51b08a8b:

    # l "Yes? What is it?"
    l "什么呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3970
translate chinese klarapause2_2307eaa2:

    # mc "Where are your teammates now? Especially the one you mentioned the most."
    mc "你的队友们现在都怎么样了？特别是你提得最多的那个。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3971
translate chinese klarapause2_bcf44c56:

    # mc "Her name is Anne, was it? You told me she's your best friend."
    mc "她是叫安妮，对吧？你还说她是你最好的朋友。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3974
translate chinese klarapause2_3ca365d8:

    # l "Well... She {b}was{/b} my best friend."
    l "嗯……她{b}不再{/b}是我最好的朋友了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:3975
translate chinese klarapause2_d3fdf7c0:

    # mc "Huh? What do you mean?"
    mc "啊？什么意思？"

# game/ep6.rpy:3976
translate chinese klarapause2_3f39bda1:

    # l "A lot of things happened after that day."
    l "那天之后，发生了很多事。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3977
translate chinese klarapause2_6b50ffff:

    # l "Life always has sorrow in exchange for the happiness it gives you, that's what I believe."
    l "生活给了你多少快乐，就也会给你多少哀愁。这是我个人的信条。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3980
translate chinese klarapause2_4b7504f0:

    # l "But like I said, we can talk about it more next time. I have to hurry to the academy now, or I'll be late for my courses and reviews."
    l "但是，这些还是之后再说吧。我得赶紧回学校了，不然上课就要迟到了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:3981
translate chinese klarapause2_ff13012e:

    # mc "Ah, sure, Lily! We're done with all the cleaning anyways, let's close up shop."
    mc "啊，好的，莉莉！清扫也都做完了，我们赶快关门下班吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4003
translate chinese lilyannepause_b8fdc96a:

    # "Late at night..."
    "深夜……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4012
translate chinese lilyannepause_6be65412:

    # m "......"
    m "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4015
translate chinese lilyannepause_d50c493b:

    # m "Owl, do you copy?"
    m "枭，能收到吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4016
translate chinese lilyannepause_93dc1a0b:

    # cl "I'm listening."
    cl "可以。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4017
translate chinese lilyannepause_e5f30854:

    # m "The tangos have arrived. Your intel was right, they're in front of their house."
    m "目标已抵达。你的情报没错，他们就在屋子外面。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4018
translate chinese lilyannepause_58b1bc33:

    # cl "You know what to do."
    cl "你知道该干什么。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4021
translate chinese lilyannepause_c8c76eea:

    # m "Execute them, right?"
    m "消灭目标，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4022
translate chinese lilyannepause_8e9f56ef:

    # cl "No, don't kill them. We don't want unnecessary bloodshed. Make sure they don't notice you, how copy, over?"
    cl "不，别杀人。不要有任何不必要的流血。不要让他们发现你，收到了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4023
translate chinese lilyannepause_81c2f8a9:

    # m "Affirmative, moving on targets, over."
    m "明白，接近目标中，完毕。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4050
translate chinese lilyannepause_95f85f03:

    # m "Good night..."
    m "睡个好觉……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4053
translate chinese lilyannepause_6be65412_1:

    # m "......"
    m "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4054
translate chinese lilyannepause_6dee8dca:

    # m "Owl, this is Fang, targets neutralized, they are asleep."
    m "枭，我是獠牙，目标已无害化。都睡过去了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4055
translate chinese lilyannepause_9857ca1c:

    # cl "Copy, good job. Use their vehicle and take them somewhere far away. Copy?"
    cl "收到，干得漂亮。用他们的载具把他们送走。收到了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4056
translate chinese lilyannepause_24506eb1:

    # m "Copy that."
    m "明白。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4057
translate chinese lilyannepause_312fd31d:

    # m "...Who are these people, by the way?"
    m "……不过，这群人是什么来头？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4058
translate chinese lilyannepause_47e31d94:

    # cl "Spies, we don't want them all over the place."
    cl "间谍。我们不希望让他们四处晃悠。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4059
translate chinese lilyannepause_a100b419:

    # m "Pests, you mean?"
    m "你是说，害虫？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4060
translate chinese lilyannepause_6612fd7e:

    # cl "You don't have to make it sound weird, you know?"
    cl "你没必要给他们起这么奇怪的外号，知道吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4061
translate chinese lilyannepause_e928e7b1:

    # cl "Anyway, get out of there before anybody sees you, over."
    cl "总之，撤离的时候不要让任何人发现你。完毕。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4062
translate chinese lilyannepause_ce7551f0:

    # m "Wilco, over."
    m "收到，完毕。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4063
translate chinese lilyannepause_5d452e6c:

    # cl "Roger, out."
    cl "了解。祝你好运。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4073
translate chinese lilyannepause_5797099a:

    # yt "Ahh... Jeez... Here it goes again! I just can't sleep now that I'm thinking of all the problems I have!"
    yt "啊……天啊……又开始了！我一直忍不住去想这一大串的问题，根本睡不着！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4074
translate chinese lilyannepause_2d49f7c3:

    # yt "I'm wondering about actually staying at the burger shack at this point."
    yt "我真的要认真考虑一下要不要搬到汉堡店去住了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4075
translate chinese lilyannepause_f5c950ed:

    # yt "All this shit just haunts me like I'm in a horror movie or something."
    yt "这些念头一直缠着我，好像我是个恐怖电影的主角一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4076
translate chinese lilyannepause_476f0b4d:

    # yt "*sighs*... That's a bad analogy..."
    yt "*叹气*…… 这个比喻真不吉利……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4077
translate chinese lilyannepause_8cd2dccd:

    # yt "I wonder if we still have some cans of beer in the fridge. A couple cans might help me sleep."
    yt "不知道冰箱里还有没有啤酒剩下。喝一点可能会更快睡着。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4085
translate chinese lilyannepause_15590fa3:

    # yt "Oh, sweet! We still have some!"
    yt "哇，很好！还有剩的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4086
translate chinese lilyannepause_839428d6:

    # yt "Well, thinking back... We mostly drank wine and almost never touched these."
    yt "仔细想想……好像近段时间以来一直都没喝过啤酒。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4087
translate chinese lilyannepause_d5560722:

    # yt "Gotta get classy, eh?"
    yt "还是要喝点经典的啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4090
translate chinese lilyannepause_c538deca:

    # yt "...Let's go to the veranda."
    yt "……去外面一下吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4098
translate chinese lilyannepause_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4099
translate chinese lilyannepause_bb1c90dd:

    # mc "Emma?"
    mc "艾玛？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4100
translate chinese lilyannepause_8829ddf5:

    # yt "I couldn't forget about that kiss last night, that was really mind-boggling."
    yt "我忘不掉昨晚她的那个吻。实在是太意外了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4101
translate chinese lilyannepause_176e0be7:

    # yt "Let's just pretend that didn't happen... At least for now..."
    yt "至少现在……还是先假装那事没发生过吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4104
translate chinese lilyannepause_280497fc:

    # mc "It's pretty late, what are you still doing outside? Don't tell me you couldn't sleep?"
    mc "时候不早了，你怎么还在外面？不会是睡不着吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4105
translate chinese lilyannepause_7193ed49:

    # e "Yes, I can't."
    e "是的，我睡不着。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4108
translate chinese lilyannepause_8fea2db2:

    # mc "Hmm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4109
translate chinese lilyannepause_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4112
translate chinese lilyannepause_98b2ebd4:

    # mc "How was your case, by the way? Solved it yet?"
    mc "你的案子怎么样了？破案了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4113
translate chinese lilyannepause_b5802b05:

    # e "That's the reason I couldn't sleep."
    e "我睡不着就是因为这个。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4116
translate chinese lilyannepause_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4117
translate chinese lilyannepause_432c9cc6:

    # e "I can't sleep when I have things left unfinished."
    e "我有没做完的事情的时候，就睡不着。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4118
translate chinese lilyannepause_3b21f354_1:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4119
translate chinese lilyannepause_e8e93cb7:

    # mc "Let me guess..."
    mc "让我猜猜……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4120
translate chinese lilyannepause_96e19d46:

    # mc "The suspect won't admit the truth, right?"
    mc "嫌疑人不肯承认，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4121
translate chinese lilyannepause_6361c8c3:

    # e "Yeah..."
    e "是啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4122
translate chinese lilyannepause_5f3ccc7e:

    # yt "She almost speaks like a normal person when it comes to her work."
    yt "她在谈工作的时候几乎就跟正常人一样了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4125
translate chinese lilyannepause_97367038:

    # mc "That's usually how it works. People will tend to deny the bad things they've done."
    mc "这是很正常的。人都爱否认自己做过的坏事。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4126
translate chinese lilyannepause_759ecc4b:

    # mc "No matter their age, from children to adults, that's just how a person's mind behaves."
    mc "不管年龄多大，大人还是小孩。人心就是这样的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4127
translate chinese lilyannepause_23946711:

    # mc "Unless you're a devout worshiper of justice, then it might be a different story."
    mc "除非某人是正义的狂信徒，绝不愿意撒谎，才可能会有不一样的行动。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4128
translate chinese lilyannepause_33027347:

    # mc "I myself am no exception to that."
    mc "我也不例外。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4131
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4132
translate chinese lilyannepause_5a1af161:

    # e "You have a point."
    e "你说得有道理。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4133
translate chinese lilyannepause_1980e442:

    # mc "Well? What are you going to do now? Got some plans up your sleeve?"
    mc "那么，你接下来要怎么办呢？有什么主意了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4134
translate chinese lilyannepause_51d35b9a:

    # mc "You're pretty smart, you'll eventually solve it anyways."
    mc "你那么聪明，反正最后总能解决的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4135
translate chinese lilyannepause_ba77773a:

    # yt "I just couldn't understand why you came here just for me to marry your friend, though. It's just not a thing you would do."
    yt "我就是不能理解为什么你突然来了我家，就为了让我跟你朋友结婚。这根本不是你会做的事情。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4136
translate chinese lilyannepause_309a5ca0:

    # e "I'm not a genius, but I'm working on it."
    e "我不是什么天才，但我会想办法的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4139
translate chinese lilyannepause_0da60ddf:

    # mc "And staying up this late won't really help you, anyway. A brain works better when you have enough sleep."
    mc "这么晚还不睡可不会帮你解决问题。睡眠充足才能让大脑正常运转。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4140
translate chinese lilyannepause_2bf3cf0b:

    # mc "Considering you wake up early and get home late, it'll be only a matter of time till you burn yourself out."
    mc "像你这样每天早起晚归，累坏自己只是时间问题。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4141
translate chinese lilyannepause_2838f70c:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4144
translate chinese lilyannepause_3b21f354_2:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4145
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_1:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4146
translate chinese lilyannepause_fda84ff2:

    # yt "Damn... This is getting awkward."
    yt "这……好尴尬啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4149
translate chinese lilyannepause_63f8af11:

    # mc "You do drink, right? Here's a can of beer if you want it."
    mc "你能喝酒的，对吧？我这有罐啤酒。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4150
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_2:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4153
translate chinese lilyannepause_8420affd:

    # e "Thanks..."
    e "谢谢……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4154
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_3:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4157
translate chinese lilyannepause_1779f35b:

    # e "What did you mean... you were no exception?"
    e "你刚刚说你也不例外……是什么意思？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4158
translate chinese lilyannepause_582359ea_1:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4161
translate chinese lilyannepause_67fcc3de:

    # mc "Well... The truth is... There are a lot of terrible things I've done in the past... I kept it quiet and denied it to myself."
    mc "好吧……其实……我过去做过很多不好的事情……我都藏在心里，没有提过。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4162
translate chinese lilyannepause_07984df5:

    # e "Like, when you confessed to Aine?"
    e "比如，向艾妮告白？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4165
translate chinese lilyannepause_02c18fc4:

    # mc "Hmm... Yeah, I guess you could include that."
    mc "嗯……是啊，这应该也算一个。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4166
translate chinese lilyannepause_7026e1bd:

    # mc "I sometimes close my eyes and all I can think about is how I could have done things differently, changed the outcomes, been a better man."
    mc "有时候，我闭上眼睛，满脑子想着，假如我当初换了一种做法，是不是结果就会不一样，是不是我就能成为一个更好的人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4167
translate chinese lilyannepause_e1ba0956:

    # mc "I forced myself to believe that the things I've done were right, but... then, I came to understand a lot of things there were about life..."
    mc "我逼着自己相信我做过的那些事是对的，但是……之后，我逐渐理解了更多有关生活的道理……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4170
translate chinese lilyannepause_f9e047a7:

    # mc "...I started to doubt myself. Then I realized that I'm just one hell of an asshole."
    mc "……我开始怀疑自己。然后我想通了，我就是个不折不扣的混蛋。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4171
translate chinese lilyannepause_f26d2e35:

    # mc "There comes a point where the faces of the people you wronged become too many to recognize them all in a dream..."
    mc "在梦里，我辜负过的人的脸越来越多，到最后，都多到我甚至认不全了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4172
translate chinese lilyannepause_5d9a893f:

    # mc "They merge and they change... No longer recognizable individuals, but always here as a reminder of what you did or didn't do."
    mc "他们的样子又混合，又变化……甚至变成了完全认不出来的另一个人。但是不管怎么样，那些人就在那里，不断提醒着我那些我做过的，以及没做过的事情。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4173
translate chinese lilyannepause_51db39dc:

    # mc "A memento of past mistakes I guess? A burden to carry, like when I confessed to Aine as you mentioned."
    mc "相当于过去的错误的纪念碑？这是我必须承载的负担。刚刚你提到的，向艾妮表白的事就是其中之一。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4176
translate chinese lilyannepause_e6793274:

    # mc "Man... I think I'm going crazy. Aha haaa..."
    mc "天啊……我觉得我要疯了。哈哈哈……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4177
translate chinese lilyannepause_3d6cf3a3:

    # e "Yeah... Why did you do it if you had a bad feeling in the first place, then?"
    e "是啊……你如果不愿意的话，为什么还要向她表白呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4181
translate chinese lilyannepause_3b21f354_3:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4182
translate chinese lilyannepause_2485f494:

    # mc "I..."
    mc "我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4183
translate chinese lilyannepause_b7c08df0:

    # mc "Did that to escape from the past..."
    mc "那么做是为了逃避我的过去……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4186
translate chinese lilyannepause_8e6ce723:

    # e "...!!!"
    e "...！！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4190
translate chinese lilyannepause_d9334207:

    # e "What..."
    e "你……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4193
translate chinese lilyannepause_d577b5cd:

    # e "...did you..."
    e "……说……什么……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4194
translate chinese lilyannepause_52611cf1:

    # mc "I did like Aine, don't get me wrong."
    mc "我确实喜欢过艾妮，别误会我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4197
translate chinese lilyannepause_58154f46:

    # mc "But, you know..."
    mc "但是，你知道吗……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4198
translate chinese lilyannepause_f455f9b9:

    # mc "I met a girl when I was a kid..."
    mc "我小时候，遇见过一个女孩……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4199
translate chinese lilyannepause_c21fb9c5:

    # mc "She was annoying at first, but when we got to know each other and wrote letters back and forth, I came to fall in love with her."
    mc "她一开始很烦人，但我们互相了解，互通书信之后，我就爱上她了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4200
translate chinese lilyannepause_50c404c4:

    # mc "And I know that she loved me too..."
    mc "我知道，她肯定也爱我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4201
translate chinese lilyannepause_9acd22a0:

    # mc "I didn't have friends back then, so I valued her more than anything... and eventually, she became the world to me at such a young age."
    mc "那时候我没有朋友，所以我珍惜她远胜过其他一切……后来，她就成了小小的我拥有的一切。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4202
translate chinese lilyannepause_83973042:

    # mc "There's nothing certain in this world, I know... But I was certain that I would marry her when we grew up."
    mc "我知道，这世界上没有绝对……但是在那个时候，我想着我长大以后绝对会跟她结婚。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4203
translate chinese lilyannepause_d4363309:

    # mc "Although... I guess that was just the kid in me talking..."
    mc "尽管……那也只是一个小孩在异想天开罢了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4204
translate chinese lilyannepause_02fa39bf:

    # mc "But I made a promise... A promise that I was willing to live up to, because I loved her..."
    mc "但我许下过一个诺言……一个我愿意用一生去实现的诺言，因为我爱她……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4207
translate chinese lilyannepause_3b21f354_4:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4208
translate chinese lilyannepause_0b4cac7b:

    # mc "Those happy times didn't last long..."
    mc "那段快乐的时光没有持续太久……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4209
translate chinese lilyannepause_7c96a3c8:

    # mc "Life took me away from her."
    mc "生活逼着我俩分开了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4210
translate chinese lilyannepause_9cfc3062:

    # mc "I made a promise that I would come back for her... But lived overseas for more than a decade."
    mc "我保证一定会回来找她……但是之后却在国外住了十几年。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4211
translate chinese lilyannepause_61064436:

    # mc "I wanted to come back as soon as possible. But what could I have done? I was just a snotty little brat."
    mc "我一直想回来。但我又能做什么呢？那时候，我只是个还整天流鼻涕的小屁孩。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4212
translate chinese lilyannepause_7e87b7ce:

    # mc "It was impossible for me to live independently from [landlady!t] at that age."
    mc "我怎么可能离开[landlady!t]，独自生活。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4213
translate chinese lilyannepause_088b33dd:

    # mc "It felt like a huge part of me was missing the fact that I couldn't even see her at least one more time, even after all those years."
    mc "我觉得从那之后，我就不再是我了。即使过了这么多年，我也再也没有见过她。哪怕一次也没有过。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4214
translate chinese lilyannepause_bdb06da0:

    # mc "I thought it couldn't get any more painful..."
    mc "我本来还以为不可能会有比这更痛苦的事了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4215
translate chinese lilyannepause_028179bc:

    # mc "But as problems and responsibilities stacked onto my shoulders, it couldn't help but take my mind off of her... and my memories of that time slowly faded away over the years."
    mc "但是我遇到的问题，要承担的责任越来越多，我能想着她的时间也越来越少……那段短暂的时光的记忆，也越来越模糊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4218
translate chinese lilyannepause_2485f494_1:

    # mc "I..."
    mc "我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4219
translate chinese lilyannepause_0ac330c2:

    # mc "I tried my best to recall everything, to keep my memories of her."
    mc "我尽力去记住一切了。我疯狂地逼着自己不要忘了她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4220
translate chinese lilyannepause_5cc89e1c:

    # mc "I wanted her to touch my face one more time. I wanted to hug her, to be there for her. I wanted her by my side."
    mc "我想让她再摸摸我的脸。我想拥抱她，保护她。我想让她陪在我身边。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4221
translate chinese lilyannepause_ef799b9a:

    # mc "That comfortable feeling when I was on her lap, I missed everything. I missed her so much..."
    mc "我到现在还记得，我躺在她的大腿上的时候，那惬意、轻松的感觉。我好想她……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4224
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_4:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4227
translate chinese lilyannepause_f8456d3b:

    # mc "We finally came back just a few months before I started my final year in high school..."
    mc "我高中的最后一年开始之前，我终于回来了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4228
translate chinese lilyannepause_3f8801ba:

    # mc "...And the first thing I did was to rush over to her house, thinking that she might still be there just waiting for me to return."
    mc "……我回来的第一件事，就是去她以前的家找她。我以为她可能还在那里，等我回来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4229
translate chinese lilyannepause_1cd16bc3:

    # mc "I was filled with excitement. I was so eager to see her again."
    mc "我当时兴奋极了。我太想见她了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4230
translate chinese lilyannepause_d42c3261:

    # mc "I wondered what she looked like after years without being able to see her. I wondered what her voice would sound like."
    mc "我在想过了这么多年，她会变成什么样子。我在想她的声音会不会也有很大变化。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4231
translate chinese lilyannepause_91b94af7:

    # mc "I wanted to fill those missing memories of her. And by seeing her once more, I would finally remember everything."
    mc "我想找回那些已忘却的记忆。只要再见到她，我就能回忆起一切。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4232
translate chinese lilyannepause_09d39cb2:

    # mc "But that eagerness and excitement turned into misery when I found out that she was no longer there."
    mc "但是，所有这些期待、兴奋，全都变成了更残酷的悲哀。她不在那了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4233
translate chinese lilyannepause_21970c81:

    # mc "I felt my heart turn into stone. I couldn't feel anything and went down on my knees."
    mc "我觉得我的心变成了石块。什么也感觉不到，只是呆呆地跪在地上。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4234
translate chinese lilyannepause_aa8e0f26:

    # mc "I wanted to cry my heart out, but nothing came out of my eyes. Not even a single tear... I was... fucking numb."
    mc "我以为我会大哭一场，但是什么也没有。连一滴眼泪都没有。我只觉得……麻木。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4235
translate chinese lilyannepause_7fac13e0:

    # mc "A lot of thoughts came to my mind."
    mc "无数想法涌入我的脑海。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4236
translate chinese lilyannepause_8238bb2b:

    # mc "Did she forget about me? Did she move on?"
    mc "她把我忘了吗？她就此放下了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4237
translate chinese lilyannepause_fc72adc9:

    # mc "I don't know... And I can't blame her."
    mc "我不知道……我也不能怪她。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4238
translate chinese lilyannepause_f7f4e73d:

    # mc "All I know is that I couldn't keep my promise..."
    mc "我只知道我没能兑现我的承诺……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4241
translate chinese lilyannepause_3cfa0a34:

    # e "{i}He... did come back for me?"
    e "{i}他……真的回来找我了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4242
translate chinese lilyannepause_2011955d:

    # mc "Right now... All I have left are these vague memories of her..."
    mc "现在……我只剩下一点与她一起的模糊记忆了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4243
translate chinese lilyannepause_a637a082:

    # e "{i}If only..."
    e "{i}只要……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4244
translate chinese lilyannepause_d4732238:

    # e "{i}If only... I waited a bit longer..."
    e "{i}只要……我再多等一段时间……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4245
translate chinese lilyannepause_dd75ab33:

    # mc "Ahh..."
    mc "啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4246
translate chinese lilyannepause_1ffe798c:

    # mc "Damn it, I can't even remember what she exactly looks like. Let alone her name."
    mc "可恶，我连她长什么样子都想不起来了。更别说她的名字了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4249
translate chinese lilyannepause_f81a964d:

    # e "{i}That's enough..."
    e "{i}已经足够了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4250
translate chinese lilyannepause_db8db05e:

    # mc "I'm just... a piece of trash who couldn't keep his promise to the girl he loved."
    mc "我只是个……毫无用处的垃圾而已。连向心爱的女孩许下的诺言都没法实现。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4251
translate chinese lilyannepause_07c3818d:

    # e "{i}That's enough... Please..."
    e "{i}真的已经足够了……求求你……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4252
translate chinese lilyannepause_93261e00:

    # e "{i}It's... all my fault..."
    e "{i}全都是……我的错……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4253
translate chinese lilyannepause_45440f79:

    # e "{i}So please, wipe those tears away..."
    e "{i}所以……请你把眼泪擦干吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4256
translate chinese lilyannepause_283ab3b3:

    # mc "Argh! This is why I don't want to recall that time! I just get too emotional!"
    mc "唉！所以我才不想回忆那时候！我太多愁善感了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4259
translate chinese lilyannepause_3204e995:

    # e "...Do you... still miss her?"
    e "……你还是……很想她吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4262
translate chinese lilyannepause_a40bfa36:

    # mc "Yes... I still want to see her. I want to say sorry. I want to know if she's doing fine. I want to ask if she still remembers me."
    mc "是啊……我想见她。我想道歉。我想知道她过得怎么样。我想问问她是不是还记得我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4263
translate chinese lilyannepause_0028f10d:

    # mc "There's so, so much that I want to say to her. I... still want to keep my promise..."
    mc "我有太多，太多的话想对她说。我……还想实现我的承诺……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4264
translate chinese lilyannepause_fc896afd:

    # mc "But..."
    mc "但是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4265
translate chinese lilyannepause_50c64647:

    # mc "But I let her down and confessed to someone else so I could escape from all the pain."
    mc "但是我让她失望了。我向另一个女生表白了，以为这样就能逃避所有痛苦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4266
translate chinese lilyannepause_2536e6a3:

    # mc "I'm... such a coward..."
    mc "我……真是个懦夫……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4267
translate chinese lilyannepause_7ece076f:

    # mc "Now, I'm facing a lot of problems that I don't know what to do with... I probably deserve all this after what I've done."
    mc "现在，我又遇到了无数我不知道要怎么解决的问题……可能这就是我该有的报应吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4270
translate chinese lilyannepause_b742c841:

    # e "{i}I thought... he totally forgot about me..."
    e "{i}我以为……他完全忘了我了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4271
translate chinese lilyannepause_5aff2fd8:

    # e "{i}Now that he told me what happened... This is just... too painful..."
    e "{i}他说的这一切……实在……太痛苦了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4272
translate chinese lilyannepause_4e19f380:

    # e "{i}Because of that one wrong decision, our lives turned out like this..."
    e "{i}就因为一个错误的决定，我们的生活就变成了这样……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4273
translate chinese lilyannepause_8c770912:

    # e "{i}It's just... so unfair..."
    e "{i}实在……太不公平了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4274
translate chinese lilyannepause_68a3e9cf:

    # e "{i}But even so..."
    e "{i}但即使如此……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4277
translate chinese lilyannepause_57073f90:

    # e "*clench*"
    e "*抓紧*"

# game/ep6.rpy:4278
translate chinese lilyannepause_0fbea230:

    # e "{i}Even just this one time..."
    e "{i}哪怕只有这一次也好……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4279
translate chinese lilyannepause_33b3cae2:

    # e "{i}With all the courage I have..."
    e "{i}用尽我所有的勇气……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4280
translate chinese lilyannepause_e9251b49:

    # e "{i}I..."
    e "{i}我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4281
translate chinese lilyannepause_d58da4dd:

    # e "{i}...want to hug him..."
    e "{i}……想要紧紧抱住他……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4284
translate chinese lilyannepause_fb9e7f48:

    # mc "Aha haaa... Man... Why am I even telling you all-"
    mc "啊哈哈……唉……我何必跟你说这——"

# game/ep6.rpy:4287
translate chinese lilyannepause_f86b6f24:

    # mc "...!!!"
    mc "...！！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4290
translate chinese lilyannepause_504ff118:

    # e "{i}Don't ever blame yourself. Knowing that you came back for me is enough."
    e "{i}不要怪罪自己了。你能回来，就已经足够了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4291
translate chinese lilyannepause_3e466916:

    # e "{i}That's all I wanted to know..."
    e "{i}知道这点我就已经满足了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4292
translate chinese lilyannepause_b3aa1537:

    # e "{i}I deeply regret my decision to move on, but now that we're in this situation, there is no turning back time anymore."
    e "{i}我无比后悔我当初的决定，但事已至此，也无法再回头了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4293
translate chinese lilyannepause_93c1502b:

    # e "{i}If I can comfort you like this any time you are in distress, then I will never ask for more."
    e "{i}假如不管什么时候你陷入了悲伤，我都能像这样来安慰你，我也不会再要求更多了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4294
translate chinese lilyannepause_f9332de7:

    # e "{i}I'm here now... I'll be here for you."
    e "{i}我就在这……我也会一直在你身边。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4297
translate chinese lilyannepause_17284d70:

    # e "{i}It's not bad to wish for it twice, right?"
    e "{i}许下两次同样的愿望也不算坏事，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4298
translate chinese lilyannepause_9cad5c51:

    # e "{i}Then..."
    e "{i}那么……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4299
translate chinese lilyannepause_a6ce0bd2:

    # e "{i}Please let us fix our past mistakes and guide us to the right path this time."
    e "{i}请让我们弥补从前犯下的过错，之后走上正确的道路吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4300
translate chinese lilyannepause_7e050082:

    # e "{i}That's all I could ever wish for."
    e "{i}这是我唯一的心愿。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4303
translate chinese lilyannepause_4189ace3:

    # e "[mc!t]...? Can you face me, please?"
    e "[mc!t]……？能请你看着我吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4304
translate chinese lilyannepause_0a8e5808:

    # yt "...That is... the first time she called me by my name on her own..."
    yt "……这是……她第一次主动喊我的名字……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4305
translate chinese lilyannepause_436146bf:

    # yt "Why the heck... am I feeling like I'm going to melt?"
    yt "为什么……我觉得自己快要融化了一样？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4308
translate chinese lilyannepause_78512bf2:

    # mc "Uhm... Why did you hu-"
    mc "呃……为什么你——"

# game/ep6.rpy:4311
translate chinese lilyannepause_3d3ccc77:

    # e "Shhh..."
    e "嘘……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4314
translate chinese lilyannepause_08b193de:

    # e "*touch*"
    e "*触碰*"

# game/ep6.rpy:4315
translate chinese lilyannepause_93deaf69:

    # mc "Ah..."
    mc "啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4316
translate chinese lilyannepause_c20ef992:

    # yt "Her hands feel so warm..."
    yt "她的手好温暖……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4319
translate chinese lilyannepause_f198c6e4:

    # e "Stop dwelling on the past anymore. What happened in the past will remain in the past."
    e "不要再沉浸在过去了。已经过去的事，就留在过去吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4320
translate chinese lilyannepause_b2719df1:

    # e "You never did anything wrong by confessing to Aine. If your feelings were true, then that's what's important."
    e "向艾妮表白完全不是你的错。只要你对她的感情是真的就好。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4329
translate chinese lilyannepause_d9fd4d47:

    # e "Because the magic of love is that it can happen at any time, or with anyone that you know for a long time or just met for the first time."
    e "因为这就是爱的魔力。不管是任何时候，还是对任何人，认识了很久也好，刚刚遇见也好，这都是正常的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4330
translate chinese lilyannepause_aa41efdb:

    # e "Don't ever say that you're an asshole because you were in love."
    e "不要因为你爱上了别人，就说自己是个混蛋。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4331
translate chinese lilyannepause_2c2550a2:

    # e "We always have to move on and find a new beginning at some point. You did not do anything wrong by doing so."
    e "我们总是要放下过去，着眼未来的。你这么做一点也没有错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4332
translate chinese lilyannepause_d90b35b4:

    # e "We're just humans, we feel pain. And pain will always tell us to stay away from it."
    e "我们都是普通人，都会痛苦。也都会不自觉地逃离痛苦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4333
translate chinese lilyannepause_031ddc03:

    # e "We all make decisions, but what we make out of the outcomes is what truly matters."
    e "我们都要做出选择，但是如何处理选择带来的后果才是最重要的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4334
translate chinese lilyannepause_9d105273:

    # e "In the end, only then can you fully say if they were good or bad."
    e "到最后，只有那之后才能判断选择到底是对还是错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4335
translate chinese lilyannepause_3f84773c:

    # e "So if you have a lot of things to do now, then focus on them."
    e "所以如果你现在有许多要做的事的话，专心去做就好了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4336
translate chinese lilyannepause_9a48d0af:

    # e "You said to me that you're not like you were back then, right? Then stand for it."
    e "你跟我说过你不再是从前的你了，对吧？那你就要表现出来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4337
translate chinese lilyannepause_c1f5ae32:

    # e "Be the man that you wanted to be."
    e "去成为你想成为的那种人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4338
translate chinese lilyannepause_7a509c67:

    # e "As simple as a guy like you is, you can change a person's life."
    e "哪怕像你一样普通、简单的人，也可以改变别人的一生。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4339
translate chinese lilyannepause_dc0f6e53:

    # e "You may not be rich, you may not be cool like other guys out there. But you are a good person, [mc!t]. Always remember that."
    e "你可能没有钱，你可能没有其他人那么耀眼，但是你是个好人，[mc!t]。一定要记住。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4340
translate chinese lilyannepause_ac8a4aa9:

    # yt "Her voice... It's not too loud, but not too quiet either. But every word coming out of her mouth feels like it reaches deep straight to my heart."
    yt "她的声音……并不算大，但也并不轻柔。她口中说出的每个字都好像径直抵达了我内心的最深处一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4341
translate chinese lilyannepause_e9c02a98:

    # yt "The way she's talking right now is nothing like I've ever heard from her before..."
    yt "她现在的语气是我之前从来没见过的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4342
translate chinese lilyannepause_363d8e56:

    # yt "What's with me? Why am I feeling like this towards her?"
    yt "我到底怎么了？为什么我对她会有这种感觉？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4343
translate chinese lilyannepause_1bad32d5:

    # e "Wherever that girl is, I'm sure she's all fine. I'm sure she's happy right now."
    e "不管那个女孩现在在哪，她肯定过得很好。她肯定现在非常幸福。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4344
translate chinese lilyannepause_4498f548:

    # e "Although, if there's one thing I'm really certain about... it's that you became a part of her and she will never forget about you."
    e "如果说有一件事我能百分百肯定的话……我可以说，你绝对成了她生命中不可或缺的一部分。她永远不会忘记你的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4347
translate chinese lilyannepause_5a8ef22f:

    # e "*giggles*"
    e "*笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:4348
translate chinese lilyannepause_0405a815:

    # mc "*thumps*"
    mc "*心跳加速*"

# game/ep6.rpy:4349
translate chinese lilyannepause_289c2dc9:

    # yt "God fucking damn it..."
    yt "我……到底是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4352
translate chinese lilyannepause_c5cda423:

    # e "I never actually sincerely said 'sorry' to you before."
    e "我以前从来没有真诚地向你道歉过。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4355
translate chinese lilyannepause_2508c496:

    # e "So with all the things I did in the past..."
    e "所以，对于我之前做过的所有事情……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4356
translate chinese lilyannepause_84210981:

    # e "I'm deeply sorry, [mc!t]. Please forgive me."
    e "我非常、非常地抱歉，[mc!t]。我恳请你原谅我。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4357
translate chinese lilyannepause_9055a894:

    # mc "Uhm... Please raise your head, you don't really need to bow, you know?"
    mc "呃……请把头抬起来吧，你没必要鞠躬的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4358
translate chinese lilyannepause_acd41000:

    # mc "And please stop talking to me so formally."
    mc "也别用这么严肃的词句跟我说话。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4361
translate chinese lilyannepause_a8bfdc99:

    # e "I want to make it up to you, so please give me the chance to do so. But... I have no idea what to do right now, so please give me time to think about it."
    e "我想补偿过去的一切，请给我赎罪的机会。但是……我现在还不知道该做什么，所以请给我一些时间考虑一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4362
translate chinese lilyannepause_a17e391e:

    # mc "No, you should focus on your case first! A job is a job. I'm just here, I won't go anywhere."
    mc "不，你应该先集中在你的案子上！工作是最优先的。我一直都在呢，又不会跑掉。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4363
translate chinese lilyannepause_ef4798b3:

    # mc "Solve it, and then we have a deal."
    mc "破案之后，我们再谈。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4366
translate chinese lilyannepause_93744084:

    # e "I'll make that piece of shit talk tomorrow then, mark my words."
    e "明天我就让那个人渣招供，我说到做到。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4367
translate chinese lilyannepause_46a03a30:

    # mc "So you can swear, huh?"
    mc "原来你也会骂人啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4370
translate chinese lilyannepause_8e6ce723_1:

    # e "...!!!"
    e "...！！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4373
translate chinese lilyannepause_f799ca3c:

    # e "Oh... I'm sorry."
    e "噢……不好意思。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4374
translate chinese lilyannepause_dd7dfb0d:

    # mc "Let me guess? Gwen's influence, right?"
    mc "我猜猜，格温的影响，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4375
translate chinese lilyannepause_dc575de2:

    # e "Mhm. I think so?"
    e "嗯。应该是吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4376
translate chinese lilyannepause_f007f129:

    # mc "*sighs* That girl's personality is contagious."
    mc "*叹气* 她的性格可真能传染啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4377
translate chinese lilyannepause_fe446ef5:

    # mc "Anyway, we should go upstairs and sleep. It's getting late."
    mc "好了，我们该上楼睡觉了。时候不早了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4378
translate chinese lilyannepause_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4381
translate chinese lilyannepause_3b21f354_5:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4384
translate chinese lilyannepause_88f902c6:

    # mc "Uhm... hold on."
    mc "嗯……等一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4385
translate chinese lilyannepause_0fba19b8:

    # e "Hm?"
    e "嗯？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4386
translate chinese lilyannepause_1c238b03:

    # mc "Can you talk to me like you just did from now on?"
    mc "你以后能像刚刚那样跟我说话吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4387
translate chinese lilyannepause_db8fbfd5:

    # mc "I don't know which is the real you, but you talking like a robot really puts me off."
    mc "我不知道真实的你到底是怎么样的，但你每次像机器人一样说话都让我很烦。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4390
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_5:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4393
translate chinese lilyannepause_187ab68e:

    # e "When we're alone, it will be alright."
    e "只有我们两个人的时候，我可以那样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4394
translate chinese lilyannepause_d5ae2301:

    # mc "Fair enough."
    mc "那倒也行。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4395
translate chinese lilyannepause_bce47427:

    # mc "Alright, let's go."
    mc "好了，走吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4398
translate chinese lilyannepause_94a92282:

    # e "Mhm!"
    e "嗯！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4401
translate chinese lilyannepause_29109e0a:

    # yt "I don't know what it is with her, but she made me feel so calm after that emotional talk just now."
    yt "我不知道她有什么魔力，不过刚刚跟她交心谈过之后，我平静了许多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4402
translate chinese lilyannepause_e158abf8:

    # yt "I just wonder why I even told her about it. I never really told anyone about that part of my past."
    yt "我都不知道为什么我会告诉她那么多。那段过去我从来没告诉过任何人。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4403
translate chinese lilyannepause_4ab9027e:

    # yt "I... need to know who this girl is."
    yt "我……需要知道她到底是谁。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4413
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_6:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4414
translate chinese lilyannepause_b5ade0b2:

    # e "........."
    e "........."

# game/ep6.rpy:4415
translate chinese lilyannepause_150b75b5:

    # a "Uhm... Em? What's wrong? You didn't-"
    a "呃……小艾？怎么了？你都——"

# game/ep6.rpy:4416
translate chinese lilyannepause_8aafd301:

    # e "Did you ever meet that guy before we started all of this?"
    e "我们开始这么干之前，你见过他吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4417
translate chinese lilyannepause_450c70c6:

    # a "To be honest with you, yes. A month before the school year started. Mom told me to do something about him... and..."
    a "说实话，见过。学年开始之前一个月，妈妈让我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4420
translate chinese lilyannepause_d20c3621:

    # e "*runs*"
    e "*跑走*"

# game/ep6.rpy:4421
translate chinese lilyannepause_9e6b40ec:

    # a "*gasps* Ah, Em! Where are you going?!"
    a "*惊讶* 哎，小艾！你要去哪？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4429
translate chinese lilyannepause_e687176f:

    # h "Hm? You're home early. Where's Aine?"
    h "嗯？你回来得挺早。艾妮在哪？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4430
translate chinese lilyannepause_ad6e165b_7:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:4433
translate chinese lilyannepause_3ac0c71c:

    # e "HEERRAAAAAAA!!!!"
    e "赫拉啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4434
translate chinese lilyannepause_472ecb5d:

    # h "Charging head-on towards me? You're making a big mistake, Emma."
    h "居然笔直冲我来啊？你犯了大错，艾玛。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4437
translate chinese lilyannepause_de688ec9:

    # e "And your biggest mistake was..."
    e "而你最大的错误就是……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4438
translate chinese lilyannepause_c602f7fc:

    # h "!!!"
    h "！！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4444
translate chinese lilyannepause_41c2e650:

    # h "Urk!"
    h "切！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4447
translate chinese lilyannepause_e887e401:

    # e "You should've thought twice about teaching me how to fight!"
    e "教会了我怎么打架！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4450
translate chinese lilyannepause_08745961:

    # h "Heh... Nice try."
    h "哈……不错。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4453
translate chinese lilyannepause_d3dba446:

    # h "Using what we taught you against me? How insolent."
    h "用我教你的东西对付我？真无礼啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4454
translate chinese lilyannepause_1f4fc259:

    # h "Let me guess..."
    h "我猜猜……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4455
translate chinese lilyannepause_f332aa7a:

    # h "He's finally back, isn't he?"
    h "他终于回来了，对吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4458
translate chinese lilyannepause_79eb53eb:

    # e "You knew..."
    e "你都知道……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4459
translate chinese lilyannepause_3772fa77:

    # e "You knew everything!"
    e "你从一开始就全都知道！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4462
translate chinese lilyannepause_2ed99c00:

    # h "Oh, of course. I've known him since he was born. I know his family, I know everything about him."
    h "噢，我当然知道。他一出生我就知道他了。我知道他的家人，我知道关于他的一切。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4463
translate chinese lilyannepause_c45e1463:

    # h "I told you, didn't I?"
    h "我跟你说过，不是吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4464
translate chinese lilyannepause_dbb1f482:

    # h "Don't ever blame me for what's coming next. Yet, you still chose to be with Aine."
    h "我跟你说过，接下来不管发生什么都不要怪我。尽管如此，你还是选择了陪在艾妮身边。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4465
translate chinese lilyannepause_92298a55:

    # h "You're very fragile, and that's your biggest weakness. It leads you to the worst decisions."
    h "你太脆弱了，这是你最大的弱点。也导致你做了最糟糕的决定。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4466
translate chinese lilyannepause_e87610f3:

    # e "Fragile?"
    e "脆弱？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4467
translate chinese lilyannepause_0dd6c55c:

    # e "I..."
    e "我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4470
translate chinese lilyannepause_d1463c3a:

    # e "I waited a whole lot of years for him, I did what I could!"
    e "我等了他那么多年，我已经竭尽全力了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4471
translate chinese lilyannepause_c56cb523:

    # e "You didn't want me to serve Aine, you thought I was useless! Then you accepted me so easily after you knew that he's coming back!"
    e "你并不想让我去服侍艾妮，你一直都觉得我毫无用处！但是你一知道他要回来了，就立马接受了我！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4472
translate chinese lilyannepause_89b766b9:

    # e "Just what are you planning?"
    e "你到底在计划什么？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4473
translate chinese lilyannepause_bac7baab:

    # e "You never told-"
    e "你从来没告诉——"

# game/ep6.rpy:4476
translate chinese lilyannepause_f68fe527:

    # h "Told you about what? That I knew?"
    h "告诉你什么？告诉你我全都知道？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4477
translate chinese lilyannepause_8431db18:

    # h "Why would I? What for?"
    h "为什么？有什么用吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:4478
translate chinese lilyannepause_22e02c0d:

    # h "It's my personal business, you have nothing to do about it. I'm just using you as a tool the way I use any other servants here."
    h "这是我的私事，跟你没有任何关系。我只是把你当成工具使用而已，就像我利用所有其他的仆人一样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4479
translate chinese lilyannepause_45619245:

    # h "You decided that on your own, Emma. Don't throw your anger at me just because you made the wrong decision."
    h "这是你自己选择的路，艾玛。别因为你自己做了错误的决定而对我发火。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4480
translate chinese lilyannepause_e74d8321:

    # h "And now, you're nothing but a caged bird. You did that to yourself."
    h "现在，你只是个笼中鸟而已。都是你自找的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:4483
translate chinese lilyannepause_3f0dedf4:

    # e "You're right... I made the wrong decision. I can't blame you..."
    e "你说得对……我做了错误的决定。我不能怪你……"

# game/ep6.rpy:4486
translate chinese lilyannepause_5a8cabe4:

    # e "But we are humans, Hera! We are not your toys to play with for fun!"
    e "但我们也是人，赫拉！我们不是你拿来取乐的玩具！"

# game/ep6.rpy:4487
