translate chinese emmapause3_3382c1f7:

    # k "Setting it up here would be too much of a hassle if I want to live in Golden Town, so I would really prefer it to be there."
    k "我如果打算定居金城的话，在这里创建就太麻烦了。所以我的首选还是金城。"

