    mc "呃……芙蕾？抱歉打扰你的美梦，不过……他是男的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5895
translate chinese freyapantstease_eca3416a:

    # f "Eh? I beg your pardon? Can you please repeat that?"
    f "啊？你说什么？能请你再重复一遍吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5896
translate chinese freyapantstease_77da53f9:

    # mc "He's a guy, a male, a chad, a he, whatever you can think of that can describe a man, that's him."
    mc "他是男的，性别为男性，一个雄性，代词为他，以及一切能拿来代指男人的词汇。他是男的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5899
translate chinese freyapantstease_c4f57744:

    # shu "Yep! I have three girlfriends too!"
    shu "是的！我还有三个女朋友！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5902
translate chinese freyapantstease_c5500f2c:

    # shu "My, my... Jumping at me as soon as you saw me... I must be too good-looking!"
    shu "瞧瞧……一看见我就朝我扑过来了……肯定是因为我太帅了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5905
translate chinese freyapantstease_9182fa79:

    # shu "Ahh... I'm just too good for this world!"
    shu "啊……我实在是超凡脱俗啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5906
translate chinese freyapantstease_71414e3e:

    # yt "Right, right... I almost forgot his personality... He's one heck of a narcissist..."
    yt "唉，对了……我都忘了这货是这个德行了……完完全全一个自恋狂……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5907
translate chinese freyapantstease_f2bcb1fc:

    # shu "You can call me the Alpha and the Omeg-"
    shu "你可以称呼我为万物的起源与终——"

# game/ep6.rpy:5914
translate chinese freyapantstease_dbd7f6de:

    # shu "Gaaa~!!"
    shu "啊啊啊啊~！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5915
translate chinese freyapantstease_f0f79849:

    # f "Get out of my face, you squirt! You're not a comrade, you're my worst enemy!"
    f "给我滚蛋，你个渣男！你根本不是我的同志，你是我最大的敌人！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5918
translate chinese freyapantstease_364eb501:

    # shu "Huuuuh?!!"
    shu "什么？！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5919
translate chinese freyapantstease_32772573:

    # shu "You're the one who jumped at me, you bitch! Now you just damaged my precious and exquisitely handsome face!"
    shu "是你往我身上扑的，贱人！你居然还敢玷污我这张无比珍贵、精雕细琢的帅脸！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5920
translate chinese freyapantstease_8aba139c:

    # shu "What do you mean your worst enemy, huh?!"
    shu "最大的敌人是什么意思啊，你说啊？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5923
translate chinese freyapantstease_0c8fd48b:

    # f "How dare you make me think that you're a girl, squirt!"
    f "你居然让我以为你是个女的，渣男！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5924
translate chinese freyapantstease_8acdeb32:

    # shu "Don't call me that! And blame my creators who made me like this! It's not my fault if they made me so perfect!"
    shu "不准你这么喊我！要怪的话，就去怪上帝给了我这幅美貌！生得这么完美又不是我的错！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5927
translate chinese freyapantstease_9a88fa0f:

    # mc "Aha ha ha ha..."
    mc "啊哈哈哈哈……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5931
translate chinese freyapantstease_517204fe:

    # shu "Ow, ow, ow!"
    shu "去死！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5932
translate chinese freyapantstease_6ce73866:

    # f "Ow, ow, ow!"
    f "你才去死！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5933
translate chinese freyapantstease_9dbee748:

    # mc "Now, now... Calm down or I'll lock you both inside the shop."
    mc "好了，好了……都冷静点，不然我就把你俩都锁在店里。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5934
translate chinese freyapantstease_4cad9cc5:

    # shu "With this bitch? Hell no!"
    shu "跟这个贱人一起？不可能！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5935
translate chinese freyapantstease_51ebb2ad:

    # f "With this squirt? Over my dead body!"
    f "跟这个渣男一起？除非杀了我才行！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5936
translate chinese freyapantstease_df00d40b:

    # mc "No, I'm serious, I'll lock you up..."
    mc "我认真的，再这样我真会把你们锁里面的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5939
translate chinese freyapantstease_39daf8a0_1:

    # f "......"
    f "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:5940
translate chinese freyapantstease_468b13d9:

    # shu "......"
    shu "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:5941
translate chinese freyapantstease_587d14fb:

    # mc "I see that I finally got your attention."
    mc "看来你们终于愿意听话了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5944
translate chinese freyapantstease_24b25b0f:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:5947
translate chinese freyapantstease_c35b6836:

    # f "Anyway, who's this squirt?"
    f "这个渣男是谁啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5948
translate chinese freyapantstease_6f28163c:

    # shu "Hey, I told you to not call me that!"
    shu "喂，我都说了不准那么喊我！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5949
translate chinese freyapantstease_b4e34b42:

    # mc "Ah, well... He was a classmate during college, you can say that he was my best friend."
    mc "啊，这个嘛……他是我大学同学。也可以说他是我最好的朋友。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5950
translate chinese freyapantstease_ccf35989:

    # mc "But after we graduated, he went overseas along with his family, which is why I wonder what the heck he is doing here."
    mc "但我们毕业之后，他就跟着家人一起出国了。所以我才不知道他为什么突然回来了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5951
translate chinese freyapantstease_2daad490:

    # mc "I haven't heard any news from him for almost two months now."
    mc "我都有差不多两个月没跟他联系过了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5952
translate chinese freyapantstease_6e360aff:

    # f "Ah. I see."
    f "啊。好吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5955
translate chinese freyapantstease_06cb101e:

    # shu "Come on...! That's harsh of you, [mc!t]! Didn't you miss me at all?"
    shu "得了吧……！你怎么这么绝情啊，[mc!t]！你难道一点都不想我吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5956
translate chinese freyapantstease_f0efef16:

    # mc "Uh, no? Why would I?"
    mc "呃，不想啊？为什么我要想你？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5957
translate chinese freyapantstease_d5307874:

    # shu "Isn't it obvious?"
    shu "这还用问吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5960
translate chinese freyapantstease_fb5a73cb:

    # shu "It's because I'm your..."
    shu "当然是因为我是你……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5961
translate chinese freyapantstease_0980880e:

    # shu "Best..."
    shu "最铁的……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5964
translate chinese freyapantstease_361fd443:

    # shu "Friend!"
    shu "朋友！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5965
translate chinese freyapantstease_e817e96b:

    # mc "You {b}were{/b} my best friend. You left me hanging after you left the country, you twat."
    mc "你{b}曾经{/b}是我最好的朋友。因为你把我丢下，跑到国外去了，傻逼！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5968
translate chinese freyapantstease_6bf679f1:

    # shu "Huun... I'm sorry, okay!"
    shu "哈哈……对不起嘛，对不起！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5969
translate chinese freyapantstease_06f6c9d1:

    # mc "Now, what are you doing here? I didn't expect to see you today, to be honest."
    mc "你这是回来干嘛呢？我从来没想过今天能看见你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5970
translate chinese freyapantstease_d4ac7960:

    # mc "You're free to enter the shop, by the way. Don't just stand outside like a stalker or something."
    mc "而且，你完全可以进来坐坐啊。干嘛像个跟踪狂一样站在外面？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5973
translate chinese freyapantstease_f80357a0:

    # shu "Dude! You're cleaning! How can I just enter without permission? I still have my manners, you know?"
    shu "兄弟！你在打扫卫生啊！我怎么能就这么进去？我也是懂礼貌的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5974
translate chinese freyapantstease_dd8912a0:

    # shu "I'd rather stay outside than get berated by your manager!"
    shu "我宁愿站在外面等着，也不想被你的经理骂！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5975
translate chinese freyapantstease_6db2bec5:

    # mc "That's shocking to know that you have manners."
    mc "你居然还懂得礼节这一冲击性的事实令我感到十分震惊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5976
translate chinese freyapantstease_4f218c10:

    # mc "Well, we don't have that kind of rule here. So you're free to enter as long as it's open."
    mc "不过呢，我们这里没有那种规矩。只要没关门，随时都可以进来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5977
translate chinese freyapantstease_deae285e:

    # shu "Eh, alright, next time then."
    shu "呃，好吧，我知道了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5980
translate chinese freyapantstease_3c214207:

    # shu "But now that I'm back, we should go out sometime, man!"
    shu "既然我回来了，我们得找时间出去玩玩，兄弟！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5981
translate chinese freyapantstease_1d6c7f2a:

    # shu "You know? Go somewhere with a lot of hot chicks like the old times?"
    shu "你应该还记得吧？就像以前一样，去那种有很多漂亮小妞的地方？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5982
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:5983
translate chinese freyapantstease_5b6a9983:

    # mc "No... I'm busy."
    mc "不了……我很忙。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5986
translate chinese freyapantstease_2a7345fc:

    # shu "Harsh!"
    shu "怎么这样！"

# game/ep6.rpy:5987
translate chinese freyapantstease_d11af275:

    # shu "You've gone cold, [mc!t]. What happened to you?"
    shu "你好绝情啊，[mc!t]。你怎么变成了这个样子？"

# game/ep6.rpy:5988
translate chinese freyapantstease_2fab282b:

    # mc "It's not that I'm cold, I just decided to be a better guy, Shu. Set my life straight, you know?"
    mc "我不是绝情，我只是想成为一个更好的人。我要好好生活。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5989
translate chinese freyapantstease_a57ad3c2:

    # yt "Besides, someone is looking at me in a bad way..."
    yt "再说了，有个人现在正用异样的眼光看着我……"

# game/ep6.rpy:5992
translate chinese freyapantstease_7ddb8ba5:

    # shu "Well, we're at the age where we should be looking for a living, so I get you."
    shu "好吧，我们都到了要讨生活的年纪，我可以理解你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5993
translate chinese freyapantstease_475830f0:

    # mc "*chuckles* You've matured quite a bit, and that's good to know. You usually just forced me to come with you."
    mc "*笑* 你多少还是成熟了一点，这是好事。以前的话，你肯定会逼着我跟你一起的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5994
translate chinese freyapantstease_61690e70:

    # shu "A lot happened while I was outside the country that got my shit all messed up, so... yeah. I learned from my mistakes."
    shu "我在国外的时候，发生过很多事，也搞砸过很多事，所以……我学到了不少教训。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5997
translate chinese freyapantstease_40e73a15:

    # shu "But still, I want to celebrate my comeback, so we need to go somewhere some other time."
    shu "但是，至少也要庆祝我回国吧？所以，我们还是得找个时间出去聚一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5998
translate chinese freyapantstease_070f48df:

    # shu "And no, it won't be at any bar here. We're going somewhere that you're very familiar with."
    shu "而且，可不是在这附近随便找个酒吧。我要去那个你很熟悉的地方。"

# game/ep6.rpy:5999
translate chinese freyapantstease_6a8ae504:

    # mc "Heeh... Now I'm interested. How's that place going? I thought they closed it a year ago."
    mc "啊……我现在倒感兴趣了。那里现在怎么样了？听说一年前已经倒闭了啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6000
translate chinese freyapantstease_7ad4216d:

    # shu "They did! But they reopened it recently — that's why I decided to come back and invite you."
    shu "是啊！但是最近又重新开业了——所以我才回来，想跟你一起去。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6001
translate chinese freyapantstease_43e9f008:

    # shu "Coming back here just for that place is really worth the trouble."
    shu "哪怕只是为了再去那坐坐也完全值得我回来了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6002
translate chinese freyapantstease_54f290b0:

    # shu "Why don't you invite your friends? I'm sure they'd like the place!"
    shu "你要不喊上你的朋友一起呗？她们肯定也都会喜欢的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6003
translate chinese freyapantstease_9b5cd9f9:

    # mc "I'll think about it for now."
    mc "我会考虑一下。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6004
translate chinese freyapantstease_ce147bd9:

    # shu "Sure, sure!"
    shu "好的，好的！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6007
translate chinese freyapantstease_e8ab1ade:

    # shu "Don't let this bitch come with us though."
    shu "但别让这个贱人跟着一起来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6008
translate chinese freyapantstease_f90fcacb:

    # f "Say what now?!"
    f "你说什么？！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6009
translate chinese freyapantstease_206d0fed:

    # f "I might just kill this squirt one day, [mc!t]. Trust me."
    f "总有一天我要宰了这个渣男，[mc!t]。我说真的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6010
translate chinese freyapantstease_5d9718d0:

    # mc "You guys just met and you're already enemies, what's wrong with you two?"
    mc "你俩才刚刚见面就成这样了，到底什么情况啊？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6011
translate chinese freyapantstease_2d2f80f9:

    # mc "Though it's pretty funny to see two short stacks fight. It's like seeing kids brawl!"
    mc "但是看两个矮个子干架还挺有意思的。就好像小孩子闹着玩一样！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6012
translate chinese freyapantstease_fdf9352d:

    # mc "Ahahahahaha..."
    mc "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6015
translate chinese freyapantstease_5af96306:

    # mc "...haaa..."
    mc "……哈哈……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6016
translate chinese freyapantstease_294eb413:

    # mc "*ehem* I'm just kidding..."
    mc "*清嗓子* 我开个玩笑……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6017
translate chinese freyapantstease_8dd9ec36:

    # mc "W-well, anyway. I'm going home now."
    mc "呃，嗯，总之，我要回家了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6020
translate chinese freyapantstease_9bdc221c:

    # f "Yeah, let's go!"
    f "好，走吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6021
translate chinese freyapantstease_c9a690b4:

    # shu "Hold on, do you still have my number?"
    shu "等一下，你还存着我的号码吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6022
translate chinese freyapantstease_43c1fe38:

    # mc "Hmm... Yeah? I think so? I haven't deleted any of my contacts for years. Why?"
    mc "嗯……对啊？应该吧？我好几年都没有删过联系人了。怎么了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6025
translate chinese freyapantstease_94afb91c:

    # shu "Noice!"
    shu "很好！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6028
translate chinese freyapantstease_4bddf906:

    # shu "My number is still the same, by the way. I'll talk to you later, man."
    shu "我的号码没有变。之后再聊，兄弟。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6029
translate chinese freyapantstease_1d4733ef:

    # mc "Oh, that's convenient, sure!"
    mc "噢，那还挺方便的。再聊吧！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6037
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354_1:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6040
translate chinese freyapantstease_4497ac07:

    # mc "Uhh... Excuse me, sir. Why are you still following me? We are just two blocks away from my house. Are you lost or something?"
    mc "呃……不好意思，哥们儿。为什么你还跟着我啊？都已经快到我家了。你是迷路了吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6041
translate chinese freyapantstease_b14d2cef:

    # shu "Huh? No way, dude! You know I'm good with directions, I still know every nook and cranny of this city even after all these years, you know?"
    shu "啊？怎么可能啊，兄弟！你也知道我不可能迷路的。过了这么些年，我也依然记得城里的每个角落。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6042
translate chinese freyapantstease_73b19bee:

    # mc "Then why are you following me?"
    mc "那你为什么跟着我？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6043
translate chinese freyapantstease_b2702833:

    # shu "I'm not! I'm heading to my house, buddy!"
    shu "我没有！我也在回家的路上，兄弟！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6046
translate chinese freyapantstease_d9430e72:

    # shu "It's that one!"
    shu "我家就在那！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6049
translate chinese freyapantstease_7b8f1721:

    # mc "Wait... This one is just right across from ours, isn't it...?"
    mc "等等……那不就是我家对面吗……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6052
translate chinese freyapantstease_93ac5b82:

    # mc "Then that means..."
    mc "也就是说……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6053
translate chinese freyapantstease_468b13d9_1:

    # shu "......"
    shu "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6056
translate chinese freyapantstease_eefe9cdc:

    # tbot "HUUUUUUUUHH......??!!"
    tbot "搞鸡毛啊……？？！！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6057
translate chinese freyapantstease_36c43300:

    # shu "Dude, you never told me you live here!"
    shu "伙计，你从来没跟我说过你住在这啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6060
translate chinese freyapantstease_57a5b0f2:

    # mc "No, you stay away from me, you demon spawn! You're toxic in my life!"
    mc "你他妈的离我家远点，你个扫把星！有你在准没好事！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6061
translate chinese freyapantstease_aac39a8d:

    # shu "Hey, don't be rude to your new neighbor! Now bow down to your master!"
    shu "喂，你怎么对新邻居这么没礼貌啊！给你的主人跪下道歉！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6062
translate chinese freyapantstease_f6f43eaa:

    # mc "What the heck are you talking about! You ain't my master, you shit!"
    mc "你在瞎扯什么东西！你根本不是我的主人，你个弱智！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6065
translate chinese freyapantstease_ae6e2a84:

    # mc "...Wait, did you just say 'new neighbor'?"
    mc "……等等，你说“新邻居”？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6074
translate chinese freyapantstease_560af818:

    # shu "Well, yeah! I recently bought the house for myself. I'm going to stay here from now on."
    shu "是啊！这房子是我刚刚买的。从今往后我就要在这定居了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6075
translate chinese freyapantstease_7205f988:

    # mc "You rich bastard!"
    mc "你小子可真有钱啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6076
translate chinese freyapantstease_9406c48d:

    # mc "But... All alone? You mentioned you have three girlfriends, right? Where are they? Don't tell me you were lying."
    mc "但是……你一个人住吗？你刚刚不还说你有三个女朋友吗？她们在哪？别告诉我你是在瞎扯淡啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6077
translate chinese freyapantstease_3e1fd8b4:

    # shu "No, I wasn't lying. I left them in that country so I can have my absolute freedom here."
    shu "没有，我没骗人。我想自由自由地生活，所以我让她们都留在国外了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6078
translate chinese freyapantstease_c943e691:

    # mc "Jesus, dude... You never change when it comes to women!"
    mc "天啊，兄弟……你对女人怎么还是这个鸟样啊！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6079
translate chinese freyapantstease_5b38af86:

    # shu "No, no! You got me all wrong!"
    shu "不是，不是！你误会了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6080
translate chinese freyapantstease_31837ad3:

    # shu "What I meant was... So that I can go anywhere I want. Traveling and all that, you know?"
    shu "我的意思是……这样一来，我想去哪都可以了。我喜欢旅行，你知道吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6081
translate chinese freyapantstease_bb75e0f4:

    # shu "They're my chains. They don't want me to go anywhere. I just told them that I have a business to take care of in this country so they'd let me go."
    shu "她们会束缚住我。她们哪都不想让我去。我跟她们说我要来这个国家处理生意，她们才放我走。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6082
translate chinese freyapantstease_9482eb72:

    # shu "But despite that, I love my girls, dude. I'll never cheat on them."
    shu "但尽管如此，我还是爱她们的，兄弟。我永远不会背叛她们。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6085
translate chinese freyapantstease_b3c13745:

    # shu "Not anymore since I lost her..."
    shu "自从失去她之后，我就再也不会……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6086
translate chinese freyapantstease_57a07c67:

    # mc "You mean... your girlfriend when we were in college?"
    mc "你是说……你上大学时候交的那个女朋友吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6087
translate chinese freyapantstease_4b90f534:

    # shu "Yeah..."
    shu "是啊……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6090
translate chinese freyapantstease_f46b669d:

    # mc "*chuckles*"
    mc "*笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:6093
translate chinese freyapantstease_fba1866b:

    # mc "Depressed Shu, away!"
    mc "你抑郁起来真恶心。一边去！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6094
translate chinese freyapantstease_bc8b4ff1:

    # shu "Pfff!!"
    shu "滚蛋吧你！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6097
translate chinese freyapantstease_58af1fd3:

    # mc "Come on! Just get over it, Shu. We're on our new lives now."
    mc "行了！往前看吧，修。我们都开始新的生活了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6098
translate chinese freyapantstease_891d688c:

    # mc "Just like what a certain girl said to me -- 'Be the man that you wanted to be'."
    mc "有个女生曾经这么跟我说过——“成为自己想成为的人”。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6101
translate chinese freyapantstease_90ac8222:

    # mc "I don't know why, but I felt a huge weight removed from my shoulders when she said that to me the other day..."
    mc "我也不知道为什么，但我听到她这么说之后，感觉肩上的担子轻了许多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6102
translate chinese freyapantstease_6778ee2c:

    # shu "Well, damn... You're so lucky, dude. Nobody ever told me something like that. Looks like you found the girl of your dreams, huh?"
    shu "好吧……你很走运，哥们儿。从来没人跟我说过那种话。看来你找到了你的梦中情人啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6103
translate chinese freyapantstease_ef9766c8:

    # mc "I'm not too sure about that..."
    mc "这点，我倒不能确定……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6104
translate chinese freyapantstease_f151718d:

    # mc "Right now... She's just too mysterious to me..."
    mc "现在……我只觉得她太神秘了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6107
translate chinese freyapantstease_48bf4857:

    # shu "Shit, now you're the one brooding over something."
    shu "操，现在换你开始散发诡异的气息了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6108
translate chinese freyapantstease_40c5df7f:

    # shu "You know what? I'll just go inside before this talk gets any deeper. I don't want to hear your cringe-y words when that happens."
    shu "行了，我可不想让对话更深刻了。更不想听你说点更尴尬的东西。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6109
translate chinese freyapantstease_65fff09f:

    # shu "And besides, I still have to unpack my bags. I just got here today."
    shu "而且，我还得收拾行李呢。我今天才刚刚搬进来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6110
translate chinese freyapantstease_4d3a6537:

    # mc "Well, alright. I'll see you later then."
    mc "好吧，好吧。那就之后再见了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6113
translate chinese freyapantstease_5bdcf767:

    # shu "Yep! See you later, dude!"
    shu "OK！再见，兄弟！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6114
translate chinese freyapantstease_c343521e:

    # mc "Don't come near my house though..."
    mc "但我警告你，你不准接近我家……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6115
translate chinese freyapantstease_f05e8c46:

    # shu "You know that you're actually just tempting me to do so if you say that."
    shu "你也知道，你越这么说，我就越想去。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6118
translate chinese freyapantstease_4de7e84e:

    # e "{i}Hm? Is that a girl he was talking to?"
    e "{i}嗯？他在跟一个女生说话吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6121
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354_2:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6122
translate chinese freyapantstease_78404331:

    # mc "Hey, Emma. You're home early today."
    mc "你好，艾玛。你今天回来得好早。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6123
translate chinese freyapantstease_fcd026f6:

    # e "Yes, I don't have anything to do at the office since I just solved my case."
    e "是的，因为我刚刚破了手上的案子，所以今天在办公室几乎没有事做。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6126
translate chinese freyapantstease_e43ec125:

    # e "By the way, was that a girl you were talking to? I don't remember anybody living in that house since we got here."
    e "对了，你刚刚是在跟一个女生说话吗？我自从搬来这里，就没见过对面有住人啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6127
translate chinese freyapantstease_c5bd0d62:

    # mc "Eh? No, that was a guy. Like... a hundred percent kind of guy..."
    mc "呃？不，那是个男的。就……百分之百是男人……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6130
translate chinese freyapantstease_ad6e165b:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6131
translate chinese freyapantstease_9e21d7b8:

    # mc "*sighs* I knew this would happen if he's here."
    mc "*叹气* 我就知道会这样。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6132
translate chinese freyapantstease_2b6bb6a6:

    # mc "Trust me, I'm not lying. I can introduce him to you tomorrow if you want."
    mc "相信我，我没骗你。你想的话，我明天把他介绍给你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6135
translate chinese freyapantstease_ad6e165b_1:

    # e "......"
    e "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6136
translate chinese freyapantstease_6434dfd2:

    # mc "Ugh..."
    mc "唉……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6137
translate chinese freyapantstease_f385db57:

    # mc "Well, let's go inside. Sky might be fixing dinner already."
    mc "好了，我们快进去吧。斯凯可能已经在做晚饭了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6140
translate chinese freyapantstease_32926c38:

    # e "Hm? No, I'm the one cooking dinner for tonight. Sky asked me to do it earlier. She told me she's not feeling well."
    e "嗯？不，今晚我来做晚饭。斯凯之前拜托我帮她一下。她说她不太舒服。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6141
translate chinese freyapantstease_7d4743f6:

    # mc "Oh... Okay..."
    mc "哦……好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6145
translate chinese freyapantstease_ce7ddb62:

    # yt "Damn it... I know I have to talk to her about it. But I just know her well..."
    yt "操……我知道我必须得找她谈谈了。但我太了解斯凯了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6146
translate chinese freyapantstease_eaa89f00:

    # yt "Talking to her when she's like this won't get us anywhere. I know she won't listen to anything that I say if I try to force it."
    yt "她现在这个样子，找她说什么都没有用。哪怕我逼着她，她也不会听。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6147
translate chinese freyapantstease_114dafa9:

    # yt "All I can do right now is wait until she calms down a little bit."
    yt "我现在只能等她冷静下来一些之后再去找她了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6150
translate chinese freyapantstease_e8863011:

    # yt "*sighs*..."
    yt "*叹气*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:6151
translate chinese freyapantstease_b8168cc8:

    # yt "And now, that's another problem added to my list! I think I might just go crazy at this point!"
    yt "好了，我又多了一个要操心的问题！我马上就要疯掉了！"

# game/ep6.rpy:6161
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354_3:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6162
translate chinese freyapantstease_24b25b0f_1:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/ep6.rpy:6164
translate chinese freyapantstease_148ee7fa:

    # "*knocks*..."
    "*敲门*..."

# game/ep6.rpy:6165
translate chinese freyapantstease_4f8ff997:

    # a "Uhm... [mc!t]? Are you in there?"
    a "呃……[mc!t]？你在吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6168
translate chinese freyapantstease_1423d856:

    # mc "Hmm...? Yeah... I'm here... Why...?"
    mc "嗯……？对……我在……怎么了……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6169
translate chinese freyapantstease_97d7dd19:

    # a "Can I come in?"
    a "我可以进来吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6170
translate chinese freyapantstease_834bef35:

    # mc "Ah... well... yeah... go ahead..."
    mc "啊……好……进来吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6175
translate chinese freyapantstease_82066268:

    # a "Hey, are you okay?"
    a "你还好吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6176
translate chinese freyapantstease_9a1845cb:

    # mc "Uh... Yeah...? I think so..."
    mc "呃……很好啊……？我没事……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6179
translate chinese freyapantstease_54eff007:

    # a "You don't sound okay to me. The usual energy in your voice isn't here. What's the matter?"
    a "我可不信。你的声音一点精气神都没有。怎么了？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6180
translate chinese freyapantstease_6a291220:

    # mc "Mhh... Nothing... Maybe I'm just too tired... It's been rather hectic at the burger shack recently..."
    mc "嗯……没事……可能我就是太累了……最近汉堡店里太忙了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6181
translate chinese freyapantstease_8c6bfff0:

    # a "Hmmm... Are you sure? The last time you came back home really tired but you were still fine..."
    a "嗯……真的吗？你上次回来也很累，但也不像今天这样……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6182
translate chinese freyapantstease_bb6ec0c6:

    # mc "And well... Too many problems inside my head... I'm pretty much just forcing myself to sleep right now..."
    mc "还有……呃……我有很多问题想不明白……我现在差不多是在逼着自己睡觉……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6183
translate chinese freyapantstease_b9afff6c:

    # a "Yeah, I figured that much. Everyone may not have noticed during dinner, but I saw you seemed to be staring into the distance."
    a "对啊，我就想着会是这样。其他人在吃晚饭的时候可能没有注意，但我发现你一直双目无神地盯着远方。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6184
translate chinese freyapantstease_a7bcf340:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6185
translate chinese freyapantstease_997bba4c:

    # yt "She is quite observant to have noticed those details..."
    yt "她居然细心到能注意到这种细节……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6186
translate chinese freyapantstease_d92603fe:

    # a "You can tell me your problems, [mc!t]. We can talk about it if you want them off your chest."
    a "你可以跟我说说你的烦恼，[mc!t]。如果你想倾诉的话，我可以陪着你。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6187
translate chinese freyapantstease_71d09c04:

    # mc "Thanks... I appreciate that... but... probably not right now... I just want to go to sleep..."
    mc "谢谢……我很感激……但是……现在还是算了吧……我只想赶快睡觉……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6188
translate chinese freyapantstease_569e51af:

    # mc "Although... all these things inside my head... won't let me..."
    mc "虽然……我脑子里的各种问题……让我根本睡不着……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6190
translate chinese freyapantstease_a10306c4:

    # yt "This could be a perfect opportunity to talk to her, but... damn... I'm just not in the right state of mind to do it..."
    yt "现在是个跟她说话的大好机会，但是……操……我的精神状态太差了……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6191
translate chinese freyapantstease_355d265e:

    # yt "I already have a lot to think about already... but Sky being angry at me is another thing."
    yt "我已经有不少事要烦了……但斯凯生我的气，比其他事都要严重得多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6192
translate chinese freyapantstease_51ccd48c:

    # yt "We've been living together since we were kids and we usually don't come to this point where we aren't talking to each other..."
    yt "我们从小就一直在一起，但几乎不会像现在这样，闹矛盾到冷战的地步……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6193
translate chinese freyapantstease_2c03df2e:

    # yt "Knowing that we are not fine, is just hitting me hard..."
    yt "所以我受的打击很大……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6196
translate chinese freyapantstease_1f9a6304:

    # a "Look, get up and come here."
    a "起来吧，来我这。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6199
translate chinese freyapantstease_baf5d066:

    # mc "Hm? But why?"
    mc "啊？为什么？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6200
translate chinese freyapantstease_57f14d2f:

    # a "Come. It's my turn to comfort you."
    a "来吧。轮到我安慰你了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6201
translate chinese freyapantstease_385d8e1c:

    # a "I'm always selfishly asking you to comfort me, but I've never returned the favor. And I just think this is the right thing to do."
    a "我一直自私地要求你安慰我，但是从来没有报答过你。我觉得现在我必须回报你了。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6202
translate chinese freyapantstease_1fbfef9e:

    # mc "Okay... but, what do you want me to do...?"
    mc "好吧……但是，你想让我怎么做呢……？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6203
translate chinese freyapantstease_d2464f62:

    # a "Just lean on my chest and close your eyes. Then, try and just think about me and me alone, not what's inside your head right now."
    a "靠在我的胸上，闭上眼睛就好。然后，只用想着我就可以了，不要去想其他的事情。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6204
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354_4:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6205
translate chinese freyapantstease_35831707:

    # mc "Okay then..."
    mc "好吧……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6208
