    # a "There you go... *giggles*"
    a "真乖…… *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:6209
translate chinese freyapantstease_3364907e:

    # a "How does that feel?"
    a "感觉怎么样？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6210
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354_5:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6213
translate chinese freyapantstease_d101d019:

    # mc "It's soft..."
    mc "很软……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6214
translate chinese freyapantstease_7cafce5e:

    # a "*giggles* Is it?"
    a "*笑* 是吗？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6215
translate chinese freyapantstease_9d3125bf:

    # mc "You're not embarrassed about this? You usually react whenever I do something... well... not proper to you."
    mc "你不觉得害羞吗？我对你做一些……呃……不合适的事情的时候，你的反应都很大的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6218
translate chinese freyapantstease_ac742d58:

    # a "Well, that's the thing. You already saw me naked, you already touched them. What more is there to be embarrassed about?"
    a "嗯，你说到点子上了。你已经看过我光着身子了，也已经摸过我的胸了。那我还有什么好害羞的呢？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6219
translate chinese freyapantstease_cb56ada4:

    # mc "Hmn... You're a lot more open-minded than I thought you would be."
    mc "嗯……你比我想的要开放得多。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6220
translate chinese freyapantstease_5792a21d:

    # a "I might be a conservative old-school kind of woman, but I know where and when I should be like that."
    a "我可能确实是个传统又保守的女人，但我也知道什么时候该有不同的表现。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6221
translate chinese freyapantstease_cc1d056d:

    # a "And I don't think this is the time."
    a "我觉得现在就没必要那么保守。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6222
translate chinese freyapantstease_a78833d9:

    # mc "That's good to know. I don't want to get slapped by you again. That hurts, you know?"
    mc "那就好。我可不想再被你打耳光了。可真是疼得很啊。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6225
translate chinese freyapantstease_3ad2e1ee:

    # a "You took the reward without any permission, what did you expect me to do? *giggles*"
    a "你没经过我同意就想饱眼福，以为我会有别的反应吗？ *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:6226
translate chinese freyapantstease_e383e654:

    # a "And I guess you did like that, didn't you?"
    a "而且你应该也很喜欢吧？"

# game/ep6.rpy:6227
translate chinese freyapantstease_0622f65c:

    # mc "For a gobsmacking slap in return? It's not worth the trouble, really."
    mc "假如看一眼要被狠狠扇一巴掌作为代价的话，还是免了吧，真的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6230
translate chinese freyapantstease_82d153ac:

    # a "My, my..."
    a "好啦，好啦……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6231
translate chinese freyapantstease_ba5ff723:

    # a "That's enough talk for now. Just go to sleep and hope that tomorrow, everything will be better."
    a "聊得够多了。现在，快睡觉吧。希望明天一切都能好起来。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6232
translate chinese freyapantstease_f3337617:

    # mc "Mhm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ep6.rpy:6233
translate chinese freyapantstease_9d827837:

    # a "Now wrap your arms around me."
    a "伸手，抱住我吧。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6236
translate chinese freyapantstease_3b21f354_6:

    # mc "......"
    mc "......"

# game/ep6.rpy:6237
translate chinese freyapantstease_0588b86e:

    # mc "...Can you manage to get out of there though? I know I'm pretty heavy."
    mc "……那你待会能从我怀里出来吗？我还挺重的。"

# game/ep6.rpy:6238
translate chinese freyapantstease_27ba0de7:

    # a "Yeah, I think I can manage. I'll even put you down properly if you want. *giggles*"
    a "没事，我应该有办法。你要是想的话我还能让你躺好呢。 *笑*"

# game/ep6.rpy:6239
